window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4901,"title":"Chapter 4901: The Cruel Instructor Ye","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t give Gao Xiao a chance to stand up. She quickly retracted her leg and jumped. She sat on Gao Xiao’s back and pressed her hand against the back of her neck.","Gao Xiao had no way of retaliating. She could only be reprimanded from the start to the end.","\"Is that all you can do?!\"","Ye Jian pressed the back of Gao Xiao’s neck with one hand. Her entire face was pressed against the rough and uneven ground. The small and angular gravel stabbed into Gao Xiao’s right cheek. The burning pain caused tears to flow out of Gao Xiao’s eyes.","\"Who’s Qiu Tong? She’s your comrade. She would put her life in your hands. But you, you actually dared to swing your dagger at her! Gao Xiao, do you want to kill someone? Let’s see if you have the ability! Let’s see if you can kill someone or if you’ll get killed instead!\"","The dagger that landed in Ye Jian’s hand brushed past the tip of Gao Xiao’s nose and stabbed into the ground.","She used too much strength, and her speed was extremely fast. When the dagger cut through the surface of the gravel, the fine gravel splattered on Gao Xiao’s face. It was like glass shards that exploded and splattered everywhere. In an instant, it added a few small wounds to Gao Xiao’s face.","Gao Xiao’s gaze trembled because of Ye Jian’s words. Comrade... Even if she had a personal grudge with Qiu Tong, they were still comrades.","And she used the dagger that was meant to kill her enemy... to swing it at her comrade.","The dagger stabbed into the ground. Ye Jian moved her hand away from the back of Gao Xiao’s neck and stood up from her back. \"Your tears are worthless. They won’t move me.","\"Stand up and continue!\"","The female soldiers couldn’t watch anymore. They asked the squad leader, Yang Zhen, for help. They hoped that the squad leader would stop them.","Yang Zhen didn’t make a move. She said to the female soldiers, \"This is a warning to Gao Xiao. She has to know who we use knives and guns against.","\"Since she dared to stab her comrade with a dagger, she must be severely punished!\"","As a first lieutenant, Yang Zhen used to be a leader too. She knew how serious Gao Xiao’s mistake was. Now, Instructor Ye didn’t report it and was only punishing her. She was already exceptionally lenient!","Persuade her?","Well, no one could persuade Gao Xiao to make her lower her head and admit her mistake!","Gao Xiao, who had blood stains all over her left side, bit her lip. Even though her arm was so sore that she felt as if she was holding a hundred kilograms of weight and she couldn’t even raise her hand slightly, she picked up her dagger again and pounced on Ye Jian.","Every part of her body hurt. Her entire body hurt, even her bones. However... she didn’t have a chance to speak. She could only pick up the dagger again and again and swing it again and again.","Half an hour later, Gao Xiao, who had been thrown many times, no longer had the strength to get up. She didn’t even have the strength to hold the dagger in her hand. She laid on the ground and swallowed her dry throat. She looked at the instructor who was looking down at her and said in a hoarse voice, \"Instructor, I...\"","Ye Jian knew what she wanted to say, but she didn’t want to hear it.","She turned around and faced the female soldiers who were filled with fear for her. She gave the order, \"Rows one and three, turn back!\"","To facilitate the formation, Ye Jian asked the 19 female soldiers to split into four groups of five.","Swoosh!","The command was given. The female soldiers in rows one and three turned around quickly and faced their comrades in rows two and four. As Ye Jian gave the command, everyone heaved a sigh of relief.","Was Gao Xiao’s punishment... over?","It wasn’t over!","Ye Jian said calmly, \"Take the daggers in your hands and stab your comrades who have their backs facing you! Let Gao Xiao see what punishment everyone will receive because of her mistake!\""]},{"number":4902,"title":"Chapter 4902: Wrong","paragraphs":["Gao Xiao dared to pull out her dagger to stab her comrade with a killing move, yet these female soldiers didn’t even have the courage to draw out their daggers.","How could they... How could they stab their comrades in the back? How could they?","Even Yang Zhen couldn’t take it anymore. As the squad leader, she finally opened her mouth and said, \"Instructor, we know our mistake! Please give us a chance to correct it! We only need just one chance! Just this once!\"","The squad leader’s words made the female soldiers hopeful. Yes, yes, yes! They only needed one chance to correct themselves. This was the only time. They wouldn’t do it again.","There was no room for discussion. Ye Jian just stared at them coldly. She used her facial expression to tell all the female soldiers that she didn’t want to give them a chance.","If they were all new recruits who had just joined the company less than a month ago, then she might forgive them and give them a verbal warning.","But they weren’t!","They were all veterans!","There were even two second lieutenants and a first lieutenant among them!","The other female soldiers had served more than two years in the military and had already memorized the rules!","The company punishment was to let Gao Xiao and all the female soldiers remember that if one made a mistake, the entire class would be punished. There would be no exceptions.","Gao Xiao, who was lying on the ground, was furious. She didn’t have the strength to stand up anymore. She crawled to Ye Jian’s side. At this moment, there was no longer any determination on her face. There was only regret! She really regretted it!","She begged bitterly, \"Instructor, I was wrong. I was wrong! Please don’t punish them! I know my mistake!\"","Facing Gao Xiao’s pleading, Ye Jian didn’t even look at her. She turned to the female soldiers who didn’t even have the courage to take out their daggers. She was unmoved and gave another order, \"Besides Qiu Tong, the rest of you, listen to my orders! On the count of three, swing your daggers!\"","It was the duty of soldiers to obey orders. Even if the female soldiers didn’t have the courage, they had to pull out their daggers and swing them at their comrades.","\"Haven’t you eaten? Have you all become weaklings? Are you playing tricks?\"","Ye Jian’s cold voice entered the female soldiers’ ears. There was no way to avoid it. They could only swing their daggers.","\"Ah!\"","\"Ha!\"","The shouts of the female soldiers sounded in the small sports ground. When Company Commander Zhu, who was passing by, saw this, he gritted his teeth. Battalion Commander Tian smiled. \"Not bad, not bad. The female soldiers are good at enduring hardships. They’re far beyond my expectations. Zhu Zhongguo, you have to learn from these female soldiers. Look at them. Their shouts are earth-shattering. They give me goosebumps.\"","The company commander replied, \"From today onward, the male soldiers will run five kilometers with weights every day.\"","The soldier at the side couldn’t help but open his mouth wide. Didn’t he say that they would run three kilometers with light weights half an hour ago? Why did it suddenly become five kilometers?","Battalion Commander Tian thought for a moment before replying, \"There’s no need to run five kilometers with weights every day.\"","That was right, that was right. If they ran five kilometers with weights every day, it would be horrible! The soldier who was following the company commander all the way was so touched by Battalion Commander Tian’s wisdom that he kept nodding.","\"Why are you nodding your head?\"","Not understanding the real situation, Company Commander Zhu was shocked by the female soldiers’ training posture. Company Commander Zhu slapped the back of the soldier’s head with his iron palm and said with a heartbroken expression, \"Battalion Commander, it’s not that I don’t think it’s an unreasonable arrangement, but... do you think you’ll be happy if the male soldiers in our battalion get beaten up by the female soldiers half a year later? Won’t you be embarrassed?\"","No, the soldier lost all hope now!","Battalion Commander Tian immediately added, \"Change it to running every other day. Overexertion is just as bad as deficiency.\"","\"Okay, I’ll listen to you,\" the company commander agreed readily, afraid that Battalion Commander Tian would change his mind again."]},{"number":4903,"title":"Chapter 4903: Heart Of Stone","paragraphs":["Hence, it was happily decided that the male soldiers would run five kilometers every other day.","The soldier rubbed the back of his head that was hurting and said to the battalion commander with a bitter expression, \"Battalion Commander, half an hour ago, the company commander said that we would run three kilometers with light weights. Now, we have to run five kilometers with weights. He changed his mind too quickly.\"","This caused Battalion Commander Tian to laugh loudly. \"Can’t you tell? Your company commander must have been stimulated by the hardworking female soldiers.\"","\"Young man, only through hardships can one surpass others. Why are there so many male soldiers who can’t defeat the female soldiers? Look at what they’re doing and look at the time. If the female soldiers lose to you guys after training like this, it wouldn’t be the company commander who gets angry but Instructor Ye.\"","As expected, the back of the soldier’s head was slapped by Company Commander Zhu’s iron palm again. ’Young brat, you still have the cheek to say that!’","The soldier who had been slapped twice became obedient. If he dared to say anything else, he would be kicked by Company Commander Zhu.","Ye Jian didn’t know that her punishment for Gao Xiao had left a strong impact on Company Commander Zhu. Seeing the female soldiers not using enough strength and trying to get away with it, Ye Jian simply picked up some stones and threw them at the female soldiers with incredible precision. After a few rounds, the female soldiers dared not play any tricks anymore.","Gao Xiao was crying badly. She was almost hugging Ye Jian’s leg. \"It’s my fault. It’s my fault! Instructor, it’s my fault! Please ask them to stop. It’s all my fault. It has nothing to do with them! It’s all my fault! It’s all my fault!\"","Before the order to stop was given, the female soldiers who were fighting with their daggers couldn’t stop. Gao Xiao could only watch and couldn’t do anything. Even if it was a request, she couldn’t fulfill it.","Qiu Tong was no exception. She knew that Gao Xiao was in the wrong and knew that she was in the wrong too. Now, the instructor wanted her and Gao Xiao to watch as their comrades were punished because of them. This was a hundred times worse than being punished themselves!","Qiu Tong couldn’t hold it in anymore. She ran over and stood beside Ye Jian. She shouted, \"Instructor, I was wrong! Gao Xiao and I have already realized our mistake. Please punish us!\"","\"Yes, Instructor, I was wrong. I was wrong. Please punish me, okay? Punish me alone, okay?\"","Gao Xiao, who had no way out, wiped her tears and got up with difficulty. Ye Jian had kicked her legs many times, so she didn’t even have the strength to stand properly. When she staggered up, Qiu Tong was the one who held her quickly. With Qiu Tong’s help, Gao Xiao finally stood up.","\"Instructor, please punish me severely! I will never do it again! I will never target Qiu Tong again! I promise I will never do it again!\"","Gao Xiao, who had to lean on Qiu Tong’s body to stand up, promised again. Seeing that Ye Jian didn’t have any reaction and was still looking at her coldly, Gao Xiao turned around and faced Qiu Tong. Her eyes were red as she apologized sincerely, \"Qiu Tong, I’m sorry! Please forgive me for what I did. Please forgive me.\"","After she finished speaking, Gao Xiao bowed deeply.","Qiu Tong hurriedly helped Gao Xiao up. Her eyes were filled with tears as she replied in a choked voice, \"No, no, no. You didn’t let me down. I was in the wrong first. I should’ve explained things to you first. I shouldn’t have chosen to escape after everything happened and let you handle all the problems alone.","\"I’m sorry. I should be the one apologizing. I’m sorry, Gao Xiao. Please forgive me for hurting you in the past. I’m sorry, I’m sorry.\""]},{"number":4904,"title":"Chapter 4904: Remember","paragraphs":["Qiu Tong’s words made Gao Xiao blame herself even more. How could she use force on her comrade because of a liar?","How could she?","Gao Xiao, who was crying until she choked, held Qiu Tong’s wrist tightly. Her voice was completely hoarse as she cried uncontrollably. \"No, no. It’s my fault.","\"I should’ve listened to your explanation. It’s not your fault. It’s all that bastard’s fault. He lied to me and you. We’re both victims.","\"I was too narrow-minded. I couldn’t vent my anger on that bastard, so I could only vent all my anger on you.","\"I’m sorry. I’m sorry. I hope you can forgive me.\"","The two of them, who were once incompatible with each other, were punished, and their comrades were implicated by them. Finally, one of them could muster the courage to explain while the other could listen to the explanation calmly and understand that it wasn’t the other party’s fault.","Although Ye Jian was relieved that the biggest problem was solved, her anger didn’t disappear.","She asked Qiu Tong to help Gao Xiao stand at the side to watch as their comrades held their knives and stabbed each other. When she saw that the two of them were crying and swaying, Ye Jian ordered all the female soldiers to stop.","Twenty minutes had passed. The camouflage cotton clothes on the female soldiers were cut by the sharp daggers, revealing the thermal layer. The moment they heard the command, all their strength disappeared. They didn’t even have the strength to put the daggers back into their sheaths.","Qiu Tong supported Gao Xiao. The two of them staggered and cried as they walked toward their comrades who were implicated. Ye Jian, who was watching from the side, heard the two of them apologizing to their comrades and hugging them along the way.","\"It doesn’t matter, but the two of you can’t make the same mistake again. Especially Gao Xiao. Every time you provoked Qiu Tong, she would give in to you. You were simply pushing your luck. You deserve a heavy punishment.\"","\"Stop crying. You’re so ugly. Do you want to make me laugh with how ugly you look? It’s fine. It’s just a few cuts on our clothes. It’s fine. We’re not hurt.\"","\"Do you regret it now? You even stabbed Qiu Tong with a dagger. I thought the instructor’s punishment was too light for you.\"","\"The grudges between the two of you will end today. Remember not to play with your lives like today. I’m the oldest among all of you. Alas, I’m old. My heart couldn’t help but tremble.\"","Gao Xiao’s apology was exchanged for the forgiveness of his comrades. Not only were they not angry, but they also comforted Gao Xiao, who was crying until she was out of breath.","\"Oh my god, look at how badly you’re crying. Those who don’t know might think that we’re ganging up to bully you. Stop crying. You look like a clown. Your face is all black and yellow. I want to laugh when I see you like this.\"","A female soldier couldn’t help but laugh when she saw Gao Xiao crying until she almost fainted.","Ye Jian gave all the female soldiers five minutes to rest. When the five minutes were up, her cold voice was heard again. It was a simple and effective command. \"Gather.\"","The squad leader, Yang Zhen, stood up immediately and shouted, \"Everyone, gather! Hurry!\"","After a series of footsteps, the 19 female soldiers gathered. Yang Zhen clenched her fists and ran to Ye Jian’s side. Then, she stood at attention and saluted. \"Reporting, Instructor. There should be 20 people in the female soldier class. All 20 are accounted for. Please give your instructions.\"","\"Return to the team.\"","\"Yes!\" Yang Zhen jogged back to the line.","At this moment, almost an hour had passed since Gao Xiao stabbed her knife at Qiu Tong. Gao Xiao, who was reprimanded by Ye Jian, stood in the line and kept praying that it would end quickly. She didn’t want to see her comrades implicated because of her anymore."]},{"number":4905,"title":"Chapter 4905: Group","paragraphs":["Ye Jian wasn’t aware of Gao Xiao’s tortured thoughts. The first part of the punishment had ended. It wasn’t over yet. She wanted to tell all the female soldiers that they were a group, an inseparable group. They had to have a collective spirit.","They also knew that they had made a mistake, so everyone had to be punished. They had to be aware of themselves at all times and remind themselves that they were not an individual but a group!","They would share blessings and suffer together. Even as an instructor, Ye Jian was no exception.","They immediately went back to their rooms to pack their luggage. They would all carry weights and run for 30 kilometers. They would camp in the desert until they returned to the camp the next day in time for breakfast!","As for dinner, there was no need!","Xia Jinyuan had been paying attention to the situation of the female soldiers. He even saw Ye Jian leaving the camp with 20 female soldiers. Battalion Commander Tian told him that the female soldiers were carrying weights for a 30-kilometer cross-country trip tonight. They were camping in the desert.","After he finished speaking, he pondered for a moment. Battalion Commander Tian continued, \"Do you want to give it a try too? The temperature in the desert at night is -20 degrees Celsius. This is their first time going out. I’m really worried.","\"There won’t be a problem with Instructor Ye. She has undergone desert training before. As for other female soldiers... it’s indeed worrying.\" Xia Jinyuan was indeed a little worried. Before he could say that he could bring the male soldiers to give it a try, Company Commander Zhu ran over from afar.","He ran over. Before he could catch his breath, he said, \"Battalion Commander, I just heard that the female soldiers are carrying weights for a 30-kilometer cross-country trip? They’re even camping in the desert and won’t rush back until tomorrow morning! What about us? Should we go too?\"","\"It’s good that you’re here. I have the same intention too. Let Captain Xia bring the 20 male soldiers along so that we can take care of each other.\" Battalion Commander Tian didn’t know what Company Commander Zhu wanted to say and simply suggested, \"Both sides will be training together. Why don’t we get the male soldiers to carry the weights together as well?\"","This time, Company Commander Zhu didn’t voice against the battalion commander. He thought for a moment and nodded. \"Sure. The male soldiers under Captain Xia are all elites of our camp. It’s indeed reassuring for them to go along.\"","As it turned out, Company Commander Zhu ran over because he was worried about the female soldiers.","Less than 15 minutes after Ye Jian left with 20 female soldiers, Xia Jinyuan left with the male soldiers so that they could take care of each other.","As for what happened in the female soldier class, Battalion Commander Tian didn’t say anything when he found out. He didn’t have any objections to Ye Jian’s decision either. He even said to Commissar Tang, \"Instructor Ye is quite cold-hearted. That’s how one should do it.\"","\"She even dared to swing a dagger at her comrade. If we don’t educate her properly, who knows how much trouble she’ll cause in the future?\"","\"Since Instructor Ye has punished her severely and has no intention of reporting it, let’s pretend that we don’t know about this. She has full authority to handle it.\"","Commissar Tang raised his objections, \"We can’t pretend that we don’t know anything, and we can’t just let it go. We can’t avoid criticism. We can’t encourage a bad atmosphere. We can’t leave any hidden dangers.","\"Shall we discuss it together after Instructor Ye is back? We can’t go past her, right?\"","Commissar Tang nodded. \"Yes, we should discuss it with her.\"","On the other hand, Xia Jinyuan, who had caught up with Ye Jian, said to her, \"You can’t just deal with it in class. Gao Xiao’s mistake isn’t simple. If she had only used her fists, you could deal with it in your class without reporting it.","\"However, she used a dagger. It can be seen as intentional murder or injury. The situation is serious. If you only handle it in your class, the battalion commander and political commissar won’t agree.\"","Ye Jian lacked experience in these matters. Xia Jinyuan needed to remind her."]},{"number":4906,"title":"Chapter 4906: Accompany","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was unwilling to report it. She pursed her lips and said in a low voice, \"Do I have to report it? Gao Xiao has admitted to her mistake with a good attitude and knows that she’s in the wrong. I’ve punished her... Is that enough?\"","\"No, you have to report it. You don’t have to worry too much. Although the mistake was serious, fortunately, no one was hurt. You handled it well. I hope that the company commander won’t punish Gao Xiao severely. At most, he’ll report and criticize her in the camp.\"","It was just a report of criticism. There was nothing to worry about.","Ye Jian had been worried that Gao Xiao would be grounded for ten days to half a month.","Since it was just a reprimand, there was no need to worry.","With a plan in mind, Ye Jian carried her 20-kilogram backpack and ran at the front with Xia Jinyuan. As for Gao Xiao, who was beaten up by her, Ye Jian didn’t care about her. The female soldiers would take care of her.","Gao Xiao, who was being taken care of by her comrades, blamed herself and cried a few times. She swore in her heart that she would never make a mistake again, not even a small mistake.","The 30-kilometer cross-country run continued. The female soldiers took care of each other all the way. From the moment the sun hung up to the moment it set in the west, they kept going without any intention of stopping.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, who were at the front, didn’t stop. The female soldiers and male soldiers didn’t dare to stop either.","After walking for 20 kilometers, all the soldiers, including the male soldiers, needed to help each other. The two people at the front were still striding forward.","Xia Jinyuan was from the special forces. The male soldiers already knew about it, so they weren’t surprised.","What surprised the male soldiers was the female soldier instructor. She was actually able to follow Captain Xia closely. She didn’t even fall behind. She even competed with Captain Xia a few times, and she never fell behind!","The 30 kilometers were completed. They set up camp at 10:00 pm and arranged for the sentinels to be on guard. The rest of the soldiers rested on the spot. A male soldier asked Ye Jian what she trained in the military school and why she was better than the military school graduates he had seen. Xia Jinyuan smiled until his eyebrows were raised.","Why?","Of course, it was because Instructor Ye was a special forces soldier too!","However, he couldn’t say it.","Ye Jian replied that she just prolonged her training time. That was how she became like today.","No one would believe such an ordinary answer. Xia Jinyuan was the one who mediated for Ye Jian. \"Instructor Ye grew up in a family of soldiers. When she was young, she was taught by a Class A Master Sergeant. Even the Head would have to take the initiative to shake hands with him.","\"Her other instructor was also an outstanding retired soldier. He had good marksmanship. That’s why her marksmanship is so good.","\"The two seniors groomed her carefully. That’s why Instructor Ye got to where she is today. She started training when she was young. It wouldn’t make sense if she’s not good.\"","The female soldiers were dumbfounded. The male soldiers admired her.","It turned out to be like this!","This was the result of training since young. What kind of training did she have since she was young? This was the female soldiers’ question.","What training could she have done?","Xia Jinyuan answered for Ye Jian. He knew his girlfriend the best!","Ye Jian listened with relish.","Sometimes, she had to recall if it had happened. After recalling and confirming that it had happened, there was an indescribable sweetness in her heart.","She didn’t even take the training to heart. She didn’t expect Captain Xia to take it to heart and remember it so clearly.","However, there was a problem!","A female soldier suddenly asked, \"Captain Xia, why do you know so much about Instructor Ye?\"","That was right!","Why?"]},{"number":4907,"title":"Chapter 4907: Showing Off His Wife","paragraphs":["It had to be said that the female soldiers were more meticulous than the male soldiers. The male soldiers were envious of Ye Jian because she had started training since she was young.","While the female soldiers were asking Xia Jinyuan why he knew so much about Ye Jian, some male soldiers were asking Xia Jinyuan what kind of Class A Master Sergeant it was and what kind of outstanding retired soldier nurtured Ye Jian so diligently.","The female soldiers and male soldiers paid attention to different things.","While the female soldiers were also amazed, their thoughts were deeper and more careful.","As soon as the question was asked, even Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had always been quick to react, was stunned. His gaze subconsciously landed on Ye Jian, who was sitting opposite him. The female soldiers caught the crux of the matter!","Ye Jian was fine. She didn’t panic.","She believed that her man would be able to answer perfectly.","When her man looked over, Ye Jian, who was waiting for his reply, was stunned too. She immediately realized that her man was stunned by the question.","He was proud and liked to say things. Now, the female soldiers had asked the crux of the matter.","Xia Jinyuan’s long silence made the female soldier who asked the question nervous. She whispered, \"Is it inconvenient for you to say? If it’s inconvenient, don’t say it. I don’t mean anything else. I’m just asking.\"","Did she ask something she shouldn’t have? It was very likely that he was hiding a secret!","It would have been fine if the female soldier didn’t say anything. After she finished speaking... even the insensitive male soldiers in the company felt that something was wrong, let alone the other female soldiers.","Thanks to another male soldier who had asked a question, Xia Jinyuan had time to catch his breath. He smiled and said, \"It’s not inconvenient. I’m wondering if I should answer you or the male soldier first.\"","The female soldier immediately said, \"You can answer the male soldier’s question first. We also want to know what glorious deeds the two seniors who groomed Instructor Ye to be so outstanding have done.\"","A Class A Master Sergeant that was comparable to a national treasure was even harder to meet than the leaders of a country.","\"He was outstanding. That Class A Master Sergeant was familiar with all kinds of guns and ammunition. He knew every gun ever produced locally and abroad. The Type 95 that you’re holding in your hands was a result of his suggestion.","\"Tomorrow, I’ll ask your instructor to show off her skills. If you mix countless gun parts of different models together, she’ll be able to find all the gun parts she needs in one minute and assemble them in three minutes.","\"No need to make a fuss. It’s just the tip of the iceberg for your instructor. No one can win her when it comes to assembling a gun with your eyes closed. I lost to her too.\"","\"Woah!\"","\"How powerful!\"","\"Really? Instructor, when are you going to show us your skills?\"","\"We also have someone in the second battalion who can assemble guns with his eyes closed. He can accurately find the parts of the guns he needs from a pile of gun parts. When he revealed his skills, even the company commander was stunned. I didn’t expect instructor Ye to know the skill too!\"","As the male soldier said, there were many capable people in the military unit. There were also many capable people who could close their eyes to assemble guns and look for gun parts. It was just a matter of how long they took.","Xia Jinyuan’s interest was piqued. \"The second battalion is not far away from us. Let’s find an opportunity to have that person compete with Instructor Ye and see who’s better.\"","Ye Jian was already rubbing her forehead when she heard this. When she heard that there was a competition, she couldn’t hold it in anymore and hurriedly said, \"No, Captain Xia, you must not do anything. I don’t want to be put on the spot.\"","Ye Jian was a low-key person. She wasn’t like Xia Jinyuan, who was good at controlling the situation. Hence, when Xia Jinyuan kept showing off his wife, Ye Jian kept trying to hide."]},{"number":4908,"title":"Chapter 4908: Instructor Ye Is Amazing","paragraphs":["At this moment, she was already several dozen centimeters away from her original spot. If she moved any further, she would be completely out of Xia Jinyuan’s sight when he raised his eyes.","How could Xia Jinyuan not notice it? He smiled as he flaunted his wife. He tried his best to control his gaze as he looked at Ye Jian.","The female soldiers were smart. He couldn’t let them notice anything amiss.","The male soldiers were even more interested than Xia Jinyuan. As for why Xia Jinyuan was so familiar with Ye Jian, they had forgotten about it. They hounded after Ye Jian with smiles on their faces. \"Instructor Ye, you should compete with him.\"","\"There are many capable people in our division, but they’re not as comprehensive as you. Everyone has their own strengths. As for you, you’re good at everything. It’ll definitely be exciting!\"","Male soldiers valued martial arts. It was their nature. The military unit was a place where they fought to be the first. They respected the strong. Even though Ye Jian was a female soldier, it didn’t affect their admiration for Ye Jian.","Although they hadn’t seen Ye Jian show her skills, they believed Xia Jinyuan’s words without a doubt. This meant that Xia Jinyuan’s leadership skills were very strong.","They obeyed his every order.","Ye Jian felt a headache coming on, but she couldn’t put herself down. She smiled and said, \"If there’s a chance, I’ll definitely do it.\"","Three months had passed in half a year. In another three months, she would leave the northwest. How could they have a chance to compete?","Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan probably felt that he had flaunted his wife too much today. He slowly continued the topic, \"If there’s a chance, we can give it a go. I haven’t seen Instructor Ye display her skills in a long time.\"","A female soldier immediately replied, \"You haven’t seen Instructor Ye display her skills? On our first day here, Instructor Ye crushed everyone here. Doesn’t that count?\"","Xia Jinyuan laughed softly. He glanced sideways at his girlfriend who was having a headache. His deep voice floated into Ye Jian’s ears. \"That doesn’t count. Your instructor is too interesting. She’s like a treasure. You never know what you’ll find in the next second.\"","The male soldiers were so excited that they started screaming. They wished they could know how good Ye Jian was immediately.","Hearing the screams of the male soldiers, Ye Jian could only feel helpless. Why didn’t she realize that Captain Xia liked to talk about her so much in the past?","Didn’t he know how to talk about himself?","\"Captain Xia, stop talking. If you continue, I’ll want to hide.\" Helpless, Ye Jian could only give in to his boasting. She said to the male soldiers, \"It’s not impossible for me to show my hands, but there are conditions.\"","\"What condition?\" they asked in unison.","Ye Jian smiled and replied, \"If you lose, your training will be doubled. How about that?\"","What... Haha, forget it.","Captain Xia was already brutal enough. They didn’t expect instructor Ye to be so brutal too.","The instantly honest male soldiers made Xia Jinyuan laugh. He raised his leg and kicked the male soldier closest to him. He laughed and scolded, \"Aren’t you embarrassed?\"","\"Captain Xia, I’m not a bear. Double the training?! We only have five hours of rest every day. If we double the training... will we still have time to rest?\"","That was right. That was why they backed off. Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled.","Xia Jinyuan gave her a thumbs-up and sighed. \"Instructor Ye is amazing! You made my soldiers cower instantly.\"","Ye Jian cupped her fists. \"Captain Xia, you’re being humble.\"","Her tone was the most normal, and their relationship was the most innocent. No one could tell that there was something else going on between the two of them."]},{"number":4909,"title":"Chapter 4909: Something’s Not Right","paragraphs":["On the female soldier’s side, a few female soldiers looked at each other silently. Why... did they still feel that something was wrong?","Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong only dared to muster their courage now. Their gazes darted back and forth between Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan.","After looking around twice, Gao Xiao whispered to Qiu Tong and her comrades, \"I don’t see any problems. What about you?\"","They couldn’t see any problems and shook their heads subtly.","Qiu Tong tightened her cold-proof jacket and whispered, \"Captain Xia is so familiar with our instructor’s matters. Do you think there’s really nothing going on?\"","\"So, you saw through it?\" She asked with a smile.","After thinking for a moment, Qiu Tong replied, \"Just like you, I can’t tell. I don’t usually see Captain Xia having any close interactions with the instructor. Even when I do see them interact, they’re just nodding at each other and saying a few polite words. I don’t feel that they’re particularly close.\"","\"Let’s hear Captain Xia’s explanation.\" Gao Xiao decided and stopped discussing with her comrades in private. She secretly rubbed her sore and painful calf while listening attentively, afraid that she would miss a word.","Yang Zhen and the deputy squad leader heaved a sigh of relief when they saw that the two of them were able to sit down calmly and talk.","\"They’ve finally reconciled. I was afraid that they would’ve been reprimanded for nothing today and that in private, their relationship would still be the same, where they’re both ignoring each other.\" The deputy squad leader patted her chest and whispered.","They were all wearing thicker cold-resistant covers distributed during the winter outdoor training. When they sat down, they could put them on. At night, when they slept, they would zip up from head to toe. The covers would them into sleeping bags that could resist the cold.","At night, the cold wind in the desert was like an ice knife. It was not so cold that it hurt, but the coldness was felt in the bones. Yang Zhen came from Guangdong Province, and her hometown was in Hainan. This kind of weather was a destruction of her soul. Even though she had been exposed to the cold for more than a month, she still couldn’t take it.","She covered the cover tightly around her and curled her legs tightly. Her voice was trembling. \"Our instructor won’t give them a chance to continue making a fuss. I feel that from the start, when the instructor knew that the two of them didn’t get along, she started thinking about letting them break the ice.","\"However, the instructor didn’t expect Gao Xiao to use a knife. That’s why she was furious.\"","After she finished speaking, Yang Zhen rubbed her hands and sighed. \"I think pure anger is the one our instructor has. It’s different from mere shouting. She’s so calm that you can’t see all the undercurrents. It’s like the undercurrents at the bottom of the sea. You can’t see them, but they’re extremely dangerous.","\"Look at her during the day. She didn’t flare up at Gao Xiao at all, but when she reprimanded Gao Xiao, the killing intent on her body was unbearable. None of us even dared to speak.\"","As the squad leader, she was the same.","The deputy squad leader nodded lightly. \"That’s right. If she had been shouting, I don’t think I would’ve been so afraid. At least I’d know that she’s angry and what she’d do. Our instructor doesn’t shout or scold, so we can’t guess what she wants to do.","\"Although I’m two years older than the instructor, I didn’t know what to do at that time. I was stunned by her.\"","The two second lieutenants were a few years older than Ye Jian. The oldest female soldier was three and a half years older than Ye Jian. However, their age and qualifications were placed at the back. They didn’t want to mention these things.","Yang Zhen said, \"Yes, I’m the same as you. Especially when she trained Gao Xiao for half an hour. I had to really endure it. Only then did I know that as it turned out, our instructor is so good at fighting. She’s not even 22 years old yet.\"","The two of them became silent."]},{"number":4910,"title":"Chapter 4910: Born As A Human","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was born as a human, but she was very different.","Some people lived a luxurious life while others lived a rough life. Some worked hard to become people they could be proud of. Some lived hard lives until they died.","They were born different. Even their lives were different.","Yang Zhen and the deputy squad leader didn’t know about Ye Jian’s hardships in the past. They just thought that Ye Jian came from a good family based on what Xia Jinyuan said. Although she was usually silent, her thoughts were different.","The deputy squad leader broke the silence and said softly, \"It has a lot to do with the family environment. Captain Xia said that our instructor’s life mentor was a Class A Master Sergeant. He was an outstanding retired soldier. Who can be as lucky as the instructor?\"","\"Although she’s lucky, she had to work hard as well. Many people in my military unit relied on their family connections to survive. They’re like parasites. Our instructor is different. Look at her. She’s relying on her own ability.\"","\"That’s right. What I admire the most is that she doesn’t rely on her family and rely on herself. She’s far better than those who rely on their family connections to muddle through life.\" The deputy squad leader felt the same way. No matter where you were, there were people who relied on their families to muddle through life.","The conversation continued. As for why Captain Xia knew so much about Instructor Ye, as the male soldiers kept asking all kinds of questions, Xia Jinyuan consciously ignored that particular question. Until they fell asleep, the female soldiers didn’t hear any answers.","However, at that time, no one cared anymore. Even the female soldiers in the company seemed to have forgotten about it.","The night was quiet. The cold wind in the desert was still blowing wantonly. The two sentinels standing at the shelter held steel guns in their hands and looked straight ahead. Even though their lips were purple from the cold, they didn’t complain about being tired.","The sentinels were sent by the two classes of soldiers. One was a female soldier and the other was a male soldier. They took turns to guard the area for three hours. At midnight, when it was the coldest, the instructors of the second shift took over on time.","Even outside, the standard procedures for the sentry post handover were rigorously completed.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian saluted the two sentinels standing guard. The sentinels returned the salute.","\"Sentinels, please stand guard!\"","\"Everything is normal. Please stand guard!\"","\"Yes!\"","The two sentinels finished their work. Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian stood guard from 1:00 am to 5:00 am. It was then time to return to the camp.","This wasn’t the first time the two of them stood guard together, but it was the first time since Ye Jian graduated. The two of them stood back to back and occasionally chatted to relieve their fatigue.","Although the desert was cold, the sky was filled with stars. The stars were shining resplendently. The faint cyan starlight revealed the undulating lines of the desert mountains in front of them. The sky was black and the earth was yellow. The universe was desolate. The sun and moon were shining brightly. This was the future.","There was a faint sound in the wind. It was the sound of two sentinels entering their sleeping bags. When peace returned, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was standing guard, turned his head and looked at Ye Jian, whose back was facing him. Then, he took a step back with his long legs. He didn’t stop until he was close to Ye Jian’s back.","Ye Jian, who was standing guard and looking straight ahead, said helplessly, \"Captain Xia, stand guard.\"","\"Talking won’t affect our guard duty.\" Xia Jinyuan, who was scanning the surroundings, spoke in a low voice. Although his gaze was cold, his voice was a little warm. \"Were you very nervous just now? Were you angry?\"","He was referring to the question that the female soldier asked him.","Ye Jian thought for a moment before smiling. \"I wasn’t nervous. I knew you’d handle it. Was I angry? No, I was just... a little unaccustomed to it. However, I believe that you did it for a reason. Hence, although I wasn’t used to it, I could accept it.\"","Wasn’t it easy to deal with? He didn’t answer the female soldier in the end."]},{"number":4911,"title":"Chapter 4911: Political","paragraphs":["As for the reason why Xia Jinyuan wanted to do it, Ye Jian believed that he would give her an answer—an answer that she could accept.","Because he understood her better than anyone else.","The unreasonable trust made Xia Jinyuan smile.","\"You trust me so much? Weren’t you afraid that I’d say that I had known you for eight years?\" Xia Jinyuan smiled until his black eyes seemed to be shining brightly. He sighed and said, \"Eight years. I’ve known you for eight years.\"","Eight years. How many days and nights were that? But it all felt like yesterday?","That year, they met in the mountains. That year, Ye Jian was still under 14 years old and was still a clueless Grade Eight student. Now, Ye Jian had already graduated from the military school and became an active-duty officer. She was leading a group of female soldiers who might become the first female soldier of the special forces in the country. She carried a heavy responsibility and carried the hopes of the higher-ups of the military.","From an ignorant little girl who stumbled forward and was even confused about her future, to an active officer who had a clear direction and a clear goal, Xia Jinyuan could be said to be Ye Jian’s witness.","He had seen her in her most disheveled and tiring state. He had also seen her in her most glorious state.","They had too many things in common and too many common topics. Even though they were in the same military unit, they didn’t interact much in private. Even when they met, they only nodded in greeting. However, the two of them were connected. They were already very satisfied with just a short eye contact.","It had been eight years. Ye Jian had known Captain Xia for eight years. There was warmth in Ye Jian’s eyes. She hummed softly. \"It’s been eight years. It always felt like I’ve just met you not long ago.\"","\"I also feel that I haven’t known you for long. If Old Xia hadn’t reminded me two days ago, I wouldn’t have thought that I had known you for eight years.","\"I said many things tonight, but I didn’t tell you about it in advance. Fortunately, you’re not angry. If not, I would’ve needed to think of a way to make you happy.\"","\"Then I’ll say that I’m angry. You can coax me now.\" Ye Jian immediately smiled. \"I really want to know how you’ll coax me.\"","\"I’ll coax you until you forgive me. I’ll coax you until you’ll only smile when you see me and won’t be angry. I haven’t thought of the exact method yet.\"","Now... Ye Jian was being coaxed by Lieutenant Colonel Xia until the corners of her lips couldn’t help but curl up. \"Then what’s the reason that you kept talking about me.\"","Xia Jinyuan specially looked behind him. After confirming that there was no movement, he lowered his voice and told Ye Jian the real reason.","\"To build a foundation for the future, it’s impossible for us to stay in the brigade forever. When we reach a certain age, we’ll definitely leave the brigade. At that time, it’s unlikely for us to retire directly. Instead, we’ll take another path, one that’s different from the one we’re taking now.","\"The foundation of the other path can’t be achieved in a day. It’s accumulated over time. Every cornerstone laid might help us walk another path in the future.\"","\"The considerations of those in power are things that you and I have never considered, and that also includes the considerations of our parents.\"","Commander Xia was already 62 years old. He would retire completely at most when he was 70 years old. Xia Jinyuan was six years older than Ye Jian. When the commander retired, Xia Jinyuan would leave his position as the captain of the Xueyu unit. Then, he would have to make arrangements for his future.","Moreover, Xia Jinyuan’s military rank was at most that of a senior colonel. Any higher and he would be a major general. There was a huge hurdle between a senior colonel and a major general. Countless senior colonels would stop there."]},{"number":4912,"title":"Chapter 4912: Complicated","paragraphs":["If Xia Jinyuan was like this, Ye Jian would be the same in the future. In that case, Commander Xia would have to make arrangements for his son and daughter-in-law’s future.","Commander Xia wouldn’t do this because of his connections. He would only remind Xia Jinyuan that once he reached a certain age, he needed to make plans for the future.","In the future, Commander Xia would consider their arrangements, their whereabouts, and their future promotions.","He wouldn’t interfere, but he wouldn’t let it go either.","The considerations of a politician were complicated and varied. Even if Ye Jian lived two lifetimes, she wouldn’t be familiar with the twists and turns.","After all, in her past life, Ye Jian was just an ordinary person. She had to worry about whether she would be chased away tomorrow. She wouldn’t be able to understand it even if she lived another lifetime.","What she lacked in her previous life, she needed to slowly make up for in this life.","Now that Xia Jinyuan had explained the reason clearly, Ye Jian still didn’t understand. She had to think about it carefully in her heart.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t ask Ye Jian immediately if she understood. After he finished speaking, he said, \"You can think about it slowly. Tell me when you understand. It’s only 2:10 am now. We have enough time.\"","Ye Jian thought about it carefully.","She just didn’t understand... What did her future development with Captain Xia have to do with the current military unit and female soldiers?","Fortunately, Ye Jian had good comprehension. After fighting with Ye Zhifan, she thought for less than ten minutes. Ye Jian whispered, \"Is it about... gaining supporters?\"","Just like how Xia Jinyuan didn’t make things too clear, Ye Jian didn’t have to explain the reason she thought of too clearly.","Xia Jinyuan naturally understood what she meant.","His thin lips curved slightly as he replied with an ’uh-huh’. The topic ended here. He had a plan in his heart and wouldn’t mention it again.","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief. She was impressed by Commander Xia’s long-term plan.","She thought about how she and Captain Xia would develop after leaving the brigade in the future. He was really far-sighted.","Captain Xia told her what the commander planned for the future. This meant that Captain Xia had the same plan.","The 22-year-old Ye Jian didn’t think for that long. She hadn’t even reached the Xueyu unit. How could she think so far ahead? There were still more than ten years.","This was the first time Ye Jian came into contact with politics and scheming. She was still a little agitated. Fortunately, the cold wind was cold enough. The wind made her calm down quickly and stop thinking nonsense.","After Xia Jinyuan finished talking about the most important thing, he didn’t speak to Ye Jian anymore. During the sentry period, the sentinels were prohibited from communicating. This was a rule.","At around 3:00 am, the two people standing in the cold wind tightened their grip on their rifles at the same time. At the same time, they said in a low voice, \"There’s movement.\"","The two of them quickly closed in on each other. Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice, \"Left front, two o’clock! Alert!\"","The rifle was immediately loaded with bullets. Xia Jinyuan quickly crawled and hid while Ye Jian hunched her back and left the sentry post. She needed to inform all the soldiers to be on guard.","At 3:00 am, there were footsteps in the desert. There were at least five of them!","Ye Jian woke up the squad leader, Yang Zhen. She said in a serious and cold voice, \"We hear movements. I’ll inform the male soldiers. Wake all the female soldiers up. Don’t make any movements.\"","Yang Zhen, who had opened her eyes, was no longer sleepy. \"Yes!\"","She immediately pulled the zipper of the cold-proof jacket and hugged the rifle that was warm. She woke her comrades up immediately.","In less than two minutes, 20 female soldiers and 20 male soldiers woke up. Their eyes were bright as they gathered around.","Five sets of footsteps were heading north. The launch base was in the north!"]},{"number":4913,"title":"Chapter 4913: Criminal","paragraphs":["Ever since the previous incident, the soldiers stationed in this restricted area were extremely vigilant. Even the slightest movement made them more vigilant than a rabbit. All of them reacted very quickly.","Although the female soldiers didn’t know what happened the last time, they knew that it was definitely abnormal for these people not to sleep in the middle of the night and run to the desert on such a cold day.","In that case, the soldiers would definitely catch them!","The 20 female soldiers were even more excited than the 20 male soldiers. They rubbed their fists and waited for their turn.","Xia Jinyuan only had two requests.","Firstly, capture them alive.","Secondly, be careful.","In the end, he would leave it to Ye Jian.","Ye Jian naturally wanted the female soldiers to act together. However, she didn’t know if the other party had any weapons. In addition, the other party was heading north. She didn’t have time to think too much. Three seconds after Xia Jinyuan signaled her to speak, Ye Jian said in a low voice, \"The soldiers will split into two. Leave six people to guard the luggage. The rest will intercept the enemy in front and confirm if they have weapons. If they do, Captain Xia and I will be the vanguard. The two groups of soldiers will surround and block them.\"","Confirm if the other party had weapons... The excited female soldiers’ hearts tightened.","Although they had served for many years, they had never met a criminal with guns and ammunition.","But who should they arrange to keep watch over their stuff?","There was no controversy between the three female soldiers and the three male soldiers. The six people left behind didn’t have any reason to object either. This place was equivalent to their rear. Someone had to guard their rear.","As it was only a 30-kilometer cross-country run, Ye Jian and the rest didn’t bring any individual communication equipment. Everyone only had a military localizer on them. Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan, the squad leaders, and the deputy squad leaders were all equipped with a walkie-talkie.","Ye Jian looked at the deputy squad leader with the walkie-talkie and reminded her to be careful. If she noticed anything amiss, she had to inform her first. Xia Jinyuan instructed the male soldiers to pay attention to their surroundings. If anything amiss happened, they would protect the female soldiers first. If they couldn’t contact him, they would send two people with a walkie-talkie to look for the main team.","Xia Jinyuan left behind a deputy squad leader with an intercom.","Ye Jian’s arrangements were the most conservative. They had no choice. Although they had bullets in their hands, they were all blank cartridges. They weren’t lethal at a long distance. If the other party had guns and ammunition, everyone, including her and Captain Xia, would be in danger.","In that case, she needed to ensure the safety of the soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan’s nod was also the greatest affirmation to Ye Jian. Naturally, he had no objections to her arrangements.","Confirming if the other party was armed was the most important thing to ensure the follow-up combat. It was also the first step that had to be completed. If they didn’t confirm anything and just rushed up with the soldiers to catch the other party, what would the consequences be?","No one would dare pay for those consequences.","After a short arrangement, the soldiers split into two groups. Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan brought their own soldiers and quickly headed north. They couldn’t delay for too long. The desert was too big. It was easiest for a few people to hide. They had to figure it out as soon as possible and act as soon as possible to avoid alerting the enemy and escaping.","In the desert, dozens of black shadows moved quickly in the direction of the suspicious people.","Under their feet were gravel of different sizes. If they were not careful, they would make a commotion. As instructors, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian naturally rushed to the front. It was up to them to test how many people there were.","Just by listening to the footsteps, they couldn’t confirm the number of people.","The two of them had worked together for many years and had a tacit understanding that could not be broken. They advanced quickly first, then alternately. The figures that kept moving forward under the faint starlight were strong and fierce, making the soldiers behind exclaim in their hearts."]},{"number":4914,"title":"Chapter 4914: Alas, Alas","paragraphs":["\"Quick, follow them!\"","\"Guard the back!\"","The soft voices reminded the soldiers of the two classes. The squad leader, Yang Zhen, hunched her back and followed Ye Jian’s path.","She led the team in front and left the rest to the squad leader of the male soldiers to guard the rear.","Every time Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan cooperated, they didn’t feel unfamiliar with each other.","The barren mountain range that was enveloped by the starlight was still silent. It rose and fell for an unknown number of years. A bone-chilling cold wind blew past, sweeping up a layer of sand on the ground.","The soldiers in the Su Province were not calm at this moment. Senior Colonel Nie Hongwei was sitting in the conference room and drinking strong tea. From time to time, he would stare at the three landline phones on the conference table. After putting down his teacup, he looked at the map on the big screen. He frowned and looked extremely serious.","\"How is it? Is there still no reaction from the other side?\" Senior Colonel Nie took another sip of strong tea and turned to ask a technical officer who was operating a computer, \"No reaction at all?\"","The technical officer replied, \"No reaction for the time being.\"","Senior Colonel Nie’s face turned dark again. There was no reaction at all! No reaction at all! Were the guys in the northwest all asleep?","The ’enemies’ had infiltrated the restricted areas of the military, but they hadn’t been discovered by a battalion or a regiment!","He was so angry!","Two days ago, the soldiers in the Su Province received a last-minute order from the Linbei Military District. The military sent a military unit into the desert in the hinterland of the northwest to test if the security in the important hinterland of the northwest was strict.","Senior Colonel Nie received the instructions and was quite confident in the regiment and battalion below him.","However, as there was no news from the hinterland of the northwest, the senior colonel’s firm confidence started to waver.","Why wasn’t there any news yet? They should have discovered it by now!","Senior Colonel Nie couldn’t sit still for even a minute. He had to rely on the strong and bitter tea to support himself. At the same time, he had to suppress the anger in his heart.","If... the people sent by the military weren’t discovered when they reached the base, all of them would bear the brunt of it!","At 3:24 am, ten minutes had passed since Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan noticed the footsteps. The two of them, who were lying on a high ground, stared at the five figures in front of them. Ye Jian only looked at them for a few seconds before heaving a sigh of relief. She lowered her voice and said, \"Captain Xia, have you contacted the team recently?\"","\"Ever since I came, I haven’t called back to the team.\" Xia Jinyuan lay on the cold ground with his palm on the ground. He looked at the five figures in front of him who had stopped moving. A hint of playfulness flashed past his eyes. \"It’s definitely not a good thing to sneak here. Since we’re all acquaintances, we shouldn’t appear. Let the soldiers behind us do it. It’s a good chance to practice.\"","Ye Jian strongly supported Xia Jinyuan’s suggestion. However, she had a better suggestion.","She leaned over and said a few words in a low voice. Xia Jinyuan narrowed his black eyes and raised his hand. He placed his palm on Ye Jian’s forehead and laughed softly. \"You’re even worse than me. Alright, let’s see if they can solve it themselves.\"","Ye Jian smiled until her eyes curved into crescents. How could she miss the opportunity to test the soldiers on their communication when it came right to her doorstep?","It depended on how the soldiers behind them handled it.","The black figures in the starlight were none other than the comrades from the Xueyu unit.","Four days ago, G3 of the Xueyu unit received an order from the military. He would lead the team into the northwest and break through the restricted areas of the northwest one by one.","As for the specific reason, G3 and the rest only understood why the military wanted to do this when they arrived."]},{"number":4915,"title":"Chapter 4915: To Be Green With Envy","paragraphs":["Three days ago, G3 led 20 special forces soldiers and split into four groups to enter the four restricted areas in the northwest. Today was the second night of their operation. They had been moving forward without being discovered.","However, they didn’t expect the captain, Q King, who appeared as carefree as though he was going on a holiday before he left the team, to be here too. He was very close to them.","He was ten meters away and could hear them if they were to shout. How could it not be close?","\"From here, we have to pass through the camp of the Vanguard Battalion. There are still about 30 kilometers left. We can go around here...\" The weak light shone on a military topographic map. G3’s finger quickly moved across the topographic map. \"We can’t go through their camp directly. We have to go around here and pass through this barren mountain to approach the target.","\"This barren mountain is a little difficult to walk on. There are many rolling stones, and the terrain is complicated. There’s a natural barrier. There’s a high chance of getting lost after entering. What do you think? Should we go around it?\"","K7 took a look and looked at Z7. Z7 could decide this.","Z7 looked at it again and again. Just as he was about to speak, he suddenly heard V8, who was in charge of guarding, shout, \"There’s movement. Hide!\"","The five of them slipped away faster than rabbits. They quickly found a place to hide and restrained their breathing as they stared at their surroundings.","The wind from the mountain range matched the silence of the night. It was like ghosts wailing and wolves howling. It was as if they were in a strange territory. The five people hiding pricked up their ears and listened carefully, but they realized that besides the sound of the wind, there was no other movement.","If there was no movement, it meant that there was a problem. V8 wouldn’t have heard wrong.","After about five minutes, Xia Jinyuan pointed at Z7’s hiding place to Ye Jian and made a hand gesture, indicating that he should go to Z7’s side.","Ye Jian nodded. The two people hiding moved toward Z7 first.","On the other hand, the male and female soldiers led by the squad leaders couldn’t find their instructors. They were in front, but they had lost them.","Yang Zhen whispered to the deputy squad leader beside her, \"We can’t stop. Continue searching until we find the suspicious people.\"","\"Okay!\" The deputy squad leader nodded. She asked worriedly, \"What about the instructor? What should we do?\"","\"They should’ve discovered other problems, but they can’t contact us right now.\" Yang Zhen wasn’t too worried about their instructors. Now, the problem was on their side.","She didn’t panic. Instead, she thought of a way to solve it.","The squad leader of the male soldiers also felt that they needed to continue searching and not stay still. He said to Yang Zhen, \"I’ll send two comrades to the nearest outpost. We have to inform the camp.\"","The instructors were nowhere to be seen, and the suspicious people were nowhere to be seen. Now, it was up to them to organize the operation.","The male soldiers and female soldiers quickly had a new combat plan. The inexperienced female soldiers were led by the male soldiers to continue searching. As for Z7, his face was covered in tears.","\"Aren’t the two of you too much? Why are you only staring at me? Didn’t you see that there are four other people? You’re too much!\"","Z7, who realized that something was wrong behind him and couldn’t dodge in time, was pounced on by Xia Jinyuan. As for the other four comrades, they watched silently as Z7 was pounced on.","It couldn’t be helped. He was the slowest to react!","The other comrades noticed it, but he didn’t. Heh, he was merely pounced on by Q King. He didn’t get beaten up directly.","No one paid attention to Z7’s ’complaints’. Instead, they were very interested in Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian.","T6 was envious. \"No wonder Q King was so carefree when he left. It turned out that he went to look for Azure Bird! Isn’t that right? Isn’t it?\""]},{"number":4916,"title":"Chapter 4916: Something Happened","paragraphs":["T6, who was stimulated, had a hideous expression on his face. It seemed that as long as Xia Jinyuan dared to answer with a ’yes’, he would go crazy from jealousy.","Xia Jinyuan patted the dust off his body and looked at T6 indifferently. He replied with an expression that said, \"I didn’t want to hurt you, but you asked for it.\"","\"It’s a vacation, and you two are spending it together!\" T6 felt his heart hurting so much that he couldn’t breathe. \"Shameless, too shameless!\"","Xia Jinyuan thought for a moment and felt that what T6 said made sense. He even nodded in agreement. \"That means that it’s indeed a holiday. Wherever Azure Bird is, every day is a holiday.\"","T6 wanted to vomit blood. He wanted to pounce on that annoying face and punch it a few times.","\"Shameless, too shameless!\"","T6 couldn’t beat him up, so he could only grit his teeth and say such things to vent the ’jealousy’ in his heart. He really wanted to spend the holidays with his fiancée who had already graduated!","Seeing this, Ye Jian silently reached out and poked Xia Jinyuan’s waist with one finger. She whispered, \"Captain Xia, enough is enough. If you continue, T6 won’t be the only one dissatisfied. Your comrades will want to beat you up too.\"","To be honest, seeing Captain Xia’s expression, even as his girlfriend, she wanted to beat him up, let alone their comrades.","K7 glanced coldly at his captain, who was still deeply intoxicated and deliberately attracting hatred. He slowly moved his footsteps and leaned closer to Ye Jian. His voice floated in the wind. \"Congratulations on graduating. You’re the only one missing from the team now.\"","It was a simple sentence, but Ye Jian’s heart skipped a beat.","She turned her head and smiled brightly at K7. \"There are still three months. I can report to the team in three months.\"","\"We’ll wait for you to return to the team.\" K7 pursed his lips. He wasn’t used to smiling. He had always been expressionless, so the muscles on his face seemed to be a little stiff. K7 thought that he was smiling.","Ye Jian was already used to it. The smile in her eyes got deeper. They were all waiting for her to return to the team.","Three months. Three more months.","V8 went to Ye Jian’s side and smiled. \"After knowing that you couldn’t return to the team immediately after graduation, our entire team wanted to call our boss.","\"After that, we found out that something had happened to you and you had to stay in school for the makeup exams. There were some procedures that had to be done, so we could only bear with it and bide our time.","\"The few days when Q King just returned to the team, it was as if he was going through menopause. He was unpredictable. One moment, he’s gloomy, and the next moment, he’s aloof. We suffered so much. We wanted to mail him to you to prevent us from suffering.","\"Three months ago, he was like a living King of Hell at night. In the end, he carried his backpack and waved at us with a big grin on his face. He left the team as if he was on vacation.","\"Tsk, Azure Bird, Azure Bird, you definitely haven’t been thinking about joining the team early in the past few months, right? Alas, we were worried about you. Who knew that we’d meet the two of you here? It’s so uncomfortable for us single people.\"","\"He’s the one who wants to be single,\" K7 added. There was so much information that Ye Jian could smell something amiss. She immediately smiled at K7 and said, \"Let’s have a good chat later.\"","He was the one who wanted to be single... There was definitely a situation!","V8, who was still talking confidently a second ago, seemed to have been strangled. He stammered for a while before saying, \"That’s not true. Don’t listen to K7’s nonsense.\"","\"I’m just telling the truth,\" K7 said calmly. \"I’ll tell you later.\" This was directed at Ye Jian.","V8 glared at him. \"I can say it myself. There’s no need for you to speak on my behalf!\""]},{"number":4917,"title":"Chapter 4917: Threat","paragraphs":["\"What are the three of you muttering about? Come over.\" Xia Jinyuan realized that there were still three people not beside him. He turned his head and saw three black shadows gathered together. He hurriedly signaled the three of them to come over.","\"It’s not a big deal. Azure Bird and I are both leading troops. Azure Bird’s mission is a little heavy. It’s not convenient to talk about it in detail. You just need to know that she’s leading troops.","\"After training these soldiers for three months, it’s time to test their results. The five of you can just be whetstones and train them.","\"I can tell at a glance that you’re up to no good, so doing this won’t be a problem.\"","Xia Jinyuan spoke softly, and G3 had a headache. \"Q King, we have a mission too. It’s a mission issued by the military. If you suddenly add to our problems, we’ll have a headache.\"","\"It’s just a headache. It’s not impossible to carry out. You sneaked over in the middle of the night and bypassed the camp and the outpost. I can guess why the military asked you to come over. It’ll probably be close to the mark, not far off.","\"Just continue walking. The soldiers in the northwest will continue searching. I’ve given them an order that you guys must be captured alive. Once they surround you, you can accompany them to practice. It won’t conflict with your mission. On the contrary, if you’re discovered by the northwest soldiers and surrounded, I think the military will be more willing to see this situation.","\"G3, you have to be kind. You can’t kick someone to the curb when they’ve outlived their usefulness. Although I’m not in the team now, I still have to return to the team. It won’t be long. Spring is warm and flowers are blooming. That’s the time for Azure Bird and I to return to the team.\"","This was a f*cking threat!","What else could he say? G3 couldn’t say anything.","He said angrily, \"We don’t want to be discovered by the northwest soldiers at all.\"","\"Azure Bird and I have already discovered you. The two of us are northwest soldiers now. If we really fought, would the five of you still be chatting with me? You would’ve been discovered and surrounded.\"","Xia Jinyuan was a stubborn person. After guessing the purpose of G3 and the rest’s trip, how could Xia Jinyuan give them a chance to reject him?","There would be no way out.","\"It doesn’t matter if you don’t cooperate. They’re not far away from you. Azure Bird and I will make some noise and you’ll be exposed now. As for me, I naturally won’t let you continue moving forward. Do as you deem fit.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Z7 slapped his forehead. \"We’re all unlucky to have met you. You even asked us to do as we see fit. Can we do as we see fit? How shameless you are!\"","Wasn’t he shameless?","T6 nodded with all his might. \"Shameless, shameless, too shameless!\"","\"Go ahead. I’ll give you ten seconds to consider.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia reached out his hand and cracked his knuckles one by one. Ye Jian saw that her five comrades were forced to breathe heavily and looked away guiltily.","That... idea was actually hers. Now, she could only let Captain Xia take the blame.","Ten seconds had not passed. G3, who had a headache, gritted his teeth and agreed.","If he could, he would’ve threatened him.","Xia Jinyuan smiled elegantly. \"You should’ve agreed long ago. I’ll leave it to the five of you. Azure Bird and I will rest for a while. We took over the sentry post at 2:00 am. It’s 3:35 am now. It’s up to you if we can return to the camp as planned at 5:00 am.\"","The comrades from the Xueyu unit were Xia Jinyuan’s soldiers, and the soldiers who completed the 30-kilometer cross-country run were his soldiers too. Xia Jinyuan decided not to help either side and let them deal with each other with their own abilities."]},{"number":4918,"title":"Chapter 4918: Shameless","paragraphs":["Ye Jian only wanted to give the female soldiers some practice. She didn’t consider anything else.","The male and female soldiers who didn’t give up on their search didn’t know that they were about to face a fierce battle. They searched for suspicious people while looking for the two instructors.","Afraid of alerting suspicious people, they didn’t even dare to use the walkie-talkies. They relied on their vision to search.","The male soldiers knew that there was a base in the north, so when they searched, they would use the base in the north as the center to increase the probability of finding suspicious people.","They male soldiers were familiar with each other. Even so, an hour had passed when they discovered G3 and the other five special forces soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan, who had been following them the entire time, was quite satisfied with this. \"G3 and the rest are elites. It’s already not bad that they used an hour to find G3 and the rest.","\"The female soldiers don’t have enough combat experience. It depends on how they cooperate. There are 34 of them surrounding five people. The chances of success are high.\"","Ye Jian said, \"I don’t know if the camp has discovered anything. The military sent G3 and the rest to step on the defense line. If they really reach the base, how would Battalion Commander Tian and the rest answer to the military? The entire Su Province would be in trouble.","\"In his position, he must bear the responsibility. If G3 and the rest really sneaked all the way to the base, it means that there’s indeed a huge and serious problem with the defense line. They’ll have to change everything.","\"The calamity is caused by their negligence. They can’t blame anyone else.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was analyzing calmly, didn’t think that it was a huge disaster. On the contrary, it was fortunate if they were able to discover the problem as soon as possible. It was better for his own people to discover the problem than for other countries to discover it.","\"Relax. It’s not as serious as you think. G3 and the rest avoided the defense line and infiltrated. The deeper they go, the harder it is to go. The last time, that group of people was discovered immediately when they approached the defense line. If G3 and the rest had approached the defense line, they might’ve been discovered immediately.","\"Our country’s external defense is not bad. Don’t worry too much. You need to have some confidence.\"","Ye Jian nodded lightly. Just as she was about to say something, there was a sudden movement in front of her. Xia Jinyuan leaned out of the ravine and observed the front for a while. He smiled and said, \"Come, let’s watch at a close distance.\"","The two sides were already fighting. It was up to who could win.","Ye Jian followed closely. She also wanted to know who would win.","The male soldiers who completed the encirclement confirmed that there were a total of five suspicious people. They didn’t seem to be carrying any lethal guns, so they approached bit by bit.","In order to avoid alarming them and causing them to flee into the depths of the desert, they waited until they were close enough to surround them immediately. Then, they had the female soldiers rush out, holding their rifles high and shouting, \"Don’t move!\"","The male soldiers pounced on the five of them at their fastest speed.","When G3 and the rest saw the number of people surrounding them, they scolded Xia Jinyuan again and again in their hearts.","Damn it!","They forgot to ask him how many soldiers he brought out!","At a glance, there were at least 30 to 40 people!","Five against 30 to 40 people. Even if they could block five people with their bare hands, they would be exhausted!","The female soldiers guarded their surroundings to the death. The blank cartridges in their rifles were already loaded. As long as they noticed any suspicious people rushing out of the male soldiers’ circle, they would immediately shoot to warn them.","\"When I go back, I must open Azure Bird’s eyes. I must let her see Q King’s shameless side as soon as possible and have her abandon him as soon as possible!\" Z7 gritted his teeth and said to K7, who was leaning against his back. \"There are 30 to 40 people, but he still has the cheek to say that this matter is a small one!\""]},{"number":4919,"title":"Chapter 4919: Godwife","paragraphs":["It was too late to say anything now. They had already fallen into the trap. If they wanted to climb out, they had to rely on themselves.","K7 silently looked in the direction where the two people were hiding. A hint of darkness flashed past his calm eyes.","Was it Q King’s idea?","He had his doubts.","When Q King mentioned this matter that caused their comrades to protest, Azure Bird silently kept quiet. She had been working hard to reduce her presence. Now, he suspected that this matter had something to do with... Azure Bird.","K7, who had guessed correctly, still had a cold expression on his face. He knocked down a male soldier.","K7 didn’t care if it was Azure Bird’s idea or not. It was all unimportant matters. Since Azure Bird didn’t want her comrades to know, he would hide it for her.","It was rare to have a treasure that could restrain Q King. It was better for her to stay in the team.","K7 was a cold person who didn’t talk much. He was always thinking for his comrades. This was why even though K7 didn’t interact much with his comrades, their relationship wasn’t affected.","Ye Jian, who was crawling and staring at the fighting circle, frowned hard. She didn’t approve of the male and female soldiers’ strategy of rushing up directly. If they rushed up rashly without understanding the other party’s background, were they 100% confident of being able to retreat?","Not at all!","If they were confident, there wouldn’t be such a chaotic battle.","\"Captain Xia, do you think we can really leave in three months? Why do I feel that it’s a little uncertain?\" Ye Jian leaned back and looked at the man who was only half a fist away from her. She sighed and said, \"If it were other suspicious people, I’m afraid there’d be casualties among the male soldiers and female soldiers.\"","Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan, who was staring at the situation, leaned back and smiled. \"Do you not approve of their tactics? Actually, you can’t blame them. It’s 34 to 5. The suspicious people don’t have any lethal weapons on them. If they surround them, it’ll be a deterrent. Secondly, they want to get rid of them as soon as possible so that they can find us.","\"Azure Bird, you can’t use the standards of the special forces of the Xueyu unit to judge them. There’s no comparison. They’re mostly defending, and we’re mainly attacking. Hence, we know how to deal with all suspicious people as soon as possible.","\"We’re good at direct killing, but they’re not. They’re not thinking of killing the suspicious people directly. The direction they’re attacking in is different, so the method they’re using to solve the matter is naturally different. Don’t forget, I also asked them to catch the suspicious people alive.\"","Xia Jinyuan could hear the faint disappointment in Ye Jian’s tone. He didn’t say that Ye Jian was wrong. Instead, he analyzed it so that Ye Jian could think from another angle.","With his analysis, Ye Jian pondered for a moment. She nodded and said, \"Just like what you said, I shouldn’t judge them according to the same requirements as the Xueyu unit.\"","\"There’s no need to worry too much. G3 is just giving them some practice and experience. When we go back, we’ll analyze, correct, and summarize it for them. That way, they can learn more.\"","\"Yes, I understand.\" A faint smile appeared on Ye Jian’s face. Seeing that the outcome of the battle had not been decided, Ye Jian smiled and asked, \"Who do you think will win? Will G3 and the rest win?\"","\"It’s five to 34. The numbers are already overwhelming. In addition, without the help of weapons, it’ll be difficult to win with their bare hands.","\"Our female soldiers and male soldiers are not ordinary soldiers, especially the female soldiers. They’re good talents chosen from various local military units. Even if the male soldiers can’t hold on, the female soldiers can.\"","Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile again. \"They’re indeed impressive. They’ve improved a lot after three months of training. I don’t think the male soldiers will be able to gain the upper hand with them.\""]},{"number":4920,"title":"Chapter 4920: Let’s Play Together","paragraphs":["As it turned out, she didn’t do anything wrong. As it turned out, Captain Xia thought that this was a good opportunity too. That was good, that was good.","Ye Jian felt relieved.","Xia Jinyuan saw that she was proud of her patience, but she was still pretending to be humble. The smile in his black eyes deepened. \"Yes, with such a powerful instructor leading the team, how can they not be impressive?\"","He didn’t expose her. Instead, he complimented her. Ye Jian blushed.","\"It has nothing to do with me. The main thing is that they’re willing to fight for it and endure hardships.\" Ye Jian was a little embarrassed to be praised again and again.","Seeing this, Xia Jinyuan laughed softly.","Being with her made him happy every minute.","He was happy, but G3 and the rest weren’t.","This group of female soldiers was even harder to deal with than male soldiers. They were difficult to deal with!","\"Tell me, who are you? No, which military unit are you from? Why are you acting so sneakily here?\" The squad leader, Yang Zhen, questioned coldly. \"You’re not spies at all!\"","Look, they were difficult to deal with!","They actually saw through them.","G3 grabbed Yang Zhen’s shoulder with both hands and pressed her hard against the ground. Before he could knock her down, a gust of wind suddenly swept over from his left. It was the same move as the Xueyu unit’s killing move.","In an instant, G3 understood why this female soldier thought that they were soldiers from the military unit. As it turned out, this was the flaw!","The strong wind caused G3 to have no choice but to release his grip on the female soldier. Two gusts of strong wind swept over from the left and right. He had to free his hands to block.","G3 didn’t expect a female soldier to be harder to deal with than a male soldier. G3 got interested in the fight and didn’t go easy on them anymore. He threw a few female soldiers to the ground, making them unable to get up for a while. He took the opportunity to whisper to his comrades who had their backs to each other, \"The female soldiers are led by Azure Bird. They have some skills. There’s no need to mention the male soldiers. They must be led by Q King.","\"Now, the female soldiers are even harder to deal with than male soldiers. Brothers, can we have a good chat with Q King later?\"","How should they chat?","Of course, they wanted to trample on Q King’s reputation. They had to do it in front of Azure Bird!","He thought he could trick them?","Hmph!","They had to let Q King know that deceiving his comrades was a high risk. If he wasn’t careful, he would be implicated too!","The four of them, including K7, understood instantly. Z7 said softly, \"Brother, first, we have to fight for a chance to talk to Q King. For example... we could be guests at their camp?\"","\"Didn’t the higher-ups say that we should retreat immediately once we’re discovered? If we want to have a chat with Q King, we can’t retreat immediately.\"","K7 said calmly, \"Sure, G3 will do it.\"","He was a cold person who didn’t talk much. Every word he said was right.","G3 thought for a moment and smiled. \"Sure, leave it to me. I won’t let you guys down.\"","Even K7, who never liked group activities, participated in it. G3 felt that they had to be guests at the camp!","The five of them muttered in low voices. The female soldiers on Yang Zhen’s side were also muttering. They didn’t rush up to fight again.","The male soldiers didn’t rush up again either. They surrounded the other party carefully, looking for an opportunity to attack.","Although there were only five people on the other side, their combat strength was extraordinary. A few of their brothers were in so much pain that they couldn’t speak. They had to be careful.","There were no extremely lethal weapons, but the other party was still lethal with their bare hands."]},{"number":4921,"title":"Chapter 4921: IQ","paragraphs":["Although there was a faint starlight, Ye Jian could only see rough outlines. She couldn’t see which were the soldiers from the Xueyu unit and which were the ones she trained. She only saw them being thrown down one after another. She raised her hand to cover her forehead. She couldn’t bear to look anymore.","It was... too tragic.","Indeed, she hadn’t considered it carefully. She only wanted the female soldier to practice with G3 and the other five, but she didn’t consider the consequences of the difference in strength between the two.","A strong hand grabbed her wrist and pressed it down slightly. Ye Jian turned her head and saw the man holding her wrist staring straight ahead. \"Look carefully. You can analyze it when you get back.\"","Looking at the man who was watching seriously, Ye Jian asked softly, \"Captain Xia, you never thought of letting them train with G3 and the rest. Did you expect this to happen?\"","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but raise his eyebrows and smile. \"Am I omnipotent in your eyes? Would I know everything?\"","\"That’s right. You’ve always been like that.\" Ye Jian was afraid that he wouldn’t believe her, so she nodded vigorously. \"I’m indeed still too inexperienced. I’m not as thorough as you.\"","Xia Jinyuan covered his hands and laughed softly. \"Although I’m very happy that you think highly of me, I still have to tell you the truth. This time, I really didn’t think of using G3 and the other five to practice. When you mentioned it, I realized that it was a good idea.\"","\"Really? You’re not coaxing me?\" Ye Jian didn’t believe him.","\"Of course, there are times when I’m not thorough enough. Didn’t I just say that you should shoulder your responsibilities when you are holding a position? It’s not that you’re not thorough, but you’re fighting for them. If it were me, I wouldn’t miss such a good opportunity either. Using G3 and the rest to practice and test the results of the soldiers’ three months of training can indeed let the female soldiers see the difference between them.","\"You can ask the female soldiers after the fight. They must have a new understanding of themselves. And they won’t have any objections to the follow-up training.\"","Regardless of whether Xia Jinyuan was comforting Ye Jian or not, Ye Jian felt that she was being comforted.","As it turned out, it wasn’t that he didn’t consider it thoroughly. It was just that the missions they faced were different. His thoughts and starting point were different.","\"That means that it’s a good idea for me to have them practice with G3, right?\"","She was like a child who was eager to be praised. Xia Jinyuan’s heart softened. He looked at her with approval in his dark eyes and confirmed again. \"That’s right. It’s a very good method. There’s no other method as good.","\"In the future, if you want to find G3 and the rest to train the female soldiers, you can only think about it. It’ll be impossible to do.\"","Ye Jian was even happier. She felt affirmed. Yes, this was very good.","\"The female soldiers should have already realized that G3 and the rest are not suspicious people. Look, they’re starting to disperse. They’re not concentrated anymore. Z7 and T6 simply stopped. It’s obvious that they don’t want to continue fighting.","\"Alas, the two of them cherish women the most. How can they bear to really hit female soldiers? Besides the two of them, the other three must have really hit them. Do you remember that T6’s fiancée is your good friend? Remind your good friend later that she has to reprimand T6! He already has a girlfriend. He has to be more self-aware when he’s outside.’","Heh, how dare T6 ’reprimand’ him for being shameless in front of Ye Jian? Heh! Xia Jinyuan had his ways to deal with T6!","Before T6 could get his fiancée, An Jiaxin, to make things difficult for Ye Jian, Lieutenant Colonel Xia had already made the first move.","He was smarter than him."]},{"number":4922,"title":"Chapter 4922: Found Out","paragraphs":["Later on, when T6 went back on leave, he was questioned by An Jiayi until he broke out in a cold sweat. Only then did he know that their shameless captain had made a move!","He was so angry that he wanted to challenge Xia Jinyuan alone.","But he endured it.","It couldn’t be helped. He had to bear with it.","He couldn’t compare to him in terms of skills or intelligence. How infuriating!","\"Stop fighting, stop fighting. They’re not suspicious people. They’re soldiers from other units!\" In front, Yang Zhen, who had retreated, moved her shoulder joints that were hurting from the fall. She raised her hand loudly and told the male soldiers who were still pestering her, \"Stop fighting. Ask them what their motive is!\"","Yang Zhen, who was certain that G3 and the rest were from a certain military unit, pulled the female soldiers away first and surrounded them, blocking their path. After she finished speaking loudly, she said to the female soldiers beside her, \"Don’t let them have the chance to slip away. If anyone wants to rush out, throw them.\"","They didn’t hear wrongly. She ordered the female soldiers to throw the other party.","That meant hugging the waist of a male soldier and then throwing him down.","As for whether they could throw these five tough male soldiers, Yang Zhen didn’t think it was important. She would stop them first!","The male soldiers were stunned for a moment. Then, they cursed. They stopped pestering her and retreated to the side.","G2, K7, T6, V8, and Z7 naturally retracted their hands. They stood in the encirclement and saluted the female soldiers and male soldiers around them. G3 was the representative. \"Hello, comrades. We have a mission to infiltrate the restricted areas of the northwest military. Please make an exception and let us in.\"","So, they had a mission. The female soldiers heaved a sigh of relief.","The male soldiers weren’t as optimistic as the female soldiers. The squad leader of the male soldiers said in a low voice, \"The restricted areas here prohibit any soldiers from the military unit from entering. Since you said that you entered because you have a mission, do you have documents? Do you have documents to prove your identities?","\"The military has given an order to Commander Nie from the Su Province’s soldier division. There are no paper documents. Commander Nie knows our mission very well. This is our identification document.\"","G3 first took out his military ID from his pocket. Then, he adjusted the light source of the miniature flashlight to the brightest point and shone it on the identification document.","Commander Nie knew... The squad leader’s expressions turned dark. The first thing they thought of was to contact the camp immediately. However, they didn’t bring any communication equipment!","\"Comrades, I’m sorry. Although you have documents and no paper documents, we didn’t receive any instructions from the soldier division. Please follow us back to the camp. We can only let you leave after confirming everything.\"","The squad leader of the male soldiers didn’t want to let them go just like that. His instincts told him that there was something fishy going on.","G3 chuckled when he heard that. He was really worried that he wouldn’t have the chance to make a move. He didn’t expect the other party to be so sensible and take the initiative to suggest it.","He wanted to agree immediately, but he remembered that there was an even more difficult person to deal with. Q King, who only knew how to find trouble for his comrades, was still hiding in the dark and watching. G3 said awkwardly, \"Comrade, don’t make things difficult for us. We do have a mission. We can’t go back to the camp with you.\"","As he spoke, he nudged the comrade beside him with his arm. V8 immediately understood what he meant and quickly said, \"Comrades, we’ve fought, and our identities have been revealed. Let’s part ways here. Continue your night training and we’ll continue our mission. We’ll go our own ways and not disturb each other.\"","The more he said, the more impossible it was for the squad leader of the male soldiers to let them leave.","His tone wasn’t as polite as before. \"I’m sorry, comrades. You barged into our military restricted areas without permission. I can’t let you leave. Please don’t make things difficult for us.\""]},{"number":4923,"title":"Chapter 4923: You Won’t Be Soft-hearted If I Betray You","paragraphs":["There was a huge problem. He had to ’invite’ them back to the camp!","Commander Nie knew about it, but his camp didn’t receive any news. Although the squad leader of the male soldiers couldn’t think of the crux of the matter, he knew that the inside story wasn’t simple.","He had to invite them back no matter what.","The squad leader’s dominance made G3 and the rest happy. K7 glanced in a certain direction again. The corners of his mouth twitched subtly. It was probably a smile, a smile that made people’s hairs stand on end.","\"Are you suspecting our identities? Your instructor, Captain Xia, knows us. He’s our captain too. We met him just now.\"","T6 was even more ruthless. He ’sold’ Xia Jinyuan out.","That was right, he did it on purpose.","After confirming that there was a problem, the squad leader didn’t care that these five people were Captain Xia’s soldiers too. He would not release them even if they knew Captain Xia.","The two sides were in a stalemate. Neither of them retreated.","The female soldiers looked at each other with complicated thoughts.","The other party said that they met Captain Xia just now. Did Captain Xia and Instructor Ye disappear on purpose to prevent them from finding them?","Why did they do that?","Ye Jian was a little anxious. She gently pulled the corner of Xia Jinyuan’s shirt. \"Captain Xia, let’s show our faces. If we don’t show our faces, they’ll probably be in a stalemate until dawn.","\"T6 also said that you’re their captain. If you don’t show your face, the male soldiers will probably have something against you. T6 shouldn’t tell the male soldiers that you’re their captain. It’ll make things difficult for you.","Ye Jian thought that T6 had let it slip.","Only she would think of it that way.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at T6 coldly and said, \"He’s doing this on purpose. He’s looking for trouble for me. Let’s go. It’s time to show our faces. If we don’t show our faces, we’ll disappoint them.\"","Ye Jian opened her mouth. She finally remembered that the comrades from the Xueyu unit interacted with each other every day and could cooperate seamlessly. Hence, T6 let it slip on purpose.","They were really...","Ye Jian sighed. How childish!","Xia Jinyuan, who could hear clearly, replied directly, \"In the future, just treat them as three-year-olds. Their brains are still developing.\"","\"It can’t be helped. A crooked stick will have a crooked shadow.\" Ye Jian retorted. She didn’t realize that she was also partaking in their act of mutual criticism and synced cooperation.","As a member of the Xueyu unit, how could she stay out of trouble? She had to get along with them.","Xia Jinyuan, who was successfully rendered speechless, didn’t say anything for a long time. After taking a few steps, he suddenly stopped and said to Ye Jian seriously, \"Azure Bird, with our relationship, we should unite against the outside world. We can’t have internal strife.","\"You don’t know how cunning they are. As long as they realize that you’re not on my side, they’ll often instigate you to go against me in the future. If I want to deal with them, I have thousands of ways to do it. As for dealing with you, I won’t be able to bring myself to do it. It’s very likely that I won’t be able to help but go easy on you. In the long run, I’ll definitely end up using my power for personal gain and harm myself.","\"You don’t want to see me harming myself in the end, right? That’s why you must remember not to be instigated by them. Behind closed doors, I’ll let you hit and scold me as you please. But you have to stand on my side in front of them.\"","When Ye Jian heard this, she was so happy that she pursed her lips and smiled. \"Captain Xia, have you ever let me off? Back then, you were so heartless that you sent me to the hospital. I still remember that our comrades tried to persuade you, but you insisted on hitting me. Why didn’t you go easy on me then?","\"That’s why I don’t believe that you’ll go easy on me in the future.\""]},{"number":4924,"title":"Chapter 4924: An Uncrossable Hurdle","paragraphs":["Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had beaten his girlfriend until she needed to be sent to the hospital, swallowed his saliva and was instantly frightened. He advised sincerely, \"You should forget about the unpleasant memories completely. Let’s not mention them in the future.\"","Ye Jian just smiled and didn’t say anything. Lieutenant Colonel Xia had a headache.","For the first time in his life, he regretted it!","No, he had to solve this problem. He couldn’t let her think about it from time to time. She had to forget it entirely!","\"It’s getting late. Why don’t we go back to the camp directly? There are five of them. We’ll bring them back together.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia quickly changed the topic. \"If we bring them back to the camp, I can ask them if they’ve been training well when I wasn’t around.\"","Ye Jian knew that he was changing the topic and was willing to cooperate with him. She nodded. \"Okay, I want to talk to them too.\"","Then, Lieutenant Colonel Xia quickened his pace and appeared behind everyone. He said calmly, \"Even if you know me, I can’t let you leave. Bring them back to the camp. Don’t let them continue wandering in the restricted areas.\"","The squad leader was elated. Fortunately, Captain Xia was on their side and didn’t let the five of them leave.","\"Yes!\" The squad leader of the male soldiers replied with a serious expression.","Then, Xia Jinyuan said to the five of them, \"The five of you entered the military restricted areas, but you’re still hoping to leave. Even if I’m your captain, I can’t be biased because of it.\"","\"Yes, Captain!\"","Five voices sounded at the same time. Even the tone was the same.","How smooth!","As for what would happen next, hahaha. Q King, wait and see!","Ye Jian reorganized the female soldiers. After they lined up, Ye Jian said in a low voice, \"I’ve been observing secretly. Although your performance wasn’t satisfactory, it wasn’t bad overall.","\"Let me remind you first. Today, you were facing a company of comrades. If you had been facing real criminals, do you think your actions just now were appropriate? Think about how many times they beat you up.\"","The female soldiers’ hearts sank when they heard this.","If they had been facing real criminals just now, then... they wouldn’t just have been beaten up!","It was very likely that the number of times they were beaten up would turn into the number of times they were stabbed.","Just because there were no visible lethal weapons did not mean that there were none. Knives were also cold weapons with great lethality.","At 4:30 am, the female soldiers and male soldiers who had completed 30 kilometers of weighted cross-country returned to the campsite and met up with the remaining six comrades. Then, they carried their backpacks and returned to the camp.","Z7 had already informed the soldiers of the Su Province through the satellite phone. They had been discovered by the Vanguard Battalion and were preparing to go to the Vanguard Battalion’s camp. They could only be allowed to leave after the Vanguard Battalion confirmed that the five of them were indeed on a mission.","A smile finally appeared on Commander Nie’s face. He knew it. How could his subordinates be so weak?","Soon, they received news from another camp. They also found suspicious people and informed the regiment stationed at the base to increase their vigilance.","When Battalion Commander Tian received the news, he got up from the bed. The company commander of the three companies also woke up. The entire battalion had already sounded the sharp alarm.","It had only been a minute since they received the news and the alarm rang.","The entire battalion entered level four combat readiness.","The combat readiness of the entire army was divided into four levels.","Level four combat readiness was the combat readiness of the military unit when there were major emergencies overseas or when there were major abnormalities in the surrounding area of the country. It might have a greater impact on the security and stability of the country.","The main work of the military unit was to carry out combat readiness education and combat readiness inspection. They would adjust their duty and enforcement capabilities. They would strengthen their combat readiness duty and situation research. They needed to have a tight grasp of the situation. They would also have to maintain smooth communication and strict border management. They had to strengthen their patrolling vigilance."]},{"number":4925,"title":"Chapter 4925: Force","paragraphs":["At 4:36 am, hundreds of soldiers from the Vanguard Battalion entered level four combat readiness and implemented all aspects of the military restricted areas. They covered all the surveillance cameras and informed the various outposts to patrol strictly. If they found anyone suspicious, they would immediately shoot to warn them and control them with force!","Company Commander Zhu’s expression was so dark that killing intent could be seen. He said to Battalion Commander Tian, \"If we find these bastards again, let’s just kill them. There’s no need to control them by force! If they have the guts, they should be prepared to die at any time.\"","\"Zhu Zhongguo, do you think killing people is like harvesting crops? Do you think you can kill them just because you want to?\" Battalion Commander Tian glared at him. Although he wanted to do the same, he couldn’t.","\"They’re already doing this. Why can’t we kill them?\" Company Commander Zhu didn’t think that he was in the wrong. He even asked Battalion Commander Tian, \"Don’t tell me you still want to treat them like VIPs?\"","Battalion Commander Tian slammed the table and shouted, \"Bullsh*t! Sit down!\"","Company Commander Zhu was so frightened that he stood up. He gritted his teeth so hard that the muscles on his face trembled slightly. He had no choice but to sit down again.","Seeing that he was obedient and didn’t go against him, the anger on Battalion Commander Tian’s forehead subsided a little. \"This is a little strange. It doesn’t look like a group of ordinary people.\"","\"What? They infiltrated the military restricted areas. Could they be a group of ordinary people?\" Although he listened to orders and sat down, how could the company commander become quiet in an instant?","The moment he opened his mouth, Battalion Commander Tian almost vomited blood.","\"Shut up! I’m warning you, don’t anger me anymore!\" The veins on Battalion Commander Tian’s forehead were popping out. He wanted to resort to force. Commissar Tang couldn’t stand it anymore. He pointed at Company Commander Zhu and said, \"You, sit down properly! Don’t always anger Old Tian. Listen to what’s wrong first!\"","Company Commander Zhu, who had swallowed his saliva a few times, saw that his battalion commander’s face was ashen. He leaned back in his chair and pursed his lips, indicating that he would definitely shut up from now on.","Company Commander Sun and Company Commander Liang looked at Company Commander Zhu. Old Zhu was good at everything, but he liked to use force to solve everything.","It wasn’t impossible to use force to deal with matters. After all, soldiers had to be fearless. Company Commander Zhu Yi was just a little too impulsive.","It wasn’t good to be too impulsive.","When Battalion Commander Tian saw this, he drank a mouthful of warm water to calm himself down. Then, he said, \"The left regiment called and told me that they had a short fight with five suspicious people. They realized that they were wearing desert combat boots. They’re not military boots from the military supply store. They’re only used by military units.","\"The left regiment suspects that this group of people might be soldiers from a certain military unit in disguise and intentionally infiltrated the restricted areas of our division. The deeper meaning behind this is...\" After a short pause, he glanced at the three company commanders who had unknowingly approached the conference table. \"The left regiment suspects that they might be soldiers sent by the military district. The deeper meaning is self-evident. They’re testing our division’s defense. The military division probably knows about it, but they can’t tell us explicitly.","\"The left regiment called Commander Nie in the military district. The guard told the left regiment that Commander Nie has been staying in the military district for the past two days.","\"Commander Nie should know about this. The higher-ups didn’t allow him to inform his subordinates. He carried all the pressure alone and has been waiting for the three regiments to report the news.\"","There were three regiments in charge of the defense of the base, including Battalion Commander Tian’s third regiment.","The three battalions under the third regiment were the closest to the base. The Vanguard Battalion guarded the middle section. There was another battalion that had been hiding somewhere closest to the base and wouldn’t show their faces easily.","The regimental commander of the third regiment was there."]},{"number":4926,"title":"Chapter 4926: Military Power","paragraphs":["When Company Commander Zhu heard that there were still so many twists and turns to the story, his expression was as dark as a storm.","Although the previous incident was over, they were still affected by it. That was why the military district made such an arrangement.","Battalion Commander Tian continued, \"This isn’t a bad thing. At least we can understand the current situation better. We need to improve further.","\"At the moment, although our Vanguard Battalion hasn’t found any suspicious people, Zhu Zhongguo...\" Battalion Commander Tian nodded and said to Company Commander Zhu, who had a cold expression on his face, \"Lead the third company’s soldiers to patrol 30 kilometers in the north. Although there’s a natural chasm in the north, these people are soldiers specially sent by the military district. Even though they know about the natural chasm, they still dared to barge in.\"","Company Commander Zhu crossed his arms and kept fiddling with his thumbs. He didn’t even reply to Battalion Commander Tian’s call. He was in a daze.","Battalion Commander Tian’s expression darkened a few degrees. Company Commander Sun, who was sitting beside Company Commander Zhu, coughed a few times and reminded him in a low voice, \"Old Zhu, Old Zhu!\"","\"Yes, I’m listening.\" Company Commander Zhu reacted quickly and ignored Battalion Commander Tian’s dark expression. He said thoughtfully, \"I’ve thought of a few questions that I want to ask.\"","Battalion Commander Tian took a deep breath. \"Speak!\"","\"Based on what the battalion commanders are saying... the military district sent special forces? If they really sent special forces, I suspect that they’ve already infiltrated our military restricted areas. The people from the first regiment aren’t weak.\"","Although Company Commander Zhu liked to bicker, his sensitivity was top-notch.","\"Old Zhu is right. I suspect it too.\" Company Commander Liang, who had a serious look in his eyes, nodded slightly. \"If the first regiment has found suspicious people, that means the other party was already close to the defense line. It’s difficult for ordinary soldiers to infiltrate without any movements. The first regiment is a Class A army.\"","The army is divided into Class A soldiers and class B soldiers. Class A soldiers referred to soldiers with sufficient equipment. Once a war broke out, they could enter the battlefield without replenishing their manpower and equipment. Class B soldiers referred to soldiers who didn’t have enough manpower and equipment. During combat, they needed to replenish their manpower and equipment.","Due to the special reasons of the base, the first regiment was well-equipped. Once something big happened, they could immediately participate in the battle.","It was also the most powerful regiment among the three regiments. Even the other party only discovered them when they were close to the defense line. It could be seen that those people were not ordinary soldiers.","Company Commander Sun continued, \"You’re right. The regiment didn’t notice them immediately. This means that the other party is powerful. Battalion Commander, they might have really infiltrated our military restricted areas just like what Old Zhu said!\"","After Company Commander Sun finished speaking, the entire conference room fell into dead silence. After a while, Battalion Commander Tian said in a low voice, \"I’ll contact the left regiment! Old Zhu, bring your troops out of the camp immediately and increase the patrolling speed.","\"Damn it, your instincts are probably right again. There’s a high chance that they really sneaked in.\"","\"Yes!\" Company Commander Zhu stood up and immediately strode out of the conference room.","Not long after, Company Commander Sun and Company Commander Liang strode out of the conference room as well.","After the three company commanders left, Battalion Commander Tian sighed and said, \"Old Tang, if we don’t catch the people who infiltrated, I don’t think I’ll have any peace.\"","\"We do need to prepare for the worst. We’re being targeted by the military. The military...\" Commissar Tang pondered for a moment before continuing, \"It’s very likely that the military is targeting us.\"","It was all because of what happened a few months ago. It wouldn’t pass so quickly. There was still a long time before it would pass."]},{"number":4927,"title":"Chapter 4927: Heartache","paragraphs":["Battalion Commander Tian frowned silently. He pursed his lips tightly.","\"Be alert and prepared. Things may not be as you think. There’s still a chance.\" Commissar Tang, who said that he wanted to prepare for the worst a second ago, smiled. \"Yesterday, Instructor Ye did a good deed. It was a wise move for Captain Xia to follow along.\"","At the mention of this, Battalion Commander Tian’s eyes lit up. He slapped his forehead heavily and swept away the seriousness on his face. \"Look at me. I actually forgot about dozens of them!\"","\"They were headed north. Hahaha, this position is well chosen! The two parties might’ve already met!\"","A deep smile appeared on Commissar Tang’s tanned face. That was indeed a possibility.","In the early morning of December 27th, the level-four combat readiness made several regiments in the northwest ready for battle. The entire military made up for the tense and solemn atmosphere.","The tense atmosphere in the Vanguard Battalion lasted until seven in the morning. When they saw the 40 comrades who were carrying weights coming back, all their nervousness disappeared instantly like a popped balloon.","Company Commander Zhu, who was still patrolling in the desert, received a call from the camp. His tanned face was filled with smiles. \"Good, good, good. I’ll return to the camp immediately after patrolling this area!\"","He had been searching high and low for the other party, but these soldiers found them without any effort!","The soldiers who went out on a weighted cross-country trip actually bumped into them! He was right!","The soldiers sent by the military district were all special forces soldiers. They infiltrated two days ago and were only discovered today... Company Commander Zhu, who was overjoyed, immediately turned gloomy again.","This couldn’t go on. It definitely couldn’t. Problems would definitely arise one after another.","They had to guard this piece of land until it was impregnable and all suspicious people disappeared.","With a cold expression, Company Commander Zhu continued patrolling. On the other side, Battalion Commander Tian of the Vanguard Battalion looked at the five special forces soldiers who had sneaked over. Then, he looked at Xia Jinyuan who had brought them over. He was silent for a while before saying helplessly, \"Captain Xia, these five are your soldiers. What’s going on?\"","Xia Jinyuan sighed resignedly too. \"I didn’t expect to meet them here either. Instructor Ye and I found them. Since we found them, we decided to bring them back to the camp. Battalion Commander Tian, you can do whatever you want to them.\"","G3 and the rest were dumbfounded when they heard that. Leave them to the Vanguard Battalion?","The five of them might just be grounded!","Then why did they cooperate at all?","T6 snorted and said to K7 beside him, \"He’s using his position for personal revenge. I knew that he was narrow-minded. Look, I’m right. Hmph!\"","Ye Jian, who had already dismissed the female soldiers and was walking over, heard him. She relaxed her footsteps and walked to T6’s side. In the end, she chose to be honest. \"T6, I’m sorry. Captain Xia wanted to turn a blind eye and let you pass.","\"Cough, it was me... It has nothing to do with Captain Xia. It was all my idea. You can blame me. Don’t misunderstand Captain Xia.\"","In the end, Ye Jian couldn’t bear to let her man be misunderstood. She chose to tell the truth.","K7 glanced at Ye Jian. There was a hint of understanding in his eyes.","As expected, he was right.","T6 was hurt by the truth. He pressed one hand on his chest and said with a heartbroken expression, \"Azure Bird, my good comrade, why did you get led astray by Q King? You wouldn’t have tricked your comrades in the past.\"","His heart hurt, and he had a bad feeling."]},{"number":4928,"title":"Chapter 4928: Tears","paragraphs":["Ye Jian smiled in embarrassment. \"I’m sorry. I just wanted to let the female soldiers I’m leading practice and didn’t consider your feelings. I’m sorry, I’m sorry. There won’t be a next time. I promise.\"","\"Yes, I believe that there won’t be a next time because we won’t sneak over again,\" T6 continued to beat his chest as if he couldn’t accept it.","K7 spat out three words, \"Accept your fate.\"","\"Yes, I can only accept it.\" T6 resigned himself to fate. He really, really... didn’t expect that the person who came up with the idea to trick them wasn’t Q King but Azure Bird.","\"Azure Bird, Azure Bird, you’re a big shot now!\"","Facing T6’s resignation, Ye Jian smiled slightly. He was harmless.","T6 felt his heart hurting even more. He turned his head and said to K7, \"Quick, help support me. I’m having difficulty breathing. I might have heart disease.\"","K7 dodged and said to Ye Jian calmly, \"He’s crazy.\"","\"Didn’t you say that we were a loving family? What happened to our friendship?\" T6 raised his hand and pointed at K7 with trembling fingers. He then looked at Ye Jian with a smile.","It was good to be able to meet Azure Bird here although they were tricked, Alas, they were comrades. If they didn’t trick their comrades, who else could they trick?","Hmph!","He was happy to be tricked!","V8 said to Z7, \"Do you think Azure Bird will suppress Q King after she returns to the team? Or will they work together to suppress us? After listening to Azure Bird’s explanation, I don’t know why I feel that the situation isn’t looking good for us.\"","Z7 sneered at his comrades. \"You’re still too naive. Is there a need to say more? Hasn’t Azure Bird always protected Q King?\"","\"You think she’ll join us to suppress Q King? Dream on. If she doesn’t join forces with Q King to suppress us, I’ll start praying to God every day!\"","V8 felt a chill down his spine. He gritted his teeth in disbelief. \"That’s impossible. Azure Bird wouldn’t do that, right? Although she’s quite protective of Captain Xia, it’s impossible for her to turn around and bully us, right?\"","\"Wrong. It’s not bullying. It’s making sure that we can’t bully Q King casually in the future,\" Z7 pointed it out seriously.","V8 was about to cry. \"Brother, are you getting old? Has your retention deteriorated? When have we ever bullied Q King? Haven’t we always been looking for ways to bully Q King?!\"","He was full of tears.","Z7 raised his head and sighed in the wind. \"That’s right. Don’t even think about finding a way to bully Q King in the future. Accept your fate, brother. We’re single, and we don’t have our girlfriends to help us.\"","\"Yes, you should find a girlfriend.\" V8 patted his comrades’ shoulders. \"Find one as soon as possible. Otherwise, in a few years, no one will like you anymore.\"","Z7 opened his mouth slightly and said one word to V8, \"Scram.\"","After Battalion Commander Tian finished speaking to Xia Jinyuan, the first thing he said to the five people who allowed the entire camp to enter the level-four strategy was, \"Comrades, you’re really bold. You actually wanted to climb over the natural chasm. Weren’t you afraid that you wouldn’t be able to return?\"","G3 saluted Battalion Commander Tian and smiled. \"It’s alright, we have made ample preparations. Although we’ve never been to this desert before, we go deep into the desert for training every year. After accumulating some experience, we thought it’d be good to try.\"","The eyes of the soldier in front of him were like eagles. They looked like they were smiling, but there was a bloody killing intent around them. Battalion Commander Tian looked at the other four soldiers. He, who was standing like a pine tree, returned the salute. \"Welcome. I’m the battalion commander of the Vanguard Battalion, Tian Jinsong.\""]},{"number":4929,"title":"Chapter 4929: Can’t Bear It","paragraphs":["G3, who also reached out his hand, felt that it was hard for Battalion Commander Tian to say the word ’welcome’. Hence, he emphasized the word like a blade.","However, even though his expression wasn’t good, he was still able to treat his guests politely. It could be seen that his heart wasn’t bad. G3 held Battalion Commander Tian’s hand and smiled. \"Hello, Battalion Commander Tian. We’re under orders to carry out a mission. Please forgive us for disturbing you. The soldiers under you said that they can’t confirm our identities completely and need our cooperation. Battalion Commander Tian, you can call Commander Nie of the military district. Commander Nie knows about this very well. The military district knows too.","He told Battalion Commander Tian in one breath that they were under orders to carry out a mission and had to obey the arrangements of their superiors. It wasn’t that they had any other thoughts.","He told Battalion Commander Tian that even if he was angry, he had to talk to the higher-ups. It was useless to talk to them.","Battalion Commander Tian looked at the soldier in front of him who was talking to him. Then, he turned his head and looked at Captain Xia, who was transferred here at the last minute. A captain who was not to be trifled with would lead soldiers who were not to be trifled with. As expected, G3 was the result of Xia Jinyuan’s training.","Fine. How could he deliberately make things difficult for the five people who were just following orders?","He retracted the smile on his face and replied seriously, \"Thank you for your cooperation. It’s the duty of the soldiers. Please forgive me. Now, please go to the camp and settle down. I still need to verify it.\"","\"It’s what I should do.\" G3 smiled when he saw this. \"We’ll have a chat with Captain Xia first. We’ll leave after you verify everything.\"","As he spoke, G3 turned his head and raised his voice to speak to Captain Xia, who loved to trick his comrades. \"Captain, we haven’t seen each other for a few months. There are some work matters in the team that I want to talk to you about. Is it convenient for you?\"","Battalion Commander Tian answered for Captain Xia, \"It’s convenient. You guys can chat first.\"","Captain Xia didn’t want to talk to G3 and the rest at all. Seeing the smiles on their faces, he knew that they were up to no good.","His thin lips moved slightly. He said indifferently, \"It’s inconvenient.\" He turned to Battalion Commander Tian and said, \"Battalion Commander, we still don’t know why the five of them came to our camp. Lock them up and release them only after we figure it out.\"","Captain Xia never showed mercy to his comrades.","Battalion Commander Tian wondered if he had heard wrongly. He had to confirm it. \"Captain Xia, you mean...\"","The always sensible Captain Xia continued seriously, \"We should find a strong house and lock the five of them up first. Then, we’ll send soldiers to guard outside until we figure out the real reason why they came. Only after we’ve verified everything will we let them out.\"","G3 and the others gritted their teeth. Was this their captain? No, they didn’t have such a captain!","Ye Jian saw that other than K7, who only raised his eyelids slightly, the other four people had hideous expressions. She couldn’t bear to see them like this.","It wasn’t good to lock the five of them up directly.","She wanted to say a few more words but Xia Jinyuan, who tricked his comrades, seemed to have realized something. He looked up at Ye Jian and winked.","Ye Jian was speechless. He was doing it on purpose? He wanted to lock them up on purpose?","Xia Jinyuan nodded. That was right. He wanted to lock them up on purpose.","They were even trying to be polite to Battalion Commanders Tian?","Hah!","Hah!","Haha!","Xia Jinyuan only said that he wanted them to practice with the male and female soldiers. He didn’t agree to let them all be brought back to the camp!","They still had the cheek to say that he was their captain!"]},{"number":4930,"title":"Chapter 4930: Become Human Again","paragraphs":["Hah!","Hah!","Haha!","If he didn’t teach them a lesson, did they think that his rank as captain was just for show?","Ye Jian didn’t dare to plead for mercy. Why did he want to deliberately lock up G3 and the others?","Captain Xia had his reasons for doing everything. If she pleaded rashly, she might ruin his plan. Forget it, it was better not to beg. She could only feel sorry for her five comrades first.","T6’s ferocious gaze moved back and forth between his comrades. In the end, he said to Ye Jian, \"Azure Bird, have you seen Q King’s true colors now? Isn’t he very despicable? Don’t you want to beat him up? If you want him to be beaten up, I’ll be the first to do it! But you have to take responsibility for it after that. I’m afraid Q King will beat me up out of revenge.\"","\"You know how ruthless he is. As long as he acts, he can make us cry for our parents in minutes. He can make us want to turn over a new leaf in minutes.\"","T6 also dragged V8 into it. \"What about you? Don’t you agree? Don’t you have any thoughts? Do you want to beat him up? We don’t need to turn over a new leaf. I just want to teach Q King how to turn over a new leaf.\"","V8 thought for a moment and said earnestly, \"Let’s just turn over a new leaf ourselves. It’s too difficult to teach Q King how to turn over a new leaf!\"","Ye Jian couldn’t hold it in anymore. She turned her head and suppressed her laughter.","She believed that Captain Xia really had the ability to teach T6 how to turn over a new leaf in minutes. As for V8, he had a high level of awareness. He knew that he couldn’t go against the rules and wouldn’t do it to avoid self-torture.","On the other hand, T6... Tsk tsk tsk, his awareness wasn’t high enough. He even wanted to teach Captain Xia how to turn over a new leaf. Where did he get the confidence to think like this?","Seeing that T6 didn’t realize that Captain Xia was actually angry, Ye Jian silently cried for T6.","’Comrades, why does Q King want to lock you up? Haven’t you thought of the reason?’","Although she didn’t know why, she would ask later. Otherwise, she could only continue to guess without knowing anything.","As for T6, he should learn more and see more. Didn’t he see that Z7, who was the most troublesome, had become quiet?","After sighing softly, V8 whispered to Ye Jian, \"Someone has to be stupid enough to stand up and take the blame. He likes to take on this role, so we won’t fight with him. Let him have it.","\"He wants to teach Q King how to be a human again, so let’s leave such a sacred and historically important responsibility to him! We just need to watch. We won’t speak or participate. We’ll just watch from the side.\"","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows when she heard that. \"Does that mean that you understand why Captain Xia is angry?\"","\"Yes.\" V8’s resolute face turned cold. \"I can guess a little.\"","Ye Jian pursed her lips. \"I didn’t manage to guess it.\"","\"Because we lost,\" V8 reminded.","Ye Jian was enlightened. That was right. Captain Xia had always had high standards and requirements for their comrades. How could Captain Xia, the captain of the Xueyu unit, be happy when G3 and the others were invited back to the Vanguard Battalion?","He was unhappy.","However, if they were not discovered, the consequences would’ve been even more unimaginable. It meant that the entire northwestern defense was completely unqualified.","Ye Jian frowned and fell silent. He was stuck in a dilemma.","After getting confirmation, Battalion Commander Tian looked at Xia Jinyuan in disbelief. He wanted to pull him to the side and ask him what was wrong.","Was it necessary to do all this?","He wanted them to find a strong house to lock them in?","After pondering for a few seconds, Battalion Commander Tian said carefully, \"A strong house... Does the confinement room count?\""]},{"number":4931,"title":"Chapter 4931: A Huge Reversal","paragraphs":["T6 covered his chest. Confinement room! They were going to be locked up in a confinement room. He... He had never been locked up in a confinement room before.","He had to protest this!","T6 imagined many scenes in his mind. It was of people fighting, but he didn’t have the guts to protest directly.","\"I think the confinement room is not bad. Let’s go there, then.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled and nodded. He said to G3, \"Go and experience the confinement room of the Vanguard Battalion. I believe it’ll give you a different feeling.\"","G3 nodded. \"Yes!\"","Battalion Commander Tian, feeling a little tired, waved his hand and sighed. \"You young people, I can’t figure out what you’re thinking. You know where the confinement room is. I won’t send anyone to lead the way. You can handle it yourself.\"","Although Captain Xia was the instructor of the battalion, he was transferred here at the last minute. Now that he wanted to teach his soldiers a lesson, as the battalion commander of the Vanguard Battalion, Tian Jinsong didn’t have the right to interfere.","He couldn’t even understand it, so how could he interfere?","He didn’t know what Captain Xia wanted to do.","Could it be that Captain Xia was unhappy because his five soldiers were caught?","Battalion Commander Tian raised his head and looked at the few towering figures that left. Captain Xia was probably unhappy. He was from the special forces. How could he be happy when his special forces soldiers were caught by the male and female soldiers under him?","That was impossible!","Battalion Commander Tian, who was close to the truth, waved his sleeve and left.","He should settle his own matters. As for Captain Xia’s matters, Captain Xia would handle them himself. Battle Commander Tian wouldn’t interfere.","The confinement room was not big, but it was definitely a restricted area in the hearts of every soldier. They would rather write a reflective essay than go into the confinement room.","G3 led the way in. Then, K7 walked in with a face full of resistance. Meanwhile, Z7 and T6 followed closely behind Z7, but V8 suddenly cut in.","V8, who cut the queue and entered the confinement room, looked at his three comrades and shrugged. He smiled and said, \"Q King is too angry. Let him vent his anger first so that his health won’t be compromised.\"","\"Yes, that’s the way to go.\" G3 nodded and instructed K7 and Z7, \"With T6 around, we should be quiet so that we won’t anger Q King again.\"","K7’s reply was the same as before, and he maintained his expression. Z7 nodded heavily. His expression seemed to say, ’Don’t worry, I’ll rely on my comrades in times of danger!","’Take care, sacrificial T6.’","Outside, T6 pointed at the room and turned to complain to Xia Jinyuan. \"Q King, look at them. They don’t have any discipline at all! Not even in front of you! In the past few months when you weren’t around, they were even worse! Sometimes, I had to maintain order between them. It was so tiring.\"","Ye Jian was speechless. This was a huge reversal of the plot! A double spy?","As it turned out, T6 played such a role!","Ye Jian was tired, and her heart ached. Compared to her comrades, she was too naive. Before she even entered the team, she had already been taught something new by her comrades!","She had to reevaluate herself. She had to calm down. She had to be smart. If not... she would really be fooled by her comrades!","Especially since all her comrades knew about her relationship with Captain Xia, there was a 100% chance that she would be tricked by them!","Her heart ached. To think that she wanted to plead for mercy for them just now.","It wasn’t necessary at all!","She finally understood why Captain Xia said that they needed to be united internally and unite against the outside world. They couldn’t fight internally.","Now, she understood!","This was another life lesson for her."]},{"number":4932,"title":"Chapter 4932: Be Careful","paragraphs":["Her comrades were too scheming. Ye Jian, who felt that she was too innocent, decided to learn a few moves from her man in the future to protect herself.","If not, she would only be tricked in the future.","T6 ’betrayed’ his comrades. He was so happy that Xia Jinyuan was a little annoyed. Xia Jinyuan punched him and said coldly, \"How much longer are you going to act? For every minute you dawdle outside, you have to stay inside for another ten!\"","\"Oh, damn it!\" T6, who purposely didn’t enter the confinement room, reacted like he had just received the shock of his life. He quickly rushed into the confinement room, afraid that if he stayed outside for another minute, he would have to stay inside for an extra ten minutes.","Their captain would never joke around when it came to punishing them. He did as he said!","T6, who had immediately become well-behaved, nimbly entered the confinement room. He thought to himself, ’That was close. That was close.’","After entering, T6 tidied his collar and sighed when he saw the four expressionless faces. \"Alas, I really don’t know why Q King wants to lock us up. Just now, I asked him for a long time but didn’t get anything. Instead, he scolded me. It’s infuriating.\"","Z7 gave a fake smile. \"Really? How thoughtful of you! I thought you were reporting to Q King.\"","\"How is that possible? Am I such a person?\" T6 accused Z7 of making things up with an angry expression. \"I asked out of goodwill, but you actually accused me. I’m hurt!\"","V8 scoffed. \"You want to play the blame game?\"","\"Why are all of you like women? You like to think too much. We’re already locked up in the confinement room, but you’re still thinking too much. You should reflect on yourself. I feel that the five of us misunderstood Q King’s arrangements. That’s why we’re locked up now.\"","There was no chance of winning, so T6 immediately changed the topic.","G3 waited for the three of them to argue before saying to K7, \"What do you think?\"","Pointing at T6, K7 said calmly, \"Same.\"","\"What about the two of you? Are you the same?\" G3 asked Z7 and V8. The two of them nodded, indicating that they thought that they were locked up in the small black room for misunderstanding Q King’s arrangements.","Outside, Ye Jian wiped the non-existent sweat on her forehead and said to Xia Jinyuan with lingering fear, \"It’s too scary. I didn’t expect them to be so scheming. I almost pleaded for mercy on their behalf.\"","\"They’re a group of highly intelligent fellows. How can they not play some tricks? I’ve experienced so many of their tricks. If I don’t play any tricks on them, they’ll play me for a fool.\"","Xia Jinyuan sighed heavily and took the opportunity to lecture Ye Jian. \"Don’t think that they’re all serious. In fact, they’re all good at playing spies. If you’re not careful, you’ll be sold out by them.","\"When you enter the military in the future, you have to understand that no other soldiers are as difficult to deal with as them. If you don’t have any intelligence or methods in front of them, you won’t have an easy life.\"","Ye Jian raised her hand and patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder heavily. She said with a serious expression, \"Captain Xia, take care.\"","...","After waiting for a while, Xia Jinyuan blinked. \"That’s it?\"","He was still waiting for her comfort!","Ye Jian blinked. \"That’s it. What else could there be?\"","\"Azure Bird, you should at least express your stance. For example, tell me that you’ll stand firmly on my side in the future. No matter how many sweet words or storms there are outside, you’ll be with me and face their tricks together.\""]},{"number":4933,"title":"Chapter 4933: Interesting","paragraphs":["Ye Jian smiled and blinked. Her voice was light and happy as she replied, \"I have to learn first. I’ll help you after I learn everything. Now, I’m afraid that I’ll be tricked.","\"I’m sorry, I can’t help you for the time being.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s heart ached. \"I was counting on you to help me.\"","\"Of course, I’ll help! After I learn everything, I’ll definitely help!\" Ye Jian nodded solemnly. She was really afraid that before she could help Captain Xia, she would go along with their comrades and harm him.","After witnessing T6’s trick, Ye Jian decided to follow her boyfriend. But now that Xia Jinyuan wanted an answer from her, Ye Jian didn’t say anything.","It would be boring to say it out loud!","With Ye Jian’s promise, Xia Jinyuan felt at ease. This was good. With his girlfriend as his backer, he could still deal with those scheming comrades in the future.","\"In the future, when you go to the team, don’t agree to anything easily, especially when they complain to you and complain about their grievances. They might even pretend to be sick to gain sympathy. Just don’t care about them. They’re all tricks.","\"They’ll never let themselves suffer grievances. They’ll always think of ways to mess with others. You can do it in the future too. You can trick them appropriately. You’ll even find it interesting.\"","Ye Jian also felt that it was interesting to trick her comrades.","What was more interesting was that sometimes, even though they knew that they were being tricked, they would turn a blind eye and cooperate. Ye Jian couldn’t understand this interaction.","Ye Jian turned around and looked at the confinement room behind her. She couldn’t help but ask, \"Captain Xia, won’t this method affect our internal unity? Aren’t you afraid of falling out? Although it’s interesting, you can’t keep playing tricks, right?\"","Fall out? No way.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and explained to Ye Jian, \"It’s a way to decompress. It can be beneficial to the development of physical and mental health. It can vent the trauma and uneasiness in the depths of one’s heart in another way. It can help you decompress and make other comrades laugh. No one will fall out because of it.","\"A comrade in the trenches, a comrade who walks out of death... Although we’re not biological siblings, we know each other better than biological siblings. The last time V8 went back on leave, he came back and told us that he realized that he had nothing in common with his biological brother. Even though they were excited to see each other again, they couldn’t find anything to talk about until midnight.","\"Especially when his brother asked him about the military unit, he could only brush it off. That made his younger brother unhappy. V8 felt bad that his younger brother didn’t understand.\"","Ye Jian felt a lump in her throat when she heard that.","Looking at his handsome side profile, Ye Jian said softly, \"If you have any unhappiness in the future, just tell me. We’ll bear it together and face it together.\"","The Xueyu unit wasn’t an ordinary special forces unit. They had to face life and death all the time. The pressure they were under couldn’t be known. Hence, the best person to complain to was their comrades.","Besides their comrades, there was no one else they could talk to. Not even their parents or siblings.","Xia Jinyuan raised his hand and rubbed the top of Ye Jian’s head. He was touched, and his heart softened. He smiled. \"No matter what happens in the future, I still have you.","\"It’s the same for you. If you have any hardships or difficulties, you have to tell me. We’ll face them together and solve them together. Don’t carry them alone. It’ll be very tiring.\" Holding hands side by side meant that they would share honor and disgrace together."]},{"number":4934,"title":"Chapter 4934: Rely On Yourself","paragraphs":["As for why Xia Jinyuan wanted to punish G3 and the other three to the confinement room, Ye Jian was quickly enlightened.","Ye Jian felt bad for implicating G3 and their other comrades because of her idea. She said in a low voice, \"Actually, it has nothing to do with them. If I hadn’t suggested it, the five of them wouldn’t have been found and brought back to the camp.","\"It’s not considered a loss. They just practiced with the female soldiers. If they hadn’t met, how could I have given the female soldiers some practice? In the end, it’s all because of me. They were just cooperating with me.\"","Ye Jian believed that with G3 and the rest’s skills. It wouldn’t be a problem for them to escape from this vast desert. The five of them were all elites and were best at hiding at night. How could they be discovered by the male and female soldiers?","Xia Jinyuan knew that she couldn’t bear to see their comrades like this. He smiled faintly and said, \"Practicing is training. Being caught and brought back to the camp is another matter. Since they were willing to be brought back to the camp, I’ll definitely cooperate with them.\"","...","What did he mean?","Ye Jian realized that her IQ was getting lower and lower in front of these soldiers.","\"They could’ve left immediately. There was no need for them to cooperate and return to the camp. Now that they came back voluntarily and cooperated so readily, don’t you think they’re scheming? I’m afraid they have some bad ideas.","\"Before they come up with any bad ideas, I have to stop them first and let them reflect on themselves. Then, they won’t have the energy to come up with any bad ideas.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was already familiar with their comrades’ tricks, wouldn’t sit still and wait for death. He was best at making the first move.","Ye Jian was worried. What should she do? She didn’t notice her comrades having any bad ideas.","Ye Jian, who had yet to enter the team, was about to lose a few strands of her hair. \"Captain Xia, do you think I’ll be taken down by our comrades if I go to the team?\"","Xia Jinyuan was amused by her worried expression. \"There’s such a possibility in terms of intelligence. After all, they’re all wily old foxes. You haven’t adapted to their way of interacting. You don’t have to worry about the martial arts aspect at all. You can defeat them instantly.","\"Besides, you still have me. You don’t have to worry. I’ll help you if you can’t win.\"","These guys wanted to pull his baby into their camp, but in the end, they were too smart for their own good. There was no need for him to put in much effort. His baby had already made her choice to stand by him.","They would never have thought of such an outcome. They would definitely regret it.","Ye Jian thought about it and felt that her boyfriend was right.","That was right. She wasn’t intelligent enough. She had to immediately ask her boyfriend for help!","Alas, she had a bunch of naughty comrades who liked to play tricks on each other. She needed to hurry up and get used to it. How could she always rely on Captain Xia?","Rely on Captain Xia? Yes, she might as well rely on herself.","He said it himself. That was for the best.","Ye Jian still preferred to rely on herself. When she returned to her room, the first thing she did was not to wash up. Instead, she opened a diary and summarized what happened in the early morning. At the end, she wrote: ’If your IQ is not high enough, use force to make up for it. If you can’t win against your comrades, fight them one-on-one!’","Ye Jian felt that a one-on-one battle would be a good solution.","Reality proved that one-on-one combat was a good idea. The entire Xueyu unit knew that their comrade, Azure Bird, was not to be trifled with.","The female soldiers washed up and sat on the small stools. They talked about what happened in the early morning. None of the 20 female soldiers were in good condition. All of them had green, purple, and dark-black bruises on their bodies. When they rolled up their sleeves, it was a shocking sight."]},{"number":4935,"title":"Chapter 4935: Speculation","paragraphs":["The female soldiers looked at their injuries and then at their comrades’ injuries. Their hearts ached for each other.","\"They’re all Captain Xia’s soldiers. I really hate them. This is the first time I’ve been beaten up like this by a male soldier. It’s like domestic violence. I wonder how many days it’ll take for the bruises to go away?\"","\"Even domestic abuse wouldn’t be this bad, right? One of them hugged my waist and threw me to the ground. Come, let’s see if my back is swollen. It was so painful when I was bathing just now that I couldn’t raise my hands.\"","A female soldier lifted her clothes with her back facing her comrades. \"Am I bruised?\"","The female soldiers took a deep breath when the soldier lifted her clothes. \"You need to apply some saffron oil. It’s all purple and covered in dried blood. They’re really ruthless. I want to beat them. I really want to return the favor tenfold.\"","\"I knew it. It must be purple! It hurts, and it’s so cold. I need to hug a hot water bag.\" The female soldier, who had suffered a terrible fall, hurriedly put down her clothes and put on her cotton coat. She sat on the small stool and hugged herself tightly to warm herself.","The conditions in the northwest military unit were quite tough, especially the military unit built in the desert. It was a problem for them to have heating and even use water. The conditions were tough, but no one retreated.","The room without a heater was very cold. Sometimes, they would use the dried feces of wild camels to warm themselves. Or they would pick snow cubes and put them in the furnace to heat them up.","Winter was a difficult season for the soldiers, especially since the roads were blocked by heavy snow. Receiving supplies was a problem. All supplies needed to be used sparingly to prevent shortages.","There were nine northerners and 11 southerners among the female soldiers. What made Ye Jian want to laugh was that the female soldiers from the south were more resistant to the cold than the nine female soldiers from the north.","That was because there was no heating in the south in winter. The female soldiers from the north either had heated beds at home or central heating. In winter, even though it was snowing heavily outside the house, the house was as warm as spring.","Such a huge contrast actually made the southern female soldiers more resistant to the cold than the northern female soldiers.","The female soldiers who needed to exercise in the afternoon took turns to wipe the saffron oil. The strong smell of medicine filled the entire room. Even their chests were filled with the smell of saffron oil.","\"Hiss... Be gentle. Be gentle. It hurts!\"","\"It’s all purple. I need to rub it harder. Bear with it.\"","\"Do we still have saffron oil? Do we have enough? If not, we have to go to the infirmary to get more. I wonder if the supply of saffron oil will be cut off this winter.\"","\"No, the five of them won’t stay in our camp for long. They’ll leave in two days at most. No, it won’t take two days. It’ll snow the day after tomorrow. They’ll leave tomorrow at the latest.\"","\"I hope they leave as soon as possible. I feel scared when I see them. It was 5 to 34, but we didn’t gain any advantage! We were beaten up badly by them, and the male soldiers weren’t much better than us.\"","\"They’re from the special forces. But they...\" Yang Zhen, the squad leader, rubbed the saffron oil on Gao Xiao’s shoulder and said in a low voice, \"They’re a little different from the special forces soldiers I’ve seen.\"","\"They’re definitely different. No one else could beat us to this extent, right? Sigh, it hurts... Don’t tell me my bones are broken? Why does it hurt so much?\" Gao Xiao was in so much pain that her face was distorted. She gasped several times. \"They’re too ruthless. I was thrown four times by them! If Qiu Tong hadn’t saved me in time, I would’ve fallen a fifth time.","\"Qiu Tong, thank you. I’ll repay you next time.\"","Qiu Tong, who was rubbing saffron oil on another comrade’s calf, didn’t even raise her head. She smiled and said, \"No, let’s hope there’s no next time. Once is enough. I don’t want to repeat this a second time.\"","If this happened a second time, she doubted that she would be able to survive the five special forces soldiers."]},{"number":4936,"title":"Chapter 4936: Protective","paragraphs":["The female soldiers didn’t want it to happen a second time. They were all frightened by the five unfamiliar male special forces soldiers.","Gao Xiao, whose face was distorted from the pain, felt that there would definitely be a next time. \"That’s not necessarily true. The next part will be high-intensity training. Instructor Ye won’t be soft-hearted. We’ll still be covered in wounds every day.\"","When Gao Xiao mentioned the instructor, Ye Jian, the dormitory instantly turned silent. Even Yang Zhen lowered her eyes slightly as she focused on massaging Gao Xiao’s shoulders.","Gao Xiao, who made the dormitory fall into silence, pursed her lips and broke the silence in a low voice. \"Do you all feel that... Instructor Ye is different from the military school students who just graduated?","\"I felt it in the past. Today, I feel that it’s even more so. Those five special forces soldiers are obviously very familiar with Instructor Ye. Captain Xia is also familiar with Instructor Ye’s matters. His soldiers are also familiar with Instructor Ye. What do you think... is their relationship?\"","The relationship was deep, but no one said it out loud.","Yang Zhen, whose palms were red from massaging, retracted her hand and smiled brightly. \"It’s fine as long as you know in your heart. There’s no need to say it out loud.\" ,","Instructor Ye didn’t tell them personally. It might be inconvenient for them to reveal her true identity. Even if they knew, they had to pretend not to know.","Gao Xiao was bold and simple-minded. She felt that with their relationship with Ye Jian, there was no need for them to be so careful that they had to avoid talking about such things.","She said directly, \"She’s our instructor. She wants to train the 20 of us into special forces soldiers. She’s our instructor and our teacher. There’s nothing wrong with saying some things, right, Qiu Tong?\"","She asked Qiu Tong in the end purely out of reflex. She was used to it.","Qiu Tong thought for a while before nodding slowly. \"You’re right. We don’t have to be so careful. Why did we come? Why was Instructor Ye able to be our instructor after graduating? The main reason is that Instructor Ye is a special forces soldier, and she’s also a soldier in Captain Xia’s team.","\"That’s why she knows the male soldiers who fought with us and why Captain Xia is also familiar with Instructor Ye.\"","Gao Xiao pressed her palms together. She moved too much, which tugged on her shoulder. Before she could speak, she was in so much pain that she let out a breath. \"That’s right. We don’t have to be so careful. Instructor Ye might be strict and cold, but she’s actually a good person.\"","\"I made such a huge mistake. She did punish me, but she didn’t have any intention of reporting it to the higher-ups. One look and you can tell that she’s a very protective instructor.","\"Usually, leaders who are protective of their own soldiers have a common problem. They can scold their own soldiers at will, but they’ll never allow others to criticize them. When something happens, they won’t just push their own soldiers out. They’ll take the initiative to take responsibility.","\"I quite like leaders who are protective of their own people. Even if they’re strict with me, I feel at ease. From the difficulty of the training arranged for us by instructor Ye, I can tell that she hopes that all of us can become special forces female soldiers and become members of the first female special forces unit.\"","Yang Zhen was shocked when she heard Gao Xiao’s words. She didn’t understand such simple logic. She was even worried that she wouldn’t pass and would be eliminated by instructor Ye.","The 20 female soldiers all wanted to become special forces soldiers, but not all of them would qualify in the end. The former regimental commander had secretly revealed some things to Yang Zhen and told her that if she wanted to stay, she had to be more careful and not give the others the advantage.","She always remembered that she had to do her job carefully. She hoped that Instructor Ye could put in a few more good words about her so that she could officially become a female special forces soldier."]},{"number":4937,"title":"Chapter 4937: Confession","paragraphs":["Now, Gao Xiao’s words made her realize how narrow-minded and short-sighted she was!","How could instructor Ye, who trained them diligently, give up on any female soldier?","She wouldn’t!","She only hoped that all the female soldiers could realize their dreams and become special forces soldiers!","Yang Zhen’s emotions were fluctuating. After putting on her clothes, Gao Xiao stood up and took the saffron oil from Yang Zhen’s hand. \"Squad leader, it’s your turn. I’ll massage it in for you.","\"Did you see who hit you the most? I regret hitting them so hard that I forgot to pay attention to who hit me the most.","\"I watched them secretly for a long time on the way back to the camp. I felt that all five of them hit me. They’re good-looking too. They’re tall and have good figures. It’s just that they’re too ruthless.\"","The change in topic was too abrupt. One second ago, she was still holding a grudge. The next second, she was talking about the five good-looking male soldiers.","But then again, the five special forces soldiers were indeed good-looking.","The people in the dormitory of the deputy squad leader also talked about the handsome faces of G3 and the others. Some female soldiers felt that K7, who never said anything, was the best-looking. Some female soldiers said that T6, who had a baby face and handsome facial features, was good-looking. Some said that V8 was good-looking too. As for Z7, Han Zheng, all the female soldiers thought that his eyes were the best.","His eyes were passionate and gentle.","As for G3, they didn’t dare to talk about him. It was obvious that G3 had a high status among the five of them. They didn’t dare to talk about him.","\"Captain Xia is handsome, and Instructor Ye is beautiful. Even the comrades in their company are handsome. What kind of special forces unit do you think they are? Don’t tell me that before one joins, they’re assessed based on their looks?\"","\"Besides Instructor Ye, are there any other female soldiers in their team? Do they fight with the male soldiers every day during training? Can Instructor Ye defeat them?\"","The female soldiers who had a break in the morning talked about Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan, and G3 the most when they were rubbing the saffron oil.","What Ye Jian didn’t expect was that the female soldiers, who were beaten up until their bodies were covered in bruises, decided to target G3 and the other five. They wanted to become female special forces soldiers who could beat G3 and the rest up.","When Ye Jian found out, she expressed her strong support.","As for whether she was a special forces soldier or not, when Gao Xiao suddenly asked her the question during the afternoon training. Ye Jian didn’t hide it and explained to the 20 female soldiers, \"I’m indeed a special forces soldier. I’m also Captain Xia’s soldier. The five people who beat you until you were almost disabled are all my comrades.","\"In the early morning, Captain Xia and I discovered their traces first. After recognizing them, I asked Captain Xia to get them to practice with you. That’s why you’re covered in injuries now.","\"If you want to become a special forces soldier like them, I believe you can do it. As long as you train hard, you can all become special forces soldiers.","\"Alright, now that you have a good gun, lay on the ground for two hours. Whoever drops the bullet on the tip of the gun will wash the dirty clothes of all your comrades in the dormitory.","\"One, two, three, gather!\"","Ye Jian, who was very good at clearing the female soldiers’ doubts, didn’t let them rest for too long. She said that they would rest for ten minutes, and they were only given ten minutes—not a minute more, not a minute less.","G3 and the other five people, who were released from the confinement room, observed Ye Jian’s training with the female soldiers. They had deep smiles on their faces."]},{"number":4938,"title":"Chapter 4938: Dark History","paragraphs":["Azure Bird was Azure Bird. She could show off her skills wherever she went. They weren’t worried that her talent would be wasted. She just graduated from the military school, but she was very good at training female soldiers. She didn’t have any hesitation when it came to female soldiers who were older than her.","G3 smiled and sighed. \"No wonder the military dared to hand such a heavy responsibility to Azure Bird. If they don’t hand it to her, who else can they hand it to? I don’t think there’s a more suitable candidate.\"","T6 raised his eyebrows. \"Think about who Azure Bird is. She’s a female soldier who dared to carry out missions with Q King when she was in junior high. No, at that time, she wasn’t a soldier. She was just a student. Junior high, senior high... If we count carefully, Azure Bird has already done many big things before she even became an adult!","\"Thinking back to before I was an adult, I only caused trouble everywhere and thought that I was a big shot. I wasn’t like Azure Bird, who could already take on huge responsibilities at such a young age.","It was fine if they didn’t count the number of achievements. Now that they did, T6 and the rest were shocked.","It was true!","Ever since she was in junior high, Azure Bird had already started to show her strengths. In the ninth grade, she went overseas to participate in the Olympic games and happened to catch Red Scorpion. She even cooperated with Q King to participate in the mission. Later, they heard from Q King that it was the first time she used a gun to kill someone.","After killing someone, she didn’t feel much fear at that time because there was a male classmate beside her who needed protection. After killing, her entire body was trembling. She couldn’t lift the gun in her hand for a long time. She was too nervous. She was so nervous that she lost control of her fingers and couldn’t move them freely.","Ever since then, Azure Bird had officially walked into the sight of her comrades. She participated in missions again and again and completed them perfectly. Nothing ever went wrong.","It had been eight and a half years since she graduated from junior high to senior year. The young girl in the past had become a young lieutenant who could shoulder heavy responsibilities alone. She used her method to hand in a paper that satisfied the military very much.","Looking at Ye Jian, who was leading the training, G3 and the rest recalled what they did before they turned 18 years old. They realized that they didn’t do anything big before they turned 18 years old.","Especially Z7. He seriously recalled what he did before he turned 18 years old. He was busy wooing girls, getting a girlfriend, smoking, drinking, and fighting.","If he hadn’t been beaten up by Little Six of the Xia family, he would probably have touched the things he shouldn’t.","Before he turned 18 years old, he had indeed done many big things. However, they were all bad things. He never did anything prim and proper.","Due to his ridiculous private life in the past, Z7 was afraid that his comrades would dig up his dark history again. He was forced to suppress his voice and pretend to be serious. \"Do you see anything?\"","He pointed at Ye Jian and lowered his voice. \"Do you see anything?\"","T6, who was the first to be led by the nose, narrowed his eyes and watched Ye Jian for a while. He only saw that the female soldiers were very respectful to Azure Bird and obeyed all her orders. He couldn’t see anything else.","He shook his head. \"I don’t see anything.\"","V8 didn’t see anything either. He shook his head too.","Z7 rolled his eyes at the two of them. What happened to their tacit understanding? They fumbled the ball at the critical moment!","He turned to G3 and asked, \"Do you notice anything?\"","G3, who didn’t want Z7 to roll his eyes at him, watched seriously for at least three minutes. In the end, he pulled his camouflage jacket closer around his body and shook his head.","Z7, who had successfully diverted his comrades’ attention, wanted to knock their heads a few times. \"What’s up with your observation skills? None of you can see anything! What a disappointment. Brother, what about you? Do you see anything?\"","It was none other than K7."]},{"number":4939,"title":"Chapter 4939: Like Q King","paragraphs":["K7 who was the only one who hadn’t spoken. He glanced coldly at the ’claw’ on his shoulder. The moment the two made eye contact, Z7 retracted his claw as if it were on fire.","That gaze made him think that the hand he placed on his shoulder wasn’t his own. It was the hand of a cadaver who had been soaked in formalin!","He felt a chill down his spine.","K7 retracted his hair-raising gaze. His thin lips moved slightly. \"Q King.\"","\"That’s right! Our forensic doctor has a pair of eyes that are good at discovering the truth!\" Z7 clapped his hands in relief.","Although he was afraid that his dark history would be dug up, he did discover this problem. He didn’t expect only K7 and him to see it.","\"Have you placed your brains in the military unit and not brought them out? You didn’t notice such an obvious problem.\" Z7, who had crushed his three comrades, kept shaking his head like an old man. He looked at everyone as though they were stupid and he was the only smart one. G3, T6, and V8 wanted to greet him with their fists.","\"Azure Bird’s training is very similar to Q King’s. I’m sure all of you know what kind of training Q King had us undergo. Even wily old foxes like you are afraid of him, let alone female soldiers.","\"The female soldiers know how powerful the instructor who’s training them is. They wouldn’t dare to have any ulterior motives. Back then, when Q King parachuted into the brigade, you veterans caused a lot of trouble for him, right? In the end, you were dealt with by Q King. He had just arrived and was busy familiarizing himself with the environment. Unexpectedly, you thought that Q King was easy to bully. In the end, you shot yourself in the foot.","\"I watched as Q King defeated you back then, but dozens of you took turns to trip him up. Even so, he could counter every move. But Q King was so tired that he lost eight kilograms in half a month!","\"Look at Azure Bird now. Look at the soldiers she’s leading. I dare say that they never tripped up Azure Bird. On the contrary, they tried to take her down a notch but she established her might. She let them know that she wasn’t someone to be trifled with. That’s why they’re so respectful today.","At first, G3 and the rest didn’t think that there was anything unusual. Now that Z7 had explained it, they felt that Z7 wasn’t hallucinating.","At first, G3 and the rest didn’t think that there was anything unusual. Now that Z7 had explained it, they felt that Z7 wasn’t hallucinating.","Incredible! One Q King was enough to give them a headache. Now, there was another ’Q King’. Wouldn’t it be even more terrifying?","Instantly, T6 felt a chill down his spine. He looked around. After confirming that Xia Jinyuan wasn’t around, he whispered, \"I’m nervous now. Will we be able to cause trouble for Q King in the future?\"","\"Tsk, you make it sound as though everything went smoothly for us before. But it never happened even once!\" Z7 rolled his eyes again. \"Stop dreaming! Azure Bird definitely wouldn’t help us.\"","\"I don’t have any other requests now. I just hope that Azure Bird can remain neutral in the future. It’s best to sit this one out and reap the spoils later. I’ll only watch the show and not interfere.\"","V8 and T6 kept nodding.","That was right!","They didn’t expect Azure Bird to help Q King go against them. They just hoped that when they tricked Q King, she would just watch from the sidelines.","K7 saw that they were letting their imaginations run wild again. He complained in his heart that it was boring. He moved his long legs and walked away first.","He just wanted to see how she led the team. If the female soldiers were convinced, he, as Ye Jian’s comrade-in-arms, wouldn’t be able to help her much. However, if the female soldiers weren’t convinced and made things difficult for her from time to time, he didn’t mind continuing to train with the female soldiers and leaving later.","The five of them watched for about half an hour before turning around and leaving the training ground."]},{"number":4940,"title":"Chapter 4940: Interference","paragraphs":["The reason why the five of them were able to come out of the confinement room was because Battalion Commander Tian had confirmed that they were indeed here on an inspection mission. Furthermore, it was an order from the military.","Battalion Commander Tian was so shocked that cold sweat broke out on his back.","After confirming it, Battalion Commander Tian immediately asked the soldiers to release the five of them. As for Xia Jinyuan, he didn’t know that the five of them had left the confinement room.","The female soldiers, who didn’t know that they had escaped a bullet, continued to grit their teeth and train. The wind blew fiercely, cutting their faces like knives. Sand and dust floated into their eyes. Even though they were so uncomfortable that they teared up, the female soldiers didn’t raise their hands to wipe their eyes.","From today onward, all the female soldiers would undergo intense training. Holding a gun for two hours was the easiest part of the intensive training.","They held their rifles with both hands and pressed the butts of their guns against their shoulders. They stared straight ahead. Even the number of times they blinked decreased correspondingly.","It was a little uncomfortable to hold a gun for two hours. They gritted their teeth and endured it.","If they couldn’t grit her teeth and persevere, once the bullet fell from the muzzle, they would be making things harder for themselves.","\"Keep your eyes level, aim forward, and don’t move! Adjust your breathing, make it smooth and long. Don’t just go deep and shallow. Aim at a point on my body, and think carefully about what kind of shooting methods you need to use in different directions to aim at the target and hit it with one shot.","\"I said to look at a certain spot on my body so that you’ll have a target in mind. You shouldn’t shoot. I’m just within the lethal range of the blank cartridge. If your hands tremble, you might really hit me.","\"Especially the female soldier who’s aiming at the back of my chest. Did you pull the trigger a little? If you pull it a little deeper, the bullet will really leave the barrel.\"","Ye Jian, who was also lying down and holding a gun, could still open her mouth to remind the female soldiers. She was lying in front, which meant that there were 20 Type 95 rifles with blank cartridges aiming at her.","She kept talking. She wasn’t distracted at all. She was focused on disturbing the female soldiers and distracting them.","She wanted the female soldiers to aim their guns at any part of her body, including her head. She wanted to see if the female soldiers could get past her interference.","That year, Principal Chen used this method to train Ye Jian too.","Even after so many years, it was still a good method.","It could strengthen the mental fortitude of the female soldiers and also let them know that their comrades’ backs would be left to them.","Ye Jian didn’t have much hope that everyone would be able to last for two hours, but maybe they could do it after three months of forceful training. It was just that the first training was always difficult.","Before this, the longest the female soldiers had held their guns for was half an hour. After half an hour, the female soldiers’ arms started to ache, and their fingers started to stiffen. Sweat would drip into their eyes. There were even ants on their bodies.","A bullet fell from the barrel. It was none other than the female soldier who had aimed at the back of Ye Jian’s head. At this moment, she was sweating profusely. When the bullet fell, she froze for a moment. Then, she buried her head in her arms and smiled bitterly.","She was distracted.","She didn’t pull the trigger at all. However, she was worried that if her hand trembled and she really pulled the trigger, the blank cartridge would really shoot into the back of the instructor’s head.","As long as she thought of the possibility, she wasn’t able to calm down and aim at her target.","The first female soldier who failed buried her head for about a minute. She found a small stone beside her and blew on it, indicating that she had failed."]},{"number":4941,"title":"Chapter 4941: Angry","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was lying at the front, didn’t turn around. It was impossible for her to notice that a female soldier’s bullet had fallen. It all depended on whether the female soldier was honest and could accept failure.","She said that she would accompany them for every training session and would never watch from the sidelines. She meant what she said and would not change it.","As time passed, the female soldiers became more and more tired. Their eyes became more and more sore. Bullets fell from the barrels one after another. They quickly put them back on and continued.","As for Ye Jian, who was lying in front, the bullet on her barrel didn’t fall once after two hours. The wind was so strong, but she was able to stabilize the bullet and not drop it.","The female soldiers were so envious their eyes turned red.","However, they also knew that such skills could not be achieved in a day. They had to undergo long and arduous training like today.","Ye Jian put away her gun and stood up. The female soldiers were still lying on the ground. Without her order, no one got up even though the time was up.","Ye Jian walked from the female soldier at the front to the one at the very back. When she saw the stones of different sizes on their side, Ye Jian, who had returned to the front, said coldly, \"Keep your guns and gather!\"","The female soldiers’ hearts sank.","They all failed. No one persevered.","In the afternoon, the female soldiers each carried five catties of sandbags. From today onward, they would need to tie sandbags around their wrists for two hours every day until they could maintain their guns for four hours.","Holding their guns for two hours without moving was indeed the easiest part of the tough training.","Ye Jian continued to accompany the female soldiers for training. On the other hand, Xia Jinyuan threw the training plan he rushed out to the five people who came to his room. His handsome face was covered with dark clouds. A storm was coming.","\"You’re quite shameless. You’ve all walked around the camp and know a lot about the heroic deeds of the Vanguard Battalion, right? Not bad. You were brought back to the camp dejectedly. How broad-minded of you. You’re treating it as a vacation, right?","\"There are 34 soldiers, and there are five of you. Couldn’t you win? I wonder who told me that one against a few isn’t a problem?","\"I asked you to practice with the female soldiers, but you were discovered by them first! Do you still feel honored to be discovered by them? Do you want to raise your flag and run around the camp to tell everyone that you lost?","\"I asked you to stay in the confinement room because I wanted to save some face for you and myself. Look at you. You’re still showing off. You’re so magnanimous. I admit defeat!\"","The five of them stood in front of Xia Jinyuan. Although they held their heads high, their hearts were trembling like leaves in the wind.","Alas!","If he had known, they would have stayed in the confinement room!","It had been a long time since Q King was angry. They were almost scared to death.","G3 said in a low voice, \"It’s my fault for not restraining my team members properly!\"","\"I know that you’re in the wrong. I don’t plan to let you off so easily.\" Xia Jinyuan sneered. There was no joy on his handsome face. It was filled with coldness and viciousness. \"As the vice-captain, you didn’t reflect on yourself and even took the lead to relax. G3, your mistake is deep!\"","\"I accept all punishments. There won’t be a next time.\" G3 didn’t explain himself because there was no need to.","They were good at night battles, but they were discovered. They weren’t the ones who discovered the soldiers first and took the initiative to attack.","This was the root of Q King’s anger."]},{"number":4942,"title":"Chapter 4942: Real And Fake","paragraphs":["The other four people had dark expressions as they accepted Q King’s reprimand. They had no objections.","\"This is the training of the team. Three months later, I’ll come back to assess you. If you don’t complete one round, you know what will happen to you. Do you understand?\"","\"I understand!\"","\"I understand!\"","\"I understand!\"","...","Five voices sounded at the same time. Xia Jinyuan had issued them a military order.","If one of them didn’t pass, they would accept any punishment unconditionally!","As for the male soldiers who wanted to laugh at Xia Jinyuan at the fact that his soldiers were weaker than the female soldiers who Ye Jian led... they didn’t have the mood to do it anymore. They didn’t even think about it.","At 3:00 pm, Ye Jian was still training with the female soldiers. G3 and the rest left on foot. They didn’t even have the time to greet Ye Jian.","Battalion Commander Tian watched as the five figures strode away. He confirmed again, \"Do we really not need to send a car? Are we really going to let them leave on foot? It’s more than a hundred kilometers. Are you really going to let them leave on foot? It’s snowing the day after tomorrow. Are you sure they can leave before the snow falls?\"","He was really worried about Captain Xia’s angry arrangement. He was worried, so it was better to ask again.","What if he was really impulsive?","Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"I’m very sure. It’s only a hundred kilometers. It’s just a walk. It’s their own business if they haven’t left by the time it snows.\"","...","Battalion Commander Tian wanted to secretly send a car to follow them!m","Why did he feel that Captain Xia was very casual with his soldiers?","After Xia Jinyuan insisted, Battalion Commander Tian didn’t ask anymore. However, the next night, he immediately called to confirm if the five of them had arrived at the military depot. When he knew that the five of them had arrived at four in the afternoon, Battalion Commander Tian, who was relieved, hung up the phone and didn’t come back to his senses for a long time.","The combat power of these special forces soldiers was so strong that it made him fear them.","Ye Jian knew that although it was a pity that G3 and the other five didn’t manage to say their goodbyes, it didn’t affect her mood. She continued leading the soldiers to train and didn’t divert her attention to care about too many miscellaneous matters.","Due to the arrival of G3 and the rest, the troops stationed in the desert started to reorganize. Snow fell, but the reorganization of the troops continued.","Battalion Commander Tian was so busy that he would receive countless calls or conference calls every day. Every day, he wished that he could turn one minute into ten minutes.","Seeing this, Ye Jian secretly asked Xia Jinyuan one night if the base hidden in the desert was very dangerous.","Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting in the chair, smiled at her. \"Do you think that there’s only one base? Father-in-law’s base has countless satellites. All the countries in the world know about it. Instead of being stared at by foreign countries, it’s better to tell them openly. However, even a cunning rabbit has three burrows.\"","There was no need to continue making things clear.","Ye Jian understood when she saw the serious expression on his face!","A cunning rabbit had three burrows, but there would always be a target that attracted attention. The more targets that were exposed to the public attracted attention, the safer the other hidden bases would be.","Just like in Area 51 of the United States, those people had released many true and false news. Even the news of aliens had been released, attracting the attention of all the people in the world. They had even attracted countless explorers.","In the end, who really entered Area 51? Who stood up to confirm the existence of aliens in Area 51?","No one.","Area 51 was an extremely important secret military base in the United States. It was also a military base that was currently known. Just like the base where Mr. Fu was at, it was known, but no one had ever gone near it.","The more mysterious it was, the more attention it needed to receive. It needed to be heavily guarded by soldiers. That way, it would attract the attention of other countries.","From then on, Ye Jian didn’t ask how many secret bases there were in the desert. She just needed to know that those unknown bases were very safe. The base where Mr. Fu was at was also very safe. It was enough.","Ye Jian, who arrived in the desert in September, started the countdown in the fourth month. As long as it was in the day, no matter how strong the wind was or how heavy the snow was, the female soldier class led by Ye Jian would gather at 5:30 am sharp and start the day’s training.","The Spring Festival also came quietly amidst the tense and arduous training."]},{"number":4943,"title":"Chapter 4943: Happiness In Pain","paragraphs":["Although the training was tough, the festive atmosphere in the military unit was strong. Especially with the addition of the female soldiers, everyone wanted to show their martial arts skills.","The officer had just released the notice that there would be a Spring Festival Gala when he received a very enthusiastic response from the male soldiers and female soldiers. Even the company commander supported the male soldiers in doing a few good programs so that the female soldiers could see how capable they were.","The male soldiers were indeed multi-talented. They performed martial arts, played musical instruments, and performed ensembles. At the same time, they sang and danced passionately. There was even a male soldier who knew how to dance the cha-cha. His partner was his comrade.","Before the program list was confirmed, the male and female cha-cha dance team became the most popular program.","When Ye Jian found out that the male soldiers were so capable, she couldn’t help but wipe the cold sweat off her forehead. She realized that... she didn’t have any talents.","She didn’t, but the female soldiers in her class did!","On the day the notice was issued, Ye Jian made the female soldiers stay back. She hoped that the female soldiers would energetically sign up and not be inferior to the male soldiers.","The 20 female soldiers’ resumes went through Ye Jian’s mind one by one. She knew who had artistic specialties. She respected them by asking them first. How could she make decisions for everything?","The female soldiers were discussing this matter in the afternoon. As Ye Jian had been holding it in, they didn’t dare to take the initiative to mention it. They had been discussing it in private and even discussed a few programs to crush the male soldiers.","They had to fight for first place. They didn’t even care about second place.","Now that Ye Jian had taken the initiative to suggest it, the female soldiers standing in the cold wind started talking. The squad leader, Yang Zhen, reported the programs they had secretly discussed in the afternoon to Ye Jian. Ye Jian was happy when she heard that. \"Sure, you can arrange it yourself.","\"I think the male soldiers are going all out. Our female soldier class can’t fall behind.\"","After thinking for a moment, she said, \"From tonight onward, the training time at night will be shortened by an hour so that you can rehearse the programs. Try to reach a high standard. Although I don’t dare to say that we have to be the best, we have to be better than the male soldiers.","\"Girls are the best at performing!\"","As for herself, she chose to be an audience member.","When the female soldiers heard that Ye Jian valued it so much that their company training time was shortened by an hour, they couldn’t believe it.","A female soldier asked carefully, \"Instructor, are you really planning to shorten the training time by one hour? Then... what about that one hour of training?\"","It was very important. She had to ask clearly.","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows and revealed a faint smile. Her smile was like a slowly blooming flower, but it made the female soldier want to slap herself. She felt that... she had asked a question that would make all her comrades want to vomit blood.","When the other female soldiers saw this, alarm bells rang in their hearts. Something bad was going to happen!","Ye Jian saw that the female soldiers were like furry kittens. The smile on her face deepened. \"Don’t worry. We can compress the one hour of training. We won’t delay any training.\"","As expected!","She knew that with instructor Ye’s strictness, she wouldn’t let them off so easily. There had to be a backup plan. There just had to be!","Slack off? Ha, don’t even think about it.","The female soldiers’ faces turned green. It was as if all their strength had been drained.","One shouldn’t underestimate one hour of training. Every hour of training was high-intensity and difficult. Thinking about compressing an hour’s worth of training, the female soldiers couldn’t help but tremble."]},{"number":4944,"title":"Chapter 4944: So Familiar","paragraphs":["As for Ye Jian, she smiled and encouraged the female soldiers. \"You have to believe that your potential is limitless. Once you get used to it, you won’t feel tired anymore. Just like now, you’re used to training every day. You’ll also get used to completing all kinds of missions. You might be even better than before.\"","\"It’s New Year’s Eve today. The training will end at 8:00 pm. You can choose to start rehearsing tonight. As for me, I’ll go to the male soldiers’ camp to scout the situation tonight. I’ll report to you later.\" After saying that, she got the squad leader to dismiss the class.","On New Year’s Eve, Xia Jinyuan wasn’t in the camp. Three days ago, he left the camp with the male soldiers and went to another camp to communicate. He would rush back to the camp in the morning at the latest or he might come back tonight.","Ye Jian thought that he would come back in the morning. Who knew that he would rush back to the camp at 7:00 pm on New Year’s Eve? When he knew that the camp was holding a party, Battalion Commander Tian even smiled and asked if he wanted to go on stage to show off or perform with Instructor Ye from the female soldier class.","Xia Jinyuan thought for a moment and replied to Battalion Commander Tian seriously, \"Forget about the performance. Leave this opportunity to the soldiers. As for me, I just want to be a quiet handsome man below the stage.\"","Ye Jian was beside him. He wanted to be a quiet and handsome man as he watched the show with his girlfriend and bid farewell to the year.","When Battalion Commander Tian mentioned Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan remembered that he had known Ye Jian for eight years and had been in love with her for five and a half years. They had never really spent the Spring Festival together. The two of them had spent a lot of National Days together, but not were they together during the Spring Festival.","Hence, this was the first time the two of them were spending the Spring Festival together. He just wanted to accompany Ye Jian.","Battalion Commander Tian was amused by him. Xia Jinyuan was a quiet and handsome man. Hahaha, Captain Xia was really interesting. \"You’re a handsome man. A few days ago, Zhu Zhongguo even told me that you’ve been in our camp for so long, but your skin is still so fair. You’re not like him. Even his teeth are almost tanned from the sun. The same goes for Instructor Ye is the same. She’s not tanned at all.\"","Xia Jinyuan raised his hand and looked at the back of his hand. That was true. He and Ye Jian weren’t tanned. Even if they were, their skin tone would be restored in half a month.","It couldn’t be helped. They were so compatible inside and outside!","After reporting to Battalion Commander Tian, Xia Jinyuan ignored his fatigue and went to look for Ye Jian. Halfway through, he suddenly remembered that Ye Jian was still training. Even if he went over now, they couldn’t meet.","He decided to return to his room and change out of his dirty clothes.","Stepping on the dry snow, Xia Jinyuan returned to his room and went to the boiler room to get two bottles of hot water. He took a shower and treated the blisters on the soles of his feet. Then, he wrote down the report on the four days of exchange. He would pass it to Battalion Commander Tian tomorrow.","Around 8:00 pm, Xia Jinyuan heard the sound of the room door opening from next door. Then, familiar footsteps were heard. His girlfriend, who was one wall away from him, was back.","Ye Jian didn’t immediately realize that her boyfriend was in his room. She unbuckled her belt and walked to the bed. She didn’t know until she looked out of the window and saw light shining on the snow next door.","Putting down her belt, Ye Jian walked out of the room quickly.","Xia Jinyuan smiled when he heard the footsteps. Just by listening to the footsteps, he knew that she had walked out of the room... and was walking toward him.","Ye Jian walked out of her room. Xia Jinyuan put down his pen and stood up. He walked toward the door too. Just as Ye Jian was about to knock on the door, Xia Jinyuan pulled open the closed door. Xia Jinyuan, who had short hair, appeared in front of Ye Jian with a smile. \"Instructor Ye, what a coincidence.\""]},{"number":4945,"title":"Chapter 4945: Impulsive","paragraphs":["He was the one who heard her footsteps and walked over to open the door.","She saw that he had turned on the lights in front of his desk and there was a notebook on it. There was a pen on the notebook, so she knew that he was writing a report.","Ye Jian didn’t come in immediately. \"Did I disturb you?\"","\"No, I’m almost done.\" Xia Jinyuan turned his body and reached out his hand. He grabbed Ye Jian’s wrist and pulled her into his room.","Ye Jian didn’t expect him to suddenly pull her. She was caught off guard and jumped into his arms.","Click!","The door was closed by Xia Jinyuan’s long leg. He hugged Ye Jian tightly and laughed softly. \"Did you miss me so much? You’re so anxious to snuggle into my arms.\"","\"You suddenly pulled me, and I lost my balance.\" Ye Jian defended herself. However, she didn’t escape from his warm arms. Instead, she leaned over and reached out to hug his waist. She said slowly, \"I missed you a little, so I came to look for you immediately.\"","Hearing that, Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were filled with gentleness. He lowered his head and kissed her hair. He smiled and sighed. \"I missed you more than you missed me. I didn’t miss you a little. I missed you very much.","\"Especially when I thought about spending the Spring Festival with you for the first time, I missed you even more.\"","Ye Jian, who was buried in his arms, nodded heavily. \"Yes, we’ll celebrate the Spring Festival together this year. When the time comes, we’ll call home to wish our elders. My grandfather will definitely be sitting by the phone again, waiting for my call.\"","\"Okay, let’s call the old master first to wish him a happy new year. Then, we’ll call my grandpa and grandma. As for my father, we have to greet him too. Otherwise, he’ll be so angry that he’ll run back to the military to work overtime on the first day of the new year. It’s the new year. We should let the guards have a good rest. We shouldn’t cause them trouble.\"","After he finished speaking, Ye Jian said softly, \"I have to talk to my grandpa more. Dad didn’t go home this year, and I didn’t go home either. Only Uncle Fu is accompanying Grandpa for the holidays. Grandpa... is very lonely.\"","Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia had many children and grandchildren. The entire family needed four tables. As for the Fu family... The entire family only needed four seats. If Uncle Fu went home, there would be another empty seat.","The Fu family was too cold.","Fortunately, the old man was already used to it. Moreover, students would come to accompany the old man for the Spring Festival. This could comfort the old man.","Xia Jinyuan placed his chin on the top of Ye Jian’s head and nodded. \"It’s what we should do. In the future, as long as we can return to the capital city for the new year, we’ll accompany the old master to welcome the new and bid farewell to the old.\"","The Xia family was very lively during the new year. A few more children were born, so it was even more lively.","Hence, when Xia Jinyuan suggested going to the Fu family to spend the new year with Grandpa Fu, the Xia family didn’t have any objections.","Xia Jinyuan’s understanding made Ye Jian step on the ground. She kissed his chin lightly. \"Thank you, Captain Xia.\"","\"Why are you thanking me? I’m the son-in-law of the Fu family. Why? Do you want to treat me like an outsider? I’ll be angry if you do that.\" Xia Jinyuan pretended to be angry and raised his chin. \"Hurry up and kiss me again to comfort me. If not, I’ll be angry until tomorrow morning!\"","He was trying to get a kiss.","Ye Jian was willing to cooperate even though she knew that he did it on purpose. This time, it wasn’t just a simple tiptoe. She hooked her arms around his neck and kissed his lips.","The last time they kissed was the day they first came to the camp. It was so long ago that Ye Jian, who had always restrained herself, became exceptionally proactive.","The weather was too cold. It was so cold that she needed a warm hug. That was why she was impulsive."]},{"number":4946,"title":"Chapter 4946: Back And Forth","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan accepted the kiss happily. He held the back of Ye Jian’s head with one hand and let their kiss go deeper. They were filled with love.","Ye Jian hooked her arms around his neck and responded to his affection enthusiastically. She was like a moth flying into a flame. She poured all her love of two lifetimes into Xia Jinyuan and never regretted it.","Snow was fluttering outside the window. The small snowflakes fell one after another. The lights in the window were bright. Two figures were intertwined on the wall. Although the weather was cold, their hearts were as warm as spring.","The two of them agreed to be spectators on the night of the gala. They would sit below the stage and watch the soldiers perform. After the performance ended, the two of them would go out for a walk and wait for 12:00 am to welcome the new year.","The two of them agreed to be spectators, but their soldiers didn’t want to let them off. The male and female soldiers huddled together and discussed softly like thieves. In the end, they agreed that they must invite the instructors to perform.","When the training ended at 8:00 pm the next night, the female soldiers surrounded Ye Jian, who was preparing to leave. They used Yang Zhen as a representative to express the thoughts of all the female soldiers.","Ye Jian saw that she was surrounded and that they didn’t want her to leave easily. She smiled and glanced at the female soldiers. She asked, \"Whose idea is it? Gao Xiao, was it you?\"","She was the only one who had the guts to suggest such a thing.","Gao Xiao immediately surrendered and said, \"Reporting to the instructor, I’m innocent. It wasn’t me. It was another quiet-looking comrade. She took the initiative to suggest it!\"","A very quiet comrade... Ye Jian looked at Yang Zhen. Although Yang Zhen was the squad leader, she was quiet most of the time and didn’t play much with the comrades.","She was the squad leader. She had to be careful.","Yang Zhen had a headache. She didn’t expect Gao Xiao to surrender so quickly. She had no choice but to confess.","\"Talent is my shortcoming. I don’t have any talent. If you really want to watch me do something, I can perform a live shot. For example, if any of you have an apple on your head and an apple in your hands, I’ll be able to shoot the apples directly.\"","After saying that, the female soldiers took a step back silently.","Shooting an apple on the top of someone’s head... They knew that Instructor Ye’s shooting skills were very good, but they didn’t have the guts!","It was live ammunition. If the aim deviated slightly, it would be a shot to the head.","Their goal had not been achieved. They could not give up their lives for a festival.","Before they could force her to perform, the female soldiers were frightened by Ye Jian’s valiance. The next day, the female soldiers told the male soldiers the results. The male soldiers were dumbfounded.","Instructor Ye... was too valiant!","\"Then forget it. No matter how good her skills are, nothing is foolproof. Live ammunition can really kill people. Only Instructor Ye would dare to say that. Even our instructor doesn’t dare to.\"","As soon as the squad leader finished speaking, Instructor Xia’s cold voice came from behind. \"What do you mean by I don’t dare? Why are you defaming me in front of the female soldiers?\"","\"Hehe, no, no. I definitely don’t have any intention of defaming you.\" The squad leader of the male soldiers turned around hurriedly and smiled obsequiously. \"Instructor, you heard wrong.\"","\"Instructor Xia, he said that our instructor Ye dares to perform live shooting but you don’t. Instructor Xia, do you really not dare to?\"","Gao Xiao was ruthless. She exposed the secret in front of the male soldiers. The smile on the squad leader’s face froze.","These female soldiers were not loyal!","Xia Jinyuan knew what the female soldiers were thinking. He pretended to consider for a while before saying seriously, \"I’ll have to have a chat with your instructor. Let’s see if your instructor is really bold or just pretending.\"","The female soldiers’ eyes lit up. There was a chance!"]},{"number":4947,"title":"Chapter 4947: Public Display Of Love","paragraphs":["The female soldiers saw that there was a chance and wanted to encourage Xia Jinyuan to talk to Ye Jian personally. However, they swallowed their words. Instructor Xia and Instructor Ye were the same kind of people. This method wouldn’t work.","However, what Instructor Xia said piqued their interest. If they didn’t ask clearly, they would keep thinking about it. Plus, they wanted to see Ye Jian perform. Gao Xiao, who was the boldest, opened her mouth.","Although she opened her mouth boldly, her voice was so soft that it seemed like there was something in her mouth. It was muffled, and it took some effort to hear her clearly.","The female soldiers were all afraid of Xia Jinyuan. Even though he was handsome, the female soldiers would normally stay as far away from Xia Jinyuan as possible.","Instructor Xia was handsome, but it was obvious that he wasn’t easy to subdue. A rational female soldier wouldn’t torture herself for a handsome face.","This was why when Xia Jinyuan came to the military unit, even though he had a handsome face, no female soldier had a crush on him. They were so frightened that they ran away. Why would they have a crush?","Of course, the fact that there was not a single female soldier in his unit was also a reason.","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan only smiled without saying anything. His smile wasn’t a big smile. It was a fake smile. Gao Xiao regretted it.","She didn’t have the guts anymore. She squeezed her shoulders together and quickly hid behind, afraid that Xia Jinyuan would recognize her.","The female soldiers didn’t dare to mention it again. What was the use of being handsome? His fierce appearance was scary. They should leave quickly.","The female soldiers who were discussing with the male soldiers just now left one after another. They used the excuse of needing to rehearse their program.","The moment the female soldiers left, the male soldiers wanted to leave too. However, Instructor Xia didn’t say anything, so they didn’t dare to.","\"It’s time to show your charisma. Rehearse well. Don’t lose to the female soldiers.\" As soon as the female soldiers left, Xia Jinyuan ordered the male soldiers to rehearse with the ruthlessness of their usual training. They mustn’t fall behind at any time.","As for live shooting, Xia Jinyuan touched his chin and expressed that his girlfriend’s suggestion was not bad.","He could be a live body, and she could shoot. Their cooperation would be perfect, and they would be stunning!","Ultimately, this was Lieutenant Colonel Xia showing off his love in another way.","It couldn’t be helped. They had been hiding their relationship for so many years. Lieutenant Colonel Xia wanted to expose everything that he hadn’t been able to for the past few years. He wanted to bask in his golden light and blind the bachelors.","He was so high-profile, but no one knew about it. The two were just showing off their love for each other as comrades. There was no reason for Lieutenant Colonel Xia not to show off.","Not only did he have to show off, but he also had to show off so well that everyone applauded. Everyone had to know that the two of them had a tacit understanding.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia was indeed Lieutenant Colonel Xia. He used such a method that no one would suspect to show off his love. Not only would it satisfy his desire to show off, but it would also win him the applause of the entire hall.","Even though the entire hall would be cheering for their cooperation and congratulating them, so what? So what?","Weren’t the applause and cheers for the two of them?","The more he thought about it, the more he felt that it was feasible. He was tempted and looked forward to the gala.","There were still four more days, and Lieutenant Colonel Xia felt that it was a little hard to wait for so long.","At first, Xia Jinyuan purposely let the battalion know that he and Ye Jian were comrades. He had a certain plan. He and Ye Jian cooperated well. If the two of them were not comrades, it would be very suspicious. As long as they confirmed that they were comrades and were subordinates, it would save a lot of trouble in the future."]},{"number":4948,"title":"Chapter 4948: Terrifying","paragraphs":["For the sake of Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan didn’t allow any accidents to happen because of their relationship. Every step he took, he would walk steadily and leave no evidence behind.","Ye Jian didn’t know that her casual mention of the matter in order to scare the female soldiers and prevent her from showing her talent was reported to Battalion Commander Tian by Xia Jinyuan.","He was stunned when he heard this.","\"Captain Xia, this program is very risky. Do you want to consider it again? Or do you want to change the program? How about a duet? It’s artistic and safe. How good is that?\"","\"I don’t plan to change it. That’s it. It’s rare for instructor Ye to have the intention of going on stage. I’ll cooperate with her. As for safety, leave it to me and her. No problem.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s nonchalance made Battalion Commander Tian break out in a cold sweat. He couldn’t help but ask, \"Captain Xia, what entertainment programs do your team usually do?\"","What entertainment program did they usually do?","After thinking for a moment, Xia Jinyuan replied, \"Living shooting is also one of our programs...\"","\"Okay, that’s all. You can make your own arrangements. If there’s anything you need the battalion’s cooperation with, feel free to mention it.\" Battalion Commander Tian sent him off politely.","He closed the door, wiped his sweat, and patted his heart. He felt the pressure! Even risking one’s life had become an entertainment program. It looked like their camp’s training needed to be enhanced.","It was almost 9:00 pm when Ye Jian went to the activity room of the camp to see what the female soldiers had rehearsed. Before she reached the activity camp, she met the female soldiers who were returning to the dormitory. They chatted all the way back to the dormitory.","Although they were all rehearsing after training, the female soldiers were still in high spirits. Because Ye Jian was around, they started talking about the interesting events that happened during preparations for the military unit’s gala. The ladies were all in high spirits and were the most beautiful at their age.","Although being a soldier was tough, they never regretted it. It was an honor to be able to wear the military uniform that protected the peace of the country.","Ye Jian liked to chat with them. Even though she didn’t speak much, she was as happy as them. No matter how tired she was in the day or how tired she was at night, it was worth it.","They talked about the program that Xia Jinyuan led. The female soldiers clapped and cheered. They didn’t think too much about it and said casually, \"If the male soldiers don’t rehearse properly and just want to deal with it casually, the first person who won’t let them off is Instructor Xia.\"","\"Although Instructor Xia is good-looking and has the might of a soldier and a noble aura, his personality is too strong. When he first came, I could still take a few more glances at him. Now, when I see Instructor Xia, I just want to take a detour. He’s too scary. When he looks at me, I feel like I’m being stared at by an executioner.\"","\"What about you? Do you feel that way?\"","At this moment, Ye Jian’s eyes widened when she heard that. Fortunately, it was late at night and she didn’t lose her composure.","Executioner... Her deputy squad leader actually said that Captain Xia gave her the feeling of an executioner.","She said he was terrifying?","Was he that scary?","Why didn’t she feel anything?","The deputy squad leader was thinking too much.","As his girlfriend, when Ye Jian heard her boyfriend being called an executioner... she naturally had to stand up and explain to the deputy squad leader that she was thinking too much.","Unexpectedly, before Ye Jian could defend her boyfriend, the female soldiers around her voiced their agreement!","Even Ye Jian, who was smart, never expected such an ending!","What was going on?","Why did they all think so?"]},{"number":4949,"title":"Chapter 4949: Afraid Of Losing Their Lives","paragraphs":["\"That’s right, that’s right. I have this feeling too. It’s a terrifying feeling! I avoid Instructor Xia too.\"","\"As it turns out, you guys are the same. I thought that I was the only one who felt this way because I’m timid. I keep feeling that if I fall into the hands of Instructor Xia one day, I might lose my life.\"","\"The military unit needs a fierce soldier like Instructor Xia. He can make enemies tremble in fear and forget about everything else. Don’t let him grab your chink in one’s armor. Otherwise, you’ll die a horrible death!\"","\"The male soldiers are amazing. They’re able to live peacefully in instructor Xia’s hands for almost five months. They’re still better than us.\"","Ye Jian’s mouth twitched when she heard this. The Captain Xia she was hearing about was very unfamiliar. How was her man fierce? How was he ruthless?","This had to be a fake Captain Xia. It was a very unfamiliar Captain Xia that she didn’t know at all!","However...","There was something wrong here.","If one person thought that Captain Xia was fierce, it could be explained. However, if the 20 female soldiers in front of her agreed, that was strange.","It was impossible for all 20 female soldiers to misunderstand Captain Xia. It was impossible for all 20 female soldiers to have the same feeling.","Gao Xiao opened her mouth very seriously. \"No, no, no. The most powerful one isn’t the male soldiers. It’s our instructor! Instructor Ye, don’t you think so?\"","Gao Xiao, who had a look of agreement on her face, didn’t agree in the end. Male soldiers were nothing! The really powerful one was their Instructor Ye!","Huh?","That was true.","The male soldiers had only interacted with Instructor Xia for less than five months. Instructor Ye was different. She was Instructor Xia’s soldier.","The female soldiers suddenly felt that... Instructor Xia was the reason why their instructor Ye was able to remain so outstanding.","He was such a fierce person. The male and female soldiers treated him equally. Who would dare to be lazy in front of him as their captain?","No one!","They were afraid that they would lose their lives.","They were initially discussing Xia Jinyuan’s ferocity, but Gao Xiao turned the topic to Ye Jian’s ferocity. Ye Jian, who wanted to be invisible, felt helpless.","Everyone thought so of Captain Xia, so there was only one explanation. Captain Xia purposely used this method to keep a distance from the female soldiers.","She took a deep breath and smiled. \"You’re thinking too much. I feel that he’s completely different from the instructor you know.","\"A strict teacher produces a good student. Captain Xia is the captain of a special forces unit. If he doesn’t carry out his tasks strictly, how can the soldiers under him bear the heavy responsibility?","\"He’s a little fierce, but he’s not so casual with it. He won’t flare up at a soldier for no reason either. I know this the best. Usually, he’s fierce because the soldiers don’t meet his requirements. As for him flaring up in anger, I’ve never seen it before.","\"You’re thinking too much.\"","Ye Jian couldn’t bear to let her man be misunderstood. She had to explain what needed to be explained.","The female soldiers were shocked.","Gao Xiao trembled and said, \"Instructor Ye, the Captain Xia you know seems to be different from the Captain Xia we know. Captain Xia can’t have a twin, right?\"","It was too scary. Instructor Ye actually thought that Instructor Xia wasn’t fierce at all!","Wasn’t he fierce?","He couldn’t be fiercer!","The last time she waved her knife at Qiu Tong, Instructor Xia, who was standing at the side, didn’t say a word. However, the look in his eyes almost made her kneel down in front of him!","In the end, she only dared to speak after Instructor Xia left.","Even when he didn’t speak, he was so fierce that people would be pressured to kneel down to him. What about when he spoke? Wouldn’t he kill someone?"]},{"number":4950,"title":"Chapter 4950: The Best Scheming Man","paragraphs":["\"The Captain Xia we know is definitely not the same person. I admit my mistake. I definitely admit my mistake.\" Gao Xiao rubbed her arms. She didn’t listen to Ye Jian’s explanation at all.","It was the same for the other female soldiers.","They nodded and agreed.","\"It’s not the same. It’s definitely not the same person.\"","\"He’s fierce and ruthless. He’s not as reasonable as you say, Instructor Ye. No, no. The male soldiers all say that Instructor Xia is very scary!\"","\"That’s why I said that Instructor Ye is the best. She actually thinks that Instructor Xia is very normal and that he’s just a little strict.\"","The female soldiers didn’t listen to Ye Jian’s explanation. What else could Ye Jian say?","She nodded and said seriously, \"It might be because I’m already used to Instructor Xia’s military style that I don’t have such an intense reaction.\"","This explanation was reasonable. The female soldiers nodded in agreement.","\"So, you’re already a qualified special forces soldier even though you’re younger than us. Meanwhile, we’re still fighting for our goal. A strict teacher produces a good student. Instructor Ye, we still have two more months. Why don’t you be stricter? Try your best to be like Instructor Xia?\"","Ye Jian expressed that she would definitely work hard to be like Instructor Xia and train them strictly.","Gao Xiao, who was at the side, heard this and opened her mouth several times. She really wanted to tell Instructor Ye, ’If you really follow in instructor Xia’s footsteps, you definitely won’t be able to get married in the future. No matter how beautiful you are, no man will dare to marry you.’","Just like the Instructor Xia now. So what if he was handsome? He was definitely still a bachelor!","Ye Jian wasn’t aware of Gao Xiao’s thoughts. She quickly ended the conversation.","When they talked about Captain Xia, they all looked like they were so frightened that they wouldn’t be able to sleep tonight. She felt tired for them.","She felt that Xia Jinyuan’s actions were funny. In order to keep a distance from the female soldiers, Captain Xia had put in a lot of effort. She had to talk to him tomorrow.","On the 26th, during lunch break, Ye Jian met Xia Jinyuan and told him about the female soldiers’ evaluation with a smile. Xia Jinyuan almost applauded when he heard that.","\"It’s right to be afraid of me. This is the effect I want. I go to your class from time to time. If they think that I’m easy to get along with, they’ll suspect me in less than a week.","\"I have to make them afraid. If they’re afraid, they won’t suspect our relationship when they see me.\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian remained silent for a long time.","After a while, said in a soft voice, \"You did this... because of me. It’s all because of me.\"","In order to let her lead the training in peace and not hear any rumors, he used such a self-harming method to silently escort her. However, she didn’t notice anything.","If she didn’t hear the female soldiers’ unanimous evaluation of him last night, she might never have realized it!","Xia Jinyuan smiled. \"I won’t interfere with your training, but I can’t let you be questioned because of me. If you hear some unpleasant words, it might even affect your future.","\"I can’t spoil you in the military unit, but in life, I have to protect you and escort you. Otherwise, my existence will be meaningless. You don’t need a man who drags you down.","\"I don’t need other people to see how good I am. It doesn’t matter if they misunderstand me or slander me. I don’t care either. The only person I care about is you.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s gentleness and kindness had always only been toward Ye Jian. Only Ye Jian knew that all his gentleness and emotions existed for her alone.","As for other women, they would never be able to get it."]},{"number":4951,"title":"Chapter 4951: Activism","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan was a man of action. He meant what he said. He would do what he said.","When Ye Jian left his room, her nose was a little stuffy. How was her Captain Xia fierce?","He was obviously very gentle, but only she knew how gentle he was.","After that, the female soldiers talked about Xia Jinyuan’s viciousness again. Ye Jian didn’t stand up to explain because there was no need. It was fine as long as she knew how good he was.","As for the talent performance at the gala, Xia Jinyuan didn’t tell Ye Jian about it because... he forgot about it as they chatted.","On the afternoon of the 28th, Battalion Commander Tian met Ye Jian, who was eating in the cafeteria. Hence, he took his plate and walked over. The female soldier sitting opposite Ye Jian immediately gave up her seat when she saw this.","Ye Jian was a little surprised to see Battalion Commander Tian. She lowered her voice and asked softly, \"When did you return to the camp?\"","As the new year approached, the festive atmosphere outside got stronger and stronger. The military unit got busier and busier, especially at the border outpost. The civilians welcomed the new year happily, while the military unit patrolled more to ensure the peace of the country.","Battalion Commander Tian was busier than any other soldier. In order to ensure the safety of the various bases in the northwest and prevent the criminals from taking the opportunity to infiltrate, Battalion Commander Tian wouldn’t be able to return for a few days as long as he left the camp.","This time, he arranged for soldiers to patrol and stand guard.","Seeing Ye Jian eating, Battalion Commander Tian suddenly remembered what Xia Jinyuan said a few days ago. He wanted to ask Ye Jian if she was ready.","Ye Jian was stunned.","If Battalion Commander Tian hadn’t said anything, she wouldn’t have known that she would be performing on stage.","Facing Battalion Commander Tian, who was full of praise, Ye Jian, who was still smiling, put down her chopsticks and smiled. \"Instructor Xia and I are still discussing.\"","Ye Jian, who was smiling, didn’t dare to say that she didn’t know anything. She only said that they were still discussing.","She really didn’t know that Captain Xia would make the decision for her so happily.","Battalion Commander Tian misunderstood. He said seriously, \"You have to discuss this properly. You can’t make decisions casually. If you can’t reach a conclusion, I think you should change the program.","\"I think singing is a good choice. You can dance too. It’s artistic and refreshing. How good is that?\"","The corners of Ye Jian’s mouth froze. She smiled dryly. \"Let’s stick with shooting. It’s more interesting and hot-blooded.\"","Sweat was about to appear on her forehead. Talent was her weakness. She had to stay away from artistic and refreshing things.","When Battalion Commander Tian heard this, he let out a long sigh. \"Special forces soldiers like you have tough bones. You can discuss it with Instructor Xia. If you really can’t do it, it’s good to be an audience member with us.\"","At the end of the day, Battalion Commander Tian was still worried that something would happen.","Ye Jian wanted to be an audience member too. She immediately agreed. \"It’s good to be an audience member. I like the idea of that. I’ll leave the performance to the talented soldiers. I’ll only embarrass myself if I go up.\"","Embarrass? Battalion Commander Tian didn’t believe it.","\"You’re too humble. Actually, I want to see Instructor Ye’s talent performance too. If he can’t shoot, he can sing and dance!\" Make a fool of himself? Battalion commanders didn’t believe it.","There was nothing Ye Jian could do if he didn’t believe her. She really didn’t have any talent.","It was better to shoot than to sing and dance.","After dinner, Ye Jian chatted with Battalion Commander Tian before walking out of the cafeteria. After leaving the cafeteria, Battalion Commander Tian immediately went back to work. Ye Jian went back to her room and waited for Xia Jinyuan to come back.","The entire dormitory building in the camp was not locked. It would only be occasionally locked when they slept at night.","After waiting for less than ten minutes, Xia Jinyuan pushed the door open and entered. Ye Jian, who was waiting for him to come back, crossed her arms and looked at the man who came in expressionlessly."]},{"number":4952,"title":"Chapter 4952: Sweating From Fear","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect Ye Jian to be waiting for him in the room. He knew that something was wrong.","Seeing this, he couldn’t help but close the door lightly and bolt it.","\"Why do you look like you’re in a bad mood? Did I make you angry?\"","Ye Jian would never bring her emotions to Xia Jinyuan when it came to matters of the military unit. That was why Xia Jinyuan asked if he had angered Ye Jian.","\"I heard that you’re planning to show off your skills at the gala?\" Ye Jian didn’t want to beat about the bush and directly explained her intention. \"Why did you include me? If I hadn’t met Battalion Commander Tian just now, I would’ve been kept in the dark.\"","There was nothing to be angry about. She just felt a little wronged.","He could have told her directly. Why did he have to hide it?","Would she not cooperate with him?","She had always supported what he wanted to do.","Ye Jian, who was self-reliant and independent, would only have the temper of a little girl in front of Xia Jinyuan. Just like how Xia Jinyuan was a little naughty in front of Ye Jian.","It could be considered small fun between lovers.","Xia Jinyuan only remembered this when he heard that.","He didn’t even take off his soldier cap. He hurriedly coaxed his girlfriend. \"I wasn’t hiding it from you. I was so busy that I forgot about it. If Battalion Commander Tian hadn’t mentioned it, I would’ve completely forgotten about it.\"","At the end of the year, not only was Battalion Commander Tian busy, but Xia Jinyuan too. The 20 male soldiers he brought were the best in the entire camp. The 10 male soldiers would patrol for ten days during the festivities. Xia Jinyuan would participate too. Hence, the male soldiers’ training arrangements had to be adjusted accordingly.","Ye Jian didn’t know that Xia Jinyuan would leave the camp to patrol at 1:00 am on the first day of the new year. He wouldn’t come back until the tenth night of the new year. She couldn’t know all the arrangements in the camp, and Xia Jinyuan couldn’t tell her everything.","Although they were in the same military unit, he couldn’t tell her his whereabouts just because they were close.","Ye Jian didn’t question his explanation. Instead, she couldn’t help but laugh because he was so careful, afraid that she would flare up.","\"Alright, alright. I’m not angry. I thought you were hiding it from me on purpose so that you could give me a shock on the day of the gala.\"","He was so busy and tired. How could she bear to let him coax her?","It was just a small matter. Moreover, his attitude had already told her that he had indeed forgotten about it. He didn’t mean to hide it.","Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief. \"You really scared me. I rarely remember you looking at me like this.\"","\"I was just pretending. Couldn’t you tell?\" Ye Jian didn’t believe him. With his ability, how could he not tell that she was doing it on purpose?","Xia Jinyuan laughed. \"I really couldn’t tell. It’s rare to see you like that. And I wasn’t in the mood to observe if you were pretending. Come, touch my forehead.\"","After he finished speaking, he bent down slightly and leaned closer.","Ye Jian raised her hand and touched it. Her palm immediately felt wet. \"Were you sweating from the fright?\"","That was an exaggeration.","\"Yes, I was really sweating from fright.\" Xia Jinyuan held Ye Jian’s hand that was about to be retracted. Naturally, it moved smoothly. \"I’m already sweating from fright. Aren’t you going to wipe my sweat and comfort me?\"","\"You’re doing it again. You scare me all the time? But I’ve never made any conditions!\" Ye Jian had always been helpless against his personality.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. \"I’ve never stopped you. You can raise your conditions to me. I hope that you can beg me more. There’s sweat on my back too. Wipe it for me.\""]},{"number":4953,"title":"Chapter 4953: Warmth","paragraphs":["Ye Jian used her hand to wipe the sweat off his forehead. She was so angry that she wanted to laugh. \"It looks like you’re not sweating because of me. It’s because you ran all the way here.\"","\"The temperature is -9 degrees Celsius. How can I sweat?\"","\"Of course, you can! I’ve tried it before.\"","Although she refused, her hands were very honest. She took a towel and wiped the sweat on his back.","As she wiped his sweat, she said, \"Battalion Commander Tian doesn’t want us to perform any live shooting. He’s afraid that something will happen. Why don’t you change the program? As long as it’s not singing or dancing, I’ll cooperate.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who revealed half of his strong waist, thought for a moment and shook his head. \"Let’s shoot. Before we leave, let’s leave some good memories for them so that they can use this as their goal. Even if we leave the Vanguard Battalion, they can’t relax.","\"They are a group of soldiers who want to go further. Let them know that there are stronger people among the strong. Moreover, they’ve appeared beside them before. It’ll be stimulating for them.\"","Ye Jian would definitely not agree to show off.","In that case, he could only sublimate her thoughts!","When Ye Jian heard that he had such an arrangement, she didn’t insist. \"You still have to practice. Also, do you want me to be the live target or will you be the target?\"","\"Is there a need to discuss? Of course, it’s me!\" Xia Jinyuan placed himself in danger without any hesitation.","He didn’t think that he was in danger either. He believed in Ye Jian’s shooting skills and believed that she wouldn’t put him in danger.","After wiping his sweat, Ye Jian’s hand stopped on his back. There was a glint in her eyes. \"Okay, let’s do it!\"","He trusted her so much. How could she disappoint him?","Soon, their program was reported to the officer. The officer didn’t understand what live shooting was, so he asked more questions. After Xia Jinyuan finished explaining, the officer’s hand that was holding the pen trembled.","Instructor Xia, who came from the special forces, was so different even from the company’s soldiers.","It was such a dangerous program that the officer couldn’t make the decision alone. He reported it to Commissar Tang that day. Commissar Tang, who had already learned about it from Battalion Commander Tian, smiled and said, \"Just make the arrangements. The two of them can handle the danger.\"","With that, it was decided that the two of them would perform on stage.","To ensure that nothing would happen, Ye Jian hid and practiced secretly after she finished her training at night. She formed a snowball smaller than an apple and placed it on a lump of soil. When she was ten meters away, she used her pistol to shoot.","There was no problem with shooting at a distance of ten meters. Ye Jian didn’t continue training secretly after hitting ten times.","On New Year’s Eve, there were no lanterns hanging outside the military unit. Only the calligraphy written by Commissar Tang was pasted at the entrance of the camp.","From the outside of the camp, it didn’t look like it was New Year’s. However, the interior of the cafeteria had changed drastically. They pulled out the colorful lights and banners that had been kept properly for many years. The ten soldiers used the competition method to blow balloons until their cheeks hurt. They tied up the 200 colorful balloons that they finally blew out and placed them all over the cafeteria. Then, they pasted a few couplets written by Commissioner Tang. The countdown to the happy gala began.","At this moment, the male and female soldiers didn’t know that their instructors, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian, would be performing tonight. There were a total of 16 programs, and they used the time before the gala started to complete the last rehearsal. It was also... their only rehearsal.","Many of them had to leave the camp to patrol after the gala ended. Their backpacks were already packed, just waiting for them to set off.","Xia Jinyuan was also tidying up his backpack. He had prepared a lot of things for the ten-day patrol."]},{"number":4954,"title":"Chapter 4954: The Cutest Person","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who had arranged for the female soldiers to stand guard, thought that the gala was about to start. She and Xia Jinyuan didn’t rehearse even once, so wanted to go over and look for him.","She knocked lightly on the half-closed door. \"Please come in.\" She pushed the door open and saw Xia Jinyuan packing his luggage. Her heart sank. She locked the door and said in a low voice, \"Is there an urgent mission in the team?\"","Every year, at the end of the year, there would be many sudden and urgent missions, especially a few days ago when the United States launched another military mission against Ike. A few missiles even landed in the civilian area. A total of 1,600 Ike civilians died in their sleep. At this moment, Ike was already hell on earth.","Xia Jinyuan turned his head. Seeing her cold expression, he knew that she had misunderstood. \"There’s no urgent mission. After the gala ends, I’ll leave with the soldiers to patrol. It’ll take a while.\"","So it was a patrol!","Ye Jian, whose back was tense, felt relieved.","As for how long it would take, since he didn’t say it, Ye Jian didn’t ask anymore. She didn’t mention the rehearsal either. She stayed behind and helped hand Xia Jinyuan his belongings for him to pack.","There were indeed patrolling missions. From the tenth day of the new year to the 16th day of the new year, their patrol route was to the north of the base.","Ye Jian didn’t tell Xia Jinyuan that she had patrol arrangements too. As soon as she put away the necessary supplies, a loud voice came from the door. After Xia Jinyuan finished speaking, a soldier pushed the door open and entered.","Seeing that Ye Jian was here too, the soldier didn’t show any surprised expression. \"Reporting, the battalion commander wants to see you in the office for a discussion.\"","\"Okay, I’ll go over immediately.\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t even tighten his backpack when he heard that. He immediately left with the soldier.","After Ye Jian tightened the belt of the backpack, she returned to the cafeteria to watch the female soldiers’ rehearsal.","He was busy with work, so she shouldn’t disturb him regarding the performance.","The gala started at six o’clock sharp. The comrades from the cooking team had been busy since the morning.","Pot after pot of dumplings started to boil in the steel pot, and ingredients were being stir-fried. The meal started at 5:30 pm sharp and ended at 5:40 pm sharp. At 5:55 pm, all the dining tables and chairs were stacked in a straight line, ready for the gala.","The soldiers’ timing was accurate to the second. At 5:30 pm, the cafeteria was already filled with soldiers. When the soldiers who didn’t participate in preparing the venue saw this, they smiled.","They sat down and took off their caps. One could see that there were bloody wounds on the lips of all the soldiers. When they were eating, blood flowed out of the wounds. It mixed into the food and was swallowed by the young soldiers.","There were also bloody wounds on their hands that were holding chopsticks. Some of the soldiers’ hands were swollen from the cold. Although their hands were not good-looking and their joints were thick like the hands of an old man who had been through many hardships, it was these ugly hands that supported the peace of the motherland and allowed billions of citizens to peacefully celebrate New Year’s.","The gala officially started at 6:00 pm. Two female soldiers and two male soldiers were the emcees. Battalion Commander Tian and Commissar Tang went on stage one after another to speak. In the end, Company Commander Zhu represented all the company commanders to speak on stage. He knew that the soldiers wanted to watch the performances as soon as possible. The three of them used a total of ten minutes without any nonsense.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan sat at the front. There was only a fist’s distance between them. They would be able to pull some trick if they wanted to. After clapping, Xia Jinyuan immediately held Ye Jian’s hand secretly and got ready to watch the exciting performances by the soldiers."]},{"number":4955,"title":"Chapter 4955: Year After Year","paragraphs":["Although the stage carefully arranged by the soldiers was not gorgeous and could even be considered simple, no one cared. All their attention was on their comrades who were happily performing in the middle of the stage.","There were skits, crosstalk, singing, dancing... Everyone cheered. After a singing performance, the next performance was a ’mysterious’ performance. Gao Xiao looked at it for a long time and asked the male soldier who was with her, \"A mysterious performance? What sort of mysterious performance have the male soldiers prepared? Haven’t you guys been rehearsing everything?\"","The male emcee was a little surprised too. \"Isn’t it a mysterious performance arranged by you female soldiers?\"","\"No.\" Gao Xiao was flabbergasted. \"We only have four performances, and there were rehearsals for all of it. If it’s not us or you... How are we going to announce the show later? Are we going to say that there’s a mystery guest?\"","The male soldier thought for a moment and felt that Gao Xiao’s idea was not bad. \"I think that works. Let’s say that we’ve invited a mystery guest.\"","\"Even as emcees, we don’t know about it. That’s really mysterious.\" Gao Xiao was not curious. After all, she would soon find out what it was.","When the female soldiers went on stage to perform, the applause was several times louder than the male soldiers. After the male soldiers got off the stage, they returned to their seats and secretly punched their comrades to show their dissatisfaction.","The comrades who were punched weren’t angry. Instead, they clapped even louder and brighter. Ever since they came to the Vanguard Battalion, this was the first time they saw the female soldiers performing. It was rare. Of course, the applause had to be enthusiastic.","The female soldiers were versatile. When they were dancing, they made difficult movements. Gao Xiao didn’t even need to support herself with her hands. She did a backflip, and her legs made a straight split. Then, she bent her back and made another split. Her legs landed steadily. These moves caused the male soldiers to clap hard.","Brilliant, exciting! So very exciting!","Political Commissar Tang smiled at Battalion Commander Tian and said, \"Old Tian, in the future, they’ll be the soldiers of our Vanguard Battalion. Aren’t you happy?\"","\"Hahaha, I am happy! However, we still don’t know if they’re really going to join our team. So, don’t have too much hope.\" Battalion Commander Tian was clapping his hands and smiling as he spoke, but the smile on Commissar Tang’s face faded a little.","\"What do you mean? You have to explain it clearly.\" Commissar Tang was no longer in the mood to watch the performances. Could it be that they wouldn’t be soldiers of the Vanguard Battalion in the future?","\"What do you mean what do I mean?\" Battalion Commander Tian, who was in a good mood, pointed at the soldier doing a few more backflips and laughed. \"This female soldier is not bad. Not bad! She’s a talent.\"","Political Commissar Tang took a quick glance and happened to see Gao Xiao’s performance coming to an end. He was so distracted that he missed the exciting performance. He asked again, \"Your words are unclear. How can I understand?","\"What do you mean that we don’t know whether they’ll be our soldiers in the future? Could it be that something has happened?\"","\"Old Tang, Old Tang, have you forgotten? It’s not up to us to keep them. It depends on themselves. They need the approval of the higher-ups.\"","\"Make yourself clear next time!\" Commissar Tang finally calmed down. \"With the strict requirements Instructor Ye gave them, they can pass!\"","\"Yes, Instructor Ye is indeed capable. If the female soldiers can’t stay, it means that they’re not cut out for it. It’s good to make a decision as soon as possible so that they won’t be implicated.\""]},{"number":4956,"title":"Chapter 4956: A Long Time","paragraphs":["Battalion Commander Tian and Commissar Tang communicated softly so that no one around them could hear them. Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, who were a few seats away from them, naturally could not hear them either. Based on their current state, if someone spoke to them, they would probably react half a beat slower.","Ye Jian didn’t dare to let Xia Jinyuan hold her hand. Besides, she still had to clap. How could she let him hold her hand all the time?","Every time she clapped, she was already half a beat slower than the soldiers!","Xia Jinyuan liked to hold her hand tightly so that she wouldn’t be able to raise her hands and clap immediately. Every time he saw Ye Jian glaring at him because of her slow clapping, Xia Jinyuan would find it especially amusing.","After countless times, Ye Jian didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. \"Captain Xia, are you a three-year-old? Do you find it fun to see me embarrassed?\"","\"It’s indeed very fun. It even makes you look at me more. It’s worth it.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia held Ye Jian’s hand tightly again and smiled. His eyes were filled with affection. \"I hope that every New Year’s in the future will be like this.\"","It had been an entire year. They were like saplings that had grown branches, and their branches and leaves were intertwined with each other. They bathed in the sunlight together and went through the storm together.","They would support each other, snuggle up to each other, and share their feelings with each other for the rest of their lives.","Ye Jian’s heart fluttered. She secretly held his hand and nodded. \"We’ll be together every year.\"","To be able to spend the years with him, no matter how stormy or bitter the journey was, left her with no regrets.","After the male and female soldiers finished singing a popular song, Gao Xiao and another male soldier who was the emcee walked over. The seats where Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian were sitting were empty.","It was time for the two of them to perform. The male soldier emcee smiled and waved the performance list in his hand. His sweet voice entered the ears of every soldier. \"The next performance is very mysterious. How mysterious is it? It’s so mysterious that even as the emcees, we don’t even know what the performance is or who the performers are.\"","\"I’m very, very curious now. Zou Qi, what about you? Are you curious too?\"","Zou Qi was the male emcee.","\"I’ve been curious since I saw the performance list. I can’t wait to know what kind of mysterious performance it is! Dear comrades, do you want to know?\"","The male soldier, Zou Qi, knew how to liven up the atmosphere. After he finished speaking, he faced the microphone to all the soldiers. The soldiers’ orderly and loud voices came from the entire cafeteria. \"Yes! Yes! Yes!\"","\"Let’s welcome the mystery guest who will be performing!\" After Gao Xiao finished speaking, she took the microphone and left the stage. When she turned around, her eyes widened.","It was....","It was actually...","Instructor Ye!","Instructor Xia!","She saw the two instructors!","Gao Xiao was surprised. For a moment, she didn’t pay attention to the long cable of the microphone and kicked it with the tip of her toes, falling forward. Fortunately, the male emcee, Zou Qi, reacted quickly and pulled Gao Xiao back.","Xia Jinyuan, who came up with a few apples, whispered to his girlfriend, \"Did you see that? She was so shocked that she almost fell.\"","Just now, when the other two emcees saw the two of them, they were wondering if something had happened that caused the two instructors to appear.","Later, Ye Jian explained that the mysterious performance was her and Captain Xia’s performance. The other female emcee was so shocked that she choked on her own saliva. She didn’t say anything for a long time."]},{"number":4957,"title":"Chapter 4957: Urgent Need For Salvation","paragraphs":["The other male emcee was calmer. He swallowed his saliva and asked Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian what performance they were going to do.","Since they were already going onto the stage, Xia Jinyuan didn’t hide it anymore. He said they were going to perform what Instructor Ye had previously suggested. The female soldier, who finally managed to catch her breath, choked again.","Live... Live shooting!","Instructor Ye was really going to perform live shooting!","\"Then... who will be the live target?\" the female soldier asked with trembling teeth.","Xia Jinyuan tossed the apple in his hand. \"Who else could it be?\"","For some reason, the female soldier heaved a sigh of relief. She didn’t control herself well, and her expression relaxed a little. Xia Jinyuan said to Ye Jian, \"Your soldier seems to be hoping that something will happen to me. Look at her. She’s obviously relieved to know that I’m the live target.\"","\"Definitely not! Definitely not!\" The female soldier was so frightened. She thought, ’Oh my god! What a terrifying instructor. Does he know how to read minds?’","She was just a little relieved, but he saw through her.","Ye Jian smiled slightly. \"It just means that she doesn’t want anything to happen to me.\"","\"Doesn’t that mean that she’s worried about your shooting skills and thinks that you might accidentally hurt me?\" Xia Jinyuan retorted calmly. He didn’t retaliate against Ye Jian. Instead, he scared the female soldier until her heart beat faster.","\"Instructor Ye, I trust you 100%! I can guarantee that Instructor Xia will be safe and sound!\" The female soldier almost cried when she heard this. She almost swore to the heavens.","When the people at the top fought, it was the people at the bottom who suffered. She hoped that the two instructors would show mercy and let her off!","Xia Jinyuan smiled and looked at Ye Jian. \"Did you hear that, Instructor Ye? Your soldiers trust you so much. As an instructor, you have to perform well. Don’t let your hand shake and miss the shot.\"","Just as the two emcees were feeling extremely tormented, the announcement finally ended. The two of them, who didn’t dare to speak, quickly sent away the two top instructors who were the ’mysterious guests’.","\"I was so scared! The smell of gunpowder on them made me too afraid to speak.\" The two instructors had gone on stage. The female soldier seemed to have run ten kilometers, and she sat on the chair weakly. \"They were bickering with each other. Do you think the two of them can get off the stage safely?\"","The male soldier looked at the two instructors on the stage and thought for a while before replying, \"That depends on whether Instructor Ye will argue with Instructor Xia. But... he should be able to get off the stage safely. Instructor Xia must believe in Instructor Ye. That’s why he dares to be her live target.\"","The male emcee at the front of the stage reacted quickly and laughed loudly to maintain the mood. \"The surprise came too suddenly. I was so happy that I almost fell. As it turns out, the mysterious guests are our instructors. Comrades, where’s your applause?\"","The applause was like waves hitting the shore. Wave after wave, the entire cafeteria was so lively that even the glass window outside seemed to be about to shatter.","Gao Xiao ran back to the simple backstage that was covered with camouflage dust-proof cloth. She said to the two emcees who were still patting their chests, \"The instructors appeared. Oh my god, I was so frightened that I almost fell. Fortunately, Zou Qi saved me in time. If not, I would’ve been so embarrassed!\"","\"Ha, you just saw the two instructors. You missed out on something even scarier. As for me, I’m so frightened that my heart is still pounding.\"","The other female emcee felt that what Gao Xiao said wasn’t worth mentioning, so she told Gao Xiao what she discovered just now. Gao Xiao was dumbfounded. \"Well, it’s impressive that the two of you are still here, safe and sound.\""]},{"number":4958,"title":"Chapter 4958: Unrivaled","paragraphs":["The female soldier replied with lingering fear, \"That’s right! I could smell the gunpowder!\"","\"It’s too scary. The two instructors will just end up scaring people when they’re together. Their performance is scary too! No, I have to watch it carefully. Although it’s scary, it’s definitely exciting!\" After saying that in one breath, Gao Xiao turned around and walked out of the backstage. She stood by the curtain to watch the exciting performance.","At this moment, the entire cafeteria was silent. All the soldiers held their breaths and stared at the front without blinking. Battalion Commander Tian leaned forward slightly against the edge of the table and crossed his fingers tightly. He was very worried that something would happen.","Political Commissar Tang did not talk to Battalion Commander Tian anymore. He just stared ahead.","In front, Xia Jinyuan was already prepared. There was an apple above his head and an apple in each of his palms. What was even more terrifying was that... there was a big apple between his knees!","The male soldiers couldn’t help but tighten their legs. This... performance was a little scary.","Company Commander Zhu kept rubbing his hands. He looked like he wanted to take Ye Jian’s place.","Ye Jian, who had retreated ten meters, raised her gun. She only did the standard act of raising her gun, but she looked so dashing. Just as all the soldiers were waiting for her to complete her aiming, a gunshot suddenly sounded.","Damn it!","She immediately raised her gun and fired. Everyone was shocked, and many were left trembling. Before they could react, a second shot came!","Then, the third shot!","The fourth shot too!","Just like that, the shooting was over!","...","They had been on guard. They didn’t even dare to breathe presumptuously, afraid that they would alarm Ye Jian. Was it... already over?","Was it over?","So fast!","They hadn’t seen it properly!","How did it end?","Why did it end so quickly?","They hadn’t recovered from the first shot and were still in shock. Why was the fourth shot already fired?","It ended without even them looking!","Yes, it was over!","The first bullet hit the apple above Xia Jinyuan’s head first. The blank cartridge passed through the apple and completed the first shot. The soldiers were still in shock when the second shot hit the apple between Xia Jinyuan’s knees.","Then, Ye Jian raised her arm slightly. It wasn’t much, just a few centimeters. She fired one shot each from her left and right. The third and fourth shots were completed, and the live target shooting ended.","Ye Jian retracted her gun and saluted the silent soldiers below. Xia Jinyuan shook the apple dregs on his head and picked up the emcee’s microphone beside him. He smiled and said, \"Comrades, although the show is very ordinary, it’s still a performance done by Instructor Ye and me. Shouldn’t you be kind to us and give us a round of applause?\"","His low and mellow voice echoed throughout the cafeteria, entering the ears of all the soldiers. Finally, there was movement.","As it turned out, it was really over!","\"Instructor Ye, do it again! Do it again!\"","Someone shouted excitedly. The entire cafeteria seemed to be filled with cheers. The company commanders of the three companies took the lead and stood up to wave their arms. \"Do it again, do it again!\"","\"Do it again! Do it again!\"","Their voices were loud and excited.","It was so loud that Xia Jinyuan took a step back. He raised the microphone and replied to the soldiers, \"I’m sorry, the fruits in winter are precious. We only managed to get four apples. The show has ended. I’m very happy with your reaction. Thank you, everyone!\""]},{"number":4959,"title":"Chapter 4959: Respect","paragraphs":["If they missed him, they would know how precious he was. This was the effect Xia Jinyuan wanted. If they missed him, they would remember that there was once an instructor who let them see how powerful the strong were. They would remember him for the rest of their lives.","Just like Uncle Chen, who was a world-class sniper king in the late 1970s. Even though he had left the throne for decades, Major General Yang recognized Uncle Chen the moment he saw him. He was still amazed by Uncle Chen’s glory in the past.","He hoped that after his little fox left the military camp in the northwest, she would leave her footprints on this yellow, barren, and vast land.","Ye Jian didn’t want to perform anymore. One time was enough.","She loved shooting and liked sniping. She just needed to silently enjoy the thrill of shooting bullets for an instant. She didn’t need the audience to support her or praise her. She just wanted to enjoy the process alone and chase for a higher achievement alone...","Battalion Commander Tian didn’t think about it anymore. He wiped his face and said to the political commissar, \"Did you see it clearly? I didn’t see it clearly. I wanted her to do it again.\"","He knew that Little Ye’s marksmanship was not bad, but he didn’t know that her speed was even scarier than her marksmanship. No, no, it was a combination of speed and marksmanship. It was scary!","How could she shoot so quickly alone?","He only saw her raising her hand. When she raised her hand, she didn’t even pause for a second. She raised her hand and shot. It was fast, steady, and accurate!","He had been nervous for a long time below, and even his hands were red. In the end...","In the end... the performance was over!","He had been worried for so long about Little Ye’s shooting performance. In the end, he was nervous for nothing!","Battalion Commander Tian felt that he was a little stupid.","As for the political commissar...","Commissar Tang wanted to watch it too, but...","He tilted his head slightly and said in a low voice, \"There’s no need for her to perform on stage. In the shooting range, we can ask Little Ye for advice on the spot. She shoots accurately. Her performance just livened things up. Everyone wants to see Little Ye’s shooting skills, but they’re thinking of it as entertainment.","\"It shouldn’t be entertainment. We should show the respect that a sharpshooter deserves.\"","At the mention of this, Battalion Commander Tian’s expression turned solemn. \"That’s right! I was careless!\"","Seeing that the soldiers hadn’t recovered from their shock, Battalion Commander Tian stood up.","When Xia Jinyuan saw Battalion Commander Tian walking over, he immediately passed the microphone in his hand to him. Before Battalion Commander Tian could speak, the soldiers had already quietened down.","\"Soldiers, I want to say a few words now.\" Battalion Commander Tian took the microphone and faced all the soldiers. With a serious expression, he said in a low voice, \"Instructor Ye didn’t bring an exciting performance tonight. She displayed her exquisite shooting skills!","\"I understand that you want to see Instructor Ye’s amazing shooting skills again. However, please remember that such exquisite shooting skills weren’t achieved in a day. Instructor Ye trained hard for many years to achieve her current results.","\"A true expert would have put in unimaginable effort. There was definitely blood and tears. Hence, I hope that the soldiers will respect Instructor Ye and thank her for letting everyone here witness the exquisite shooting of a sharpshooter.","\"Now, all soldiers, please stand up!\"","Swoosh!","The figures below the stage stood up solemnly. Battalion Commander Tian, who was facing the soldiers, turned around and faced Ye Jian. He looked at Ye Jian with bright eyes. He said, \"Salute!\"","Swoosh!","The truly strong should be respected. The stronger they were, the heavier the responsibility they carried. The more effort they put in, the more respect they deserved!"]},{"number":4960,"title":"Chapter 4960: Hope","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was prepared to leave the stage, was stunned by what Battalion Commander Tian said and the soldiers’ salute. She instantly returned the solemn salute to all the soldiers below the stage!","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing beside her, raised his hand and saluted as well. He saluted the soldiers and Ye Jian.","Backstage, Gao Xiao, Zou Qi, and the other two emcees saluted Ye Jian even though she could not see them.","The female soldiers led by Ye Jian saluted their instructor with admiration in their eyes.","It was their honor to be led by Instructor Ye for training!","It was an honor that they could show her their respect.","Looking at the girl beside him, Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were filled with admiration.","His girl would definitely have more glory in the future!","The gala ended at 9:00 pm. The soldiers left in an orderly manner. Xia Jinyuan whispered to Ye Jian, \"Let’s guard tonight until the new year. I’ll wait for you.\"","With the crowd’s excitement, he knew he would have to wait before getting to spend some alone time with her.","When Ye Jian was surrounded by the female soldiers who were talking excitedly, Xia Jinyuan, who was standing in front, looked at Ye Jian deeply. After receiving Ye Jian’s reply, he smiled and turned to leave.","Right now, the female soldiers were surrounding Instructor Ye and not his girlfriend, Ye Jian.","The female soldiers had always known that Ye Jian’s shooting skills were good. They could tell that during normal training. However, they had never seen Ye Jian shoot at a fast speed. Every time during training, Ye Jian would shoot at a normal speed. She had never displayed her extraordinary shooting speed.","The most shocked people today weren’t the male soldiers. It wasn’t Battalion Commander Tian, Commissar Tang, or the company commanders of their companies. It was the female soldiers.","They were still in shock. They just wanted to have a good chat with instructor Ye.","Ye Jian couldn’t look for Xia Jinyuan because of this. She chatted patiently and explained to the female soldiers, \"Actually, Instructor Xia had already told you in the past. It’s just that you didn’t pay much attention at that time.","\"I’ve not been hiding anything. I just didn’t want to add to your psychological burden. But we don’t have much time together now, so you do need to feel a little burdened.","\"The military sent me to train you. The assessment later might be based on my standards as an instructor.","\"I hope that in the future, you will work harder for your dreams and become members of the first female special forces unit.\"","Ye Jian chatted with the female soldiers until 11:00 pm. They chatted until the cold wind outside blew inside. It was like they were outdoors. The female soldiers only ended the chat when they felt very cold.","They congratulated each other in advance and gave their comrades their sincerest blessings before returning to their respective dormitories.","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t sleeping. He kept waiting for Ye Jian to arrive.","They agreed to spend the new year together and leave the old to welcome the new. His woman would definitely come as promised.","At 11:00 pm, Ye Jian, who was wearing a thick winter coat, pushed open the door of Xia Jinyuan’s dormitory. The lights in the room were not turned on. It was so dark that one couldn’t see one’s fingers.","Even so, Ye Jian knew where the man she loved was.","She walked straight over and reached out her hand to hold the big hand that had reached out in the dark. \"I’m sorry I’m late.\"","She said in a low voice.","Xia Jinyuan smiled. \"It’s not late. The new year hasn’t arrived. We didn’t miss the agreed time.\"","\"I’ve kept you waiting.\"","\"Sometimes, waiting is a form of happiness. I knew that you’d come as promised. There was hope in my heart, so I didn’t feel like I had waited long.\" Xia Jinyuan held her hand tightly. His tone was filled with satisfaction."]},{"number":4961,"title":"Chapter 4961","paragraphs":["The two of them had known each other for many years, but this was the first time they were in the same room. They held hands and rested their heads on each other’s shoulders. They placed the small alarm clock on the desk and sat on the bed. They whispered to each other as they waited for the new year.","In the capital city, the Xia family’s old residence was very lively. Even Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia were energetic. They sat in thickly cushioned armchairs and smiled kindly as they watched the younger generation.","This year, Xia Yiwei and Hou Zi returned to the old residence for the new year. Accompanying them were a pair of twins who could run faster than rabbits around the courtyard.","Hou Zi, who had washed his hands clean, no longer had the gangster aura he had in the past. Every night, apart from when he had to socialize, he would get off work early and come back to accompany his wife and children.","In his words, he, an orphan, had never had a home. Now that he finally had a home, he would be struck by lightning if he didn’t care about his blessings.","It was a colorful world outside, but Hou Zi, who was worth tens of billions, had already gone around the colorful world. He was tired and finally knew how to appreciate home.","Xia Yiwei, who had waited for him for more than ten years, finally tied down the wild young man who once dared to whistle at her and pursue her.","Although they had once been so tired and resentful, to the point of wanting to give up, they had too many ties from when they were young. No matter how tired they were, they couldn’t leave each other. Now, the family of four was living a happy life. The couple cherished each other so much that they didn’t even talk back to each other anymore.","A child’s childish cries suddenly came from outside. Hou Zi, who was still talking to his uncle a second ago, changed his expression and apologized. He quickly got up and jogged to the courtyard.","On the other hand, Eldest Aunt said to Xia Yiwei, \"Da Bao is crying outside. Xiao Bao must be bullying Da Bao again. Hurry up and take a look.\"","Eldest Aunt was carrying a child in her hand. The baby was the son of the fourth son of the family, Xia Yuzheng, who was also Xia Yiwei’s younger brother. He had just turned one year old and was still staggering.","The child had already fallen asleep. He was nestled comfortably in Eldest Aunt’s arms. His small mouth would mutter from time to time. His pink face was clear and delicate, especially his eyelashes. They were thick and curly. He was an extremely beautiful little boy.","Eldest Aunt was carrying a child, so it was naturally inconvenient for her to take care of another. Seeing that her niece, Xia Yiwei, had not moved, she thought that she had not heard anything and reminded her with a smile.","Glancing outside the window, Xia Yiwei smiled and said, \"There’s no need for me to do anything. Hou Zi will take care of the child.\"","Although the Xia family’s old residence was lively this year, the fourth son, Xia Yuzheng, and his wife didn’t go home because of work problems. They only sent their children back to the old residence. The third son, Xia Yuyi, was absent too. His wife brought their six-year-old son back to the old residence. In addition, Little Six and Xia Jinyuan were also missing.","Hearing this, Eldest Aunt smiled. She was very elegant. Even if she smiled, she looked especially dignified. \"You’ve suffered enough. You should let him take care of the children. The children need to be closer to their father so that they’ll grow up confident.\"","Xia Yiwei tucked her black hair behind her ear and smiled gently. \"Don’t worry. Ever since Da Bao and Xiao Bao were born, Hou Zi wishes he could stay at home and accompany the two children every day. Sometimes, I’m the one who’s annoyed and pushes him out to work.","\"He’s already in his 40s, but he can still play with the two children. Sometimes, I think there’s another child in the family.\"","At the mention of that, the wives of Xia Lingxiao and Xia Yiting laughed. Their sister-in-law said that she despised her husband, but there was no disdain on her face. There was only satisfaction.","The hardships that she experienced in the first part of her life had come to an end. It was the hardships that she hid from her family and didn’t dare to say. The sweetness now was all to make up for the hardships of the past."]},{"number":4962,"title":"Chapter 4962","paragraphs":["Hou Zi carried Da Bao, who had been hit in the head by XIao Bao’s snowball, back into the house. Old Madam Xia couldn’t bear to see her great-grandson cry, so she quickly stood up from the master chair. \"Oh, my good great-grandson. Don’t cry. Don’t cry. Let me carry you.\"","Even though Old Madam Xia was old and energetic, she could still whip Commander Xia some time ago. She could definitely carry her grandchild.","However, Hou Zi didn’t dare to let the old madam carry the child. He hurriedly said, \"Grandma, you sit. I’ll coax the child.\" A man in his 40s was at his prime. He was handsome and rich too. Carrying a baby in his arms, he looked very handsome.","Commander Xia also said, \"Mom, you can carry the child while sitting down. You might twist your waist if you do it standing up.\"","\"I can even hit you. How could I twist my waist carrying my great-grandson?\" The old madam opened her mouth and criticized Commander Xia instantly.","What else could Commander Xia say? He had to hurry up and leave...","Hou Zi didn’t dare to leave the crying Da Bao to the old madam. He only dared to let her carry Da Bao after the child was coaxed.","The live broadcast on TV panned at the soldiers in military uniforms sitting at the front table. Their military ranks were all senior colonels, major generals, and lieutenant generals. Xia Lingxiao, who was 12 years old, whispered into the old master’s ear, \"Great-Grandpa, I just saw grandpa.\"","The old master also saw his eldest son, Xia Anguo. He patted his great-grandson’s head and smiled kindly. \"Yes, this is the honor the country has given your grandpa. Your grandfather has worked hard all these years.\"","...","It was snowing heavily outside the window, and the heater in the window was shining brightly. Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia, who were accompanied by the juniors, were eating fruits with smiles on their faces. They were watching the live broadcast and waiting for the new year bell to ring.","As for the juniors of the Xia family who had not returned home, the elders at home were already used to it. It was rare for all members of the Xia family to be present.","It was almost 12:00 am. The two people in a certain northwest military unit stared at the small alarm clock and held it tightly. They started the last countdown of the new year.","Xia Jinyuan, who had deep emotions in his eyes, suddenly leaned over and kissed Ye Jian’s lips. The two of them welcomed the first year with deep emotions.","’Happy New Year, the woman I love the most.’","He kissed her deeply, conveying the love from the depths of his heart.","Ye Jian responded to his kiss and hugged his waist. She hugged him as they welcomed the new year together.","The new year was ushered in. Ye Jian finally had a chance to catch her breath after the deep kiss ended. She immediately gave her new year blessings to the man beside her. \"I hope you have more time to bid farewell to the old and welcome the new with me in the future.\"","\"Although it’s a little difficult, I’ll try my best.\" Xia Jinyuan lowered his head again and pecked Ye Jian’s red lips. \"You’ll always be by my side.\"","The most beautiful thing in the world was love.","The two of them, who were welcoming the new year together, gave themselves time to adjust their breathing. Then, Ye Jian picked up the receiver and dialed her home number. The moment it rang, the other party immediately picked up. Right on the heels of that, Old Master Fu’s strong voice sounded. \"My little princess has called.\"","Before Ye Jian could speak, her eyes were already wet.","It had only run once before her grandpa picked up the call. It could be seen that he had been sitting by the phone the entire time.","Ye Jian didn’t dare to choke up. She opened her mouth with a sniff. Xia Jinyuan hugged her shoulder and comforted her."]},{"number":4963,"title":"Chapter 4963","paragraphs":["The emcee’s blessings for the new year came from the TV. The old man listened to his granddaughter’s blessings and smiled until the wrinkles at the corners of his eyes were deep. He said, \"Good, good, good. I’m doing very well. I’ll be healthy and strive to live to 110 years old! Hahaha, Happy New Year, my good grandchild.\"","In the new year, Ye Jian hoped that Old Master Fu would be healthy and not suffer from illnesses or calamities.","The grandfather and grandchild chatted for ten minutes. It was the old man who took the initiative to hang up. When Xia Jinyuan heard the old man asking Ye Jian to hang up, he hurriedly whispered to Ye Jian, \"Don’t hang up. I haven’t said anything.\"","He was afraid that Ye Jian would end the call.","Old Master Fu was shocked when he heard Xia Jinyuan’s voice. He really didn’t know that the two young people were celebrating the new year together. Hence, he asked where they were celebrating the new year. Xia Jinyuan smiled and replied that they were celebrating the new year in a military unit outside. Old Master Fu knew what was going on, so he didn’t probe further.","They were in a military unit outside celebrating the new year. The main point was ’outside’.","The old man was wise. He wouldn’t ask anything he shouldn’t.","In the end, he reminded Xia Jinyuan to take good care of himself too. If he was tired, he had to rest appropriately. The old man then chatted with Ye Jian for a while before hanging up.","Ye Jian hung up reluctantly. She couldn’t give Mr. Fu her New Year’s blessings immediately because she couldn’t contact him.","She only knew Mr. Fu’s approximate location but not his exact address.","They had reunited for less than 24 hours in September. They hadn’t seen each other until now. The father and daughter were less than 50 kilometers apart, but they hadn’t seen each other for almost half a year.","Then, she called the Xia family’s old residence. Ye Jian also greeted Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia. The elderly couple were so happy that when they hung up the phone, the smiles on their faces didn’t disappear for a long time.","When the two of them lay on the bed that night, the old madam said to the old master, \"Now that Little Six’s relationship is smooth, I’m finally at ease. I’m finally at ease... As for Xiao...\"","The old madam didn’t continue, as if it was taboo.","\"What are you worried about? Do you really think that our Little Six will live a lonely life?\" The old master snorted. \"What kind of person is Little Six’s biological mother? Do you believe her words?\"","From his words, it seemed that he was quite troubled by his former daughter-in-law.","She had studied a lot and understood herself. However, she was confused about other people, even her biological son.","She came to their residence to pass along the words of a fortune teller, making the old madam almost faint from anger.","Which mother would say that her son was destined to be alone?","Such a person was her former daughter-in-law.","\"Look at Little Six and Little Ye. The two of them have known each other for so many years. Their relationship is deep but not shallow. Destined to be alone! Ha, let’s see who that will be!\" The old master’s voice was a little cold. \"Some time ago, she even schemed against Yunyin. She thought that if she had something on Yunyin, she could get Yunyin to do something for her.","\"Look at how old she is, but she’s still doing shameless things. Only shameless people would do shameless things! In the past, she said all those things so that she could get a divorce as soon as possible. It’s been 25 years. Why do you still keep it in mind?\"","The old madam sighed. \"How can I not remember it? If she hadn’t said that, I would’ve probably forgotten about it.\""]},{"number":4964,"title":"Chapter 4964 - 4961","paragraphs":["At the mention of the past, the old madam still had a knot in her heart.","\"Then you can forget about it now. Our granddaughter-in-law just called to wish us a happy new year!\" The old master smiled again. His voice wasn’t as cold as before. \"I think it’ll only be three years at most. We might be able to carry Little Six’s child by then.\"","The old madam said, \"That depends on whether Little Ye agrees or not. If Little Ye doesn’t agree, I’ll support her all the same. She’s not worse than Little Six. We can’t let her ruin her future just because of a pregnancy.\"","\"That won’t happen. Little Six has his own opinions, and he can’t bear to delay Little Ye. You can just wait to carry Little Six and Little Ye’s son. Or a daughter. Xiao Bao is the only great-granddaughter in the family right now.\"","\"Do you think you have any control over this? Hurry up and sleep. Tomorrow, your old subordinates will come and look for you early in the morning.\" Old Madam Xia also wanted to have more baby girls in the family too. The Xia family mainly consisted of men. For generations, there had only been one girl in each generation. It was better to have more girls.","The old madam and old master were getting old, so they didn’t sleep well. Even though they slept early at night, they would wake up a few times in the middle. And no matter how late they slept, they would wake up at five in the morning.","As people got older, they would have bad sleep.","In the early morning of the first day of the new year, some people had just fallen asleep while some were still partying. And some were wearing military attire and carrying steel guns. They faced the strong cold wind to protect the thousands of reunion lights behind them.","Ye Jian personally carried the backpack for Xia Jinyuan and buckled its belt. Then, she passed the steel gun to the young soldier who was preparing to leave. \"Be careful!\"","\"Wait for me to return to the camp.\" Xia Jinyuan carried his backpack. There were still five minutes left. He held the gun with one hand and hugged Ye Jian’s shoulder with the other. \"Rest early.\"","After he finished speaking, he let go of his arm and smiled at the woman who would be waiting for him to return to the camp. He turned around, opened the door, and left without looking back.","Ye Jian sent him off and waited for his return.","From the first to the third day of the new year, Ye Jian led the female soldiers to stand guard. On the fourth day of the new year, Ye Jian led the female soldiers for normal training until the eighth day of the new year.","In the morning on the ninth day of the new year, Ye Jian was woken up by a knock on the door. She sat up from the bed immediately and quickly turned on the lights.","\"Little Ye, gather urgently! Three minutes!\" It was the company commander’s voice.","At 3:50 am, Ye Jian left the camp with Company Commander Zhu and 20 male soldiers. They got into a truck with anti-slip chains on the wheels and headed somewhere.","\"You can sleep for a while more. It’s just that the ride will be a little bumpy.\" The company commander smiled at Ye Jian, who was sitting beside him. \"It’s like the cradle you slept in when you were young. It can sway you to sleep.\"","Ye Jian, who was nearly suspended in the air, smiled and replied, \"No baby can withstand a cradle that can break bones.\"","\"Hahaha, it was just an analogy.\" The company commander laughed loudly. \"You were asked to help during the last-minute mission. It’ll take some time to arrive. Time will go faster if you sleep.\"","Ye Jian thought for a moment before asking, \"What mission is it?\"","\"It’s an experiment. We need troops to guard it. The time is six days. The experiment will start in three days. We’ll clear the surroundings and set up sentry posts.\"","There were many places in the base. Once there was any experiment that needed to be completed, it would definitely be a huge experiment. Moreover, it would be directly related to military power.","Ye Jian’s facial expressions turned serious when she heard that it was such a heavy responsibility.","Before she set off, she thought that there was some movement that needed to be dealt with. She didn’t expect the mission to be to ensure safety while an experiment was being carried out."]},{"number":4965,"title":"Chapter 4965: Witness","paragraphs":["This was the first time Ye Jian witnessed the appearance of a brand new technology since she started her military service. This was also the first time she participated in a national top-secret experiment. Even though she was always calm, she was still a little excited.","As a soldier, how could she not be happy to see another boost in the country’s military power?","The experiment was carried out hundreds of kilometers into the desert. This place was really empty. Besides soldiers, no one else could enter this place. This was a real restricted area. It was a restricted area without a name on the map. Countless unknown experiments were completed in this restricted area.","They set off at 3:00 am on the ninth day of the new year and arrived at the desert at 10:00 am on the 11th. After getting off the truck, they didn’t have any time to rest. Ye Jian was led by Company Commander Zhu and followed by the specialists to patrol the desert. This included driving away animals and birds with sound waves.","Birds were not to be underestimated. It was very likely that they had high-definition cameras installed on them and were sent through satellites. Hence, the chasing of birds was extremely important. They could not let a single bird fly into the sky.","\"There are too many countries that want to steal our military secrets, especially the Western countries. They can’t bear to see our country rise. They hope that our country will always remain in the era when we needed the help of the former Soviet Union to complete all kinds of research and development. They wish for us to remain backward, in poverty, and ignorant...","\"But how can our country be led by the nose? If we fall behind, we will be beaten. The entire military will remember what our leader said. This is the truth!","\"Don’t underestimate this piece of wasteland. Almost all missile experiments are completed here. Every time they’re released for experiments, they never fail. Although it’s called an experiment, it’s actually to let the chiefs of the Great Hall and the military see the power of the new weapons. It’s impossible for them to fail.","\"After this experiment is completed, it will definitely be popularized to the entire military in less than a month. The artillery unit will use it immediately. Our regiment can see it, but we’ll hardly use it.\"","Ye Jian, who was following Company Commander Zhu, heard countless legends about this land. Every time she walked past a pothole, she couldn’t help but wonder if this deep pit was left behind by some experiment.","The specialists used radar technology to detect a large area. Every time a red dot appeared on the radar circle, they would immediately inform the people below through wireless communication so that they could clear it immediately.","To ensure the safety of the entire experiment, everything within a 100-kilometer radius had to be cleaned up. There were no suspicious points.","In addition to the radar setup, there was also infrared deployment and infrared tracking. When all the radar points and infrared were set up, the entire experiment land seemed to be enveloped by a huge net. No signal could be sent out, and no satellite could capture the images in the sky.","Until the experiment was completed, this place was like a point that had disappeared from the earth. It was truly isolated from the world.","\"All points are set up. All points are set up. Start the radar device.\"","\"Roger, Roger. Attention, attention. Radar device activated, radar device activated. Three, two, one, activate!\"","The radar equipment was activated, and the entire sky was monitored. Besides those who had entered the monitoring range and were equipped with digital information numbers, no one else could enter the experimental site."]},{"number":4966,"title":"Chapter 4966: Call","paragraphs":["In three days, Ye Jian, who was a special forces soldier, gained a lot of experience. She saw all kinds of equipment and vehicles, such as chemical shower vehicles, riot-proof armored vehicles, riot-control vehicles, water-shooting vehicles, light vehicles, comprehensive maintenance vehicles, military camp vehicles... All kinds of special vehicles had their own roles and uses.","Ye Jian, who had the strongest retention, would occasionally get confused as she memorized the names of the special equipment vehicles.","Company Commander Zhu had seen Ye Jian muttering to herself a few times. However, every time he walked closer and wanted to understand, Ye Jian would shut up vigilantly. No matter how he asked, he couldn’t get an answer.","\"What are you talking about? Are you wondering if you can approach to watch the experiment? Hahaha, don’t think about it anymore. You can’t watch it.","\"We’re mainly in charge of guarding. We’re at least 50 kilometers away from the real experimental site. We can’t see it. However, we might be able to hear some movements.","\"Last time, during the cruise missile test and the open-air missile test, the precise strike point was not far from us. That sound shook the ground until it trembled. You could smell the gunpowder from 20 kilometers away.","\"Now, those missiles have been put to use. In less than three years, new experiments are being done. Every time I carry out such a mission, I’ll be excited for half a day.","\"Instructor Ye, why do I feel that you’re... very calm? Is it because you’re a special forces soldier and you’re better than me in all aspects? Is that why you’re calmer than me?\"","Was the company commander worried that Ye Jian would panic since it was her first time taking on such a mission? He kept chatting with Ye Jian from time to time. He mocked himself and teased Ye Jian. He talked too much, making Ye Jian a little worried.","Hearing this, Ye Jian sighed and said, \"I’m not calm. I’m memorizing the equipment that I’ve seen these few days. Every time I’m reaching the main points, you interrupt me. Look, I forgot which equipment I memorized just now.\"","Company Commander Zhu’s lips twitched upon hearing this response. Then, he sighed. \"To be honest, Instructor Ye, every time I’m nervous or excited, I can’t help but talk more. Please bear with me until the experiment ends. Once I hear that the experiment is successful, I’ll definitely remain silent and not disturb you anymore.\"","Ye Jian was even more worried now. The experiment time was set to start tomorrow at 3:00 pm. It was only 10:00 am now. There were 29 hours before the experiment time. Wouldn’t she have to listen to Company Commander Zhu’s chatters for another 29 hours?","Fortunately, the company commander needed to run around and wouldn’t disturb Ye Jian often. Thus, Ye Jian endured it.","She couldn’t bear to reject Company Commander Zhu, who hadn’t had a good rest since yesterday.","At 5:00 pm, Company Commander Zhu, who had disappeared for a few hours, stopped beside Ye Jian in a Warrior car. This time, he didn’t come to disturb Ye Jian. Instead, he needed to bring Ye Jian to the experimental center.","As for why Ye Jian was the only one going, Company Commander Zhu didn’t know either.","\"I received a notice from the higher-ups to bring you over. When I asked why, they said we’ll only know when we get there.\" That was what Company Commander Zhu explained to Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t ask further. Since she didn’t know, she would know when she reached the experimental center.","Before getting into the car, Company Commander Zhu, who hadn’t slept for more than 24 hours, yawned several times. Ye Jian, who was about to get into the car, retracted her right leg and said to Company Commander Zhu, whose facial expressions couldn’t hide his fatigue, \"Rest for a while. I’ll drive.\""]},{"number":4967,"title":"Chapter 4967: Nail","paragraphs":["Company Commander Zhu, who was yawning and digging into his pocket for chili peppers to chase away his sleepiness, held the red chili peppers in his hand and asked Ye Jian, \"Are you proficient?\"","Company Commander Zhu didn’t dare to let Ye Jian drive.","However, thinking about Ye Jian’s identity, Company Commander Zhu felt that it shouldn’t be a problem.","Ye Jian didn’t know what kind of proficiency the company commander was referring to. She thought for a moment before nodding. \"Why don’t you take a look first? If you think my skills are alright, you can let me drive.\"","\"Alright!\"","Company Commander Zhu, who was so tired that he needed to rely on the chili peppers to refresh himself, put them back into his pocket. He patted his dry face that was covered in frostbite and climbed up the car.","Since she dared to say that she would try it out first, her skills should be good!","Ye Jian, who had some sleep last night, sat in the driver’s seat and opened the cruising route. As the engine started with a bang, the slender female soldier drove the huge Warrior car across the vast desert.","She got into the car agilely and drove suavely. The steering wheel seemed to come alive in her hands. She drove the Warrior car as easily as a toy car.","She wasn’t proficient; she was very proficient!","The company commander didn’t probe further. He said directly, \"It’s 54 kilometers. We’ll reach in an hour. We can drive slower so that we’ll be in time for the sentries to change shifts at 7:00 pm. I’ll sleep for a while.\"","After he finished speaking, he closed his eyes and fell asleep.","Within three minutes, Ye Jian heard Company Commander Zhu snoring.","He had been too busy and was exhausted. He didn’t have time to rest at all. Now that he finally had some time to close his eyes, the company commander had to make use of it.","At 5:00 pm, the desert was already quite cold. Ye Jian, who was wearing a desert camouflage cold-proof uniform, maneuvered the Warrior car agilely and followed the patrol route to the experimental center.","Ye Jian didn’t look excited until now.","This time, she was able to witness the success of the new experiment at a close distance!","The shift changed at 7:00 pm. Ye Jian slowed down the car and arrived at the sentry post at 6:20 pm. Company Commander Zhu woke up and went through identity verification with Ye Jian with red eyes.","After confirming the identity of the company commander, the soldier said directly, \"I’m sorry, you don’t have access.\"","The company commander said, \"I sent her over.\"","The soldier who verified their identities looked at Ye Jian sharply again. He looked up and down as if he was confirming something.","Ye Jian sensed that something was amiss. Her gaze turned vicious, and her aura changed.","Special forces soldiers who had killed on the battlefield always had a bloodthirsty aura.","Company Commander Zhu’s heart skipped a beat. He was shocked. The soldier sized up Ye Jian was surprised. \"Ye Jian?\"","\"Yes!\" Ye Jian replied.","\"Please wait a moment!\" In front of Ye Jian, the soldier contacted the relevant personnel inside. \"06 to 01. Ye Jian reporting, Ye Jian reporting.\"","After he finished speaking, he added, \"A female soldier.\"","There was probably an immediate answer from the wireless earpiece. \"Drive for 200 meters, turn left, and stop. Get down and walk for 500 meters in a straight line. You’ll see the tent...\"","Before the man could finish speaking, the soldier raised his hand and pressed the earpiece. After nodding slightly, he said to Ye Jian, \"I’ll bring you over.\"","After confirming her identity, the car was scanned again. Ye Jian drove the car into the experimental area.","The company commander didn’t even watch Ye Jian go in. He had already left to return to his post."]},{"number":4968,"title":"Chapter 4968: Travel Together","paragraphs":["Company Commander Zhu, who was in charge of guarding the periphery, didn’t have access to the experimental center. Ye Jian, who was led in by a soldier, was only qualified to enter because of her access.","Ye Jian drove. The soldier leading the way sat at the side and sized up Ye Jian without hiding anything. When he saw Ye Jian driving the Warrior car casually, he smiled and asked, \"Were you the one driving just now?\"","For a moment, Ye Jian couldn’t figure out who the other party was and why they asked her to come over. She didn’t say anything and only nodded.","Everything in front of her was so unfamiliar. Ye Jian, who had always been steady, wouldn’t let herself fall into a passive position. She had to remember that the more she said, the more mistakes she would make.","The soldier couldn’t help but smile when he saw this. \"You’re very vigilant. Relax. I asked you to come because someone recommended you. If not, we wouldn’t have known about your existence.\"","Someone recommended her?","Why did they recommend her?","Although the desert was cold at 6:30 pm, the stars in the sky were dense and fine. A silver river could be seen clearly, like a silver dragon roaming the sky.","Ye Jian remained silent and didn’t let the soldier ask any questions. After walking for about 50 meters, she glanced at the front from the corner of her eyes and saw a black object covered by a desert-colored cover not far to her right.","In the night, it was like a dormant beast waiting for an opportunity to wake up.","Around her, the sentinels with live ammunition guarded the huge thing. Ye Jian only glanced at them from the corner of her eyes and felt several cold gazes sweeping over her.","These sentinels were not ordinary!","Ye Jian’s heart turned cold. She immediately retracted her gaze and didn’t dare to look anymore.","After passing by the huge thing, the soldier leading the way led Ye Jian for another 200 meters before coming to a tent. Two sentinels were standing guard outside. When they saw the person, one of them blocked the entrance of the tent with his arm while the other soldier with a gun shouted, \"Who are you?\"","\"Ye Jian is here to report.\"","The soldier who was leading the way opened his mouth. The soldier who was blocking the entrance of the tent retracted his arm and saluted before letting them in.","Ye Jian, who was waiting, clearly felt several gazes sweeping past her. They were cold, powerful, and corporeal.","Ye Jian straightened her back and responded to these gazes calmly until they disappeared.","The soldier leading the way didn’t send Ye Jian in. \"The captain is inside. He’ll arrange your position.\"","Until now, Ye Jian still didn’t understand why she was asked to come over. The sentinels standing guard outside, the soldiers leading the way, and the sentinels standing guard beside the tent were obviously from the same military unit as the sentinels standing around the black behemoth. They weren’t ordinary soldiers either.","This place was heavily guarded by elite soldiers. Why did she have to come?","Ye Jian lifted the tent curtain and walked in. She saw three officers with higher military ranks than her standing in front of a sand table and pointing at something.","Seeing her enter, one of the young lieutenant colonels, who was around 27 or 28 years old, smiled at Ye Jian and said, \"Ye Jian, right? My surname is Lei, and I’m the captain of the sentinels outside. Wait for a moment. I’ll look for you after I’m done with the two of them.\"","Before Ye Jian could shout the word ’report’, he instructed Ye Jian to wait.","The other two soldiers were majors. They were very young too. They were around 20 years old. They smiled at Ye Jian to show their courtesy. Then, they lowered their heads and continued listening to their captain.","Ye Jian stood at the side and listened to them quietly."]},{"number":4969,"title":"Chapter 4969: Airborne Soldiers","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was standing in a corner as an invisible person, actually wanted to go out. However... the lieutenant colonel with the highest military rank and the highest position had spoken. She could only think about it in her heart.","She stood obediently at the side and waited. When they finished speaking, they would naturally remember that she was still waiting at the side.","The three people in the tent didn’t hide their conversation from Ye Jian. Instead, they wanted Ye Jian to hear them so that she would know what to do.","Captain Lei asked Ye Jian to wait at the side and didn’t look at Ye Jian again. Holding a laser pointer, he glanced at the newly built sand table and gave orders with a serious expression.","\"The fragments will spread. After collecting the data, we’ll mainly gather the fragments from the west and north. The data personnel at the base will collect from the east and south. They will be the first wave, and we will be the second.","\"There’s radiation. All soldiers must wear the same radiation-proof uniform. Before we set off, we must confirm that the uniform is safe.","\"Liu Peng, you’re in charge of the west. Ren Yu, you’re in charge of the north. Complete the collection of fragments within 24 hours.\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","The other two young lieutenants immediately agreed. The matter was almost over.","After giving his orders, Captain Lei turned around and looked at Ye Jian. He saw the young female soldier standing upright like a sentinel on a mission. Captain Lei smiled. The other two young majors smiled too.","This female soldier from the special forces was quite interesting. She was calm enough. When she stood, she gave off the aura of a sentinel.","\"I’m sorry for being negligent. Let me introduce myself first.\" Captain Lei, who had finished his work, introduced the two young officers beside him. \"These are Liu Peng and Ren Zeyu.\"","When Captain Lei was making introductions, Ye Jian reached out her hand. As the three of them shook hands, they could feel the thick gun calluses in each other’s hands.","Liu Peng released his hand and looked at Ye Jian with a smile. \"Your calluses are very thick. You must have practiced it a lot.\"","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"It’s normal training.\"","Liu Peng raised his eyebrows and didn’t say anything else.","The female soldier was very calm and didn’t talk much. At this point... she was still very vigilant.","The smile on Captain Lei Zhen’s face got deeper. The higher-ups told him that the female soldier who came at the last minute wouldn’t talk much and told him not to worry. Yes, she was indeed a female soldier who didn’t talk much.","She was also very beautiful. At first glance, she was stunning.","\"We are all airborne soldiers from an airbase. We are in charge of the safety of the experimental project and the collection of fragments.\"","When Captain Lei mentioned the experimental project, he pointed at the sky, indicating that he was in charge of the safety of the sky.","Airborne soldiers!","Ye Jian was filled with respect. Her eyes lit up.","The airborne military unit was born in the early 1960s and was transformed by the army. After more than half a century of development, the airborne soldiers in China had developed into artillery, engineers, scouts, chemical defense soldiers, missile soldiers, and more than ten other modern special units.","The three airborne soldiers standing in front of her were not as simple as what Captain Lei had described.","Ye Jian was a special forces soldier. Lei Zhen said that they were airborne soldiers, but Ye Jian had been observing them and labeled them as special reconnaissance soldiers in her mind.","Special reconnaissance soldiers were the true identities of the three young officers in front of her."]},{"number":4970,"title":"Chapter 4970: Special","paragraphs":["The special reconnaissance soldiers of the airborne military unit could quickly surpass any ground obstacles and carry out long-range raids and all-round mobile combat at the fastest speed.","Special forces, special missions, and special combat capabilities... The special reconnaissance soldiers in the airborne military unit are the \"fighters\" in this special forces!","Captain Xia once told her that the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit could at most master three types of aircraft and four terrain jumping skills.","The airborne military unit had five types of aircraft, nine types of terrain, two umbrellas, and fully armed parachuting skills.","The special reconnaissance soldiers in the airborne military unit were the elites of the airborne soldiers. They could complete airborne combat on islands, deserts, highlands, water, mountains, forests, and at night!","When she learned about them, she was amazed. She didn’t know that such a powerful team existed!","When she was exclaiming, Captain Xia raised his head and knocked her head again. He was so angry that he laughed. \"Do you think that other than the special forces military unit in our army, the air force wouldn’t have one?","\"The maritime amphibious special combat team was formed the latest. The special reconnaissance soldiers were formed even earlier than our Xueyu unit. You should understand our country’s air force better than the army and navy.\"","After arriving at school, she went to the library to read countless books about the air force. Among them, she had a detailed understanding of the special reconnaissance soldiers in the air force. She fantasized about a special forces soldier who could descend from the sky and complete combat without anyone knowing.","She thought that if she could see a soldier like that one day, it would be a beautiful memory in her life.","She didn’t expect... She didn’t expect to see them today. It wasn’t just one or two soldiers. It was a group of them!","When Ye Jian reached out her hand, her eyes were bright. Captain Lei couldn’t help but come back to his senses. Did he say something else just now? Why did this calm female soldier’s eyes suddenly light up?","He recalled carefully and confirmed that he didn’t reveal anything.","But the female soldier’s eyes suddenly lit up... Captain Lei suddenly smiled. The special forces of the army lived up to their reputation! They were really impressive!","He said that they were airborne soldiers, and this female comrade had probably already guessed which category they belonged to.","Airborne soldiers were just a general term. There were several types of them. He just didn’t know which category this female comrade guessed they belonged to.","Missile soldiers from the air force? Aviation soldiers? Or artillery soldiers?","Major Liu Peng and Major Ren Zeyu shook hands with Ye Jian one after another. Liu Peng smiled and said, \"Captain, we’ll go out first. You guys chat first.\"","Captain Lei nodded. \"Okay, go ahead. I’ll have a chat with the female comrade from the army.\"","Major Liu Peng and Major Ren Zeyu nodded slightly. Before they left, they smiled at Ye Jian amiably before leaving.","\"I’m sorry, there’s no place to sit. I can only ask you to stand and talk.\" Captain Lei, who had been smiling and talking, pointed at the sand table. \"Come, let’s talk at the sand table.\"","Before they reached the sand table, Captain Lei suddenly smiled and asked, \"Have you figured out our identities?\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. \"It’s just a guess. I don’t know if I’m right or not.\"","Ye Jian was too humble. She was already sure of the other party’s identity, but she wasn’t being truthful about it.","It couldn’t be helped. She was not used to revealing her trump card from the start."]},{"number":4971,"title":"Chapter 4971: Towering Tree","paragraphs":["Captain Lei couldn’t help but laugh again. \"Hahaha, how much of it have you guessed?\"","Captain Lei’s appearance was not outstanding. He could even be considered ordinary. He was completely inconspicuous when he walked into the crowd. However, his gaze was especially sharp and resilient. When he stood in front of you, it felt as if you were not looking at a person but a huge tree.","If you could rest under a tree, it would shelter you from the wind and rain. It would make you feel very safe the moment you approached.","Ye Jian thought for a moment and replied to Captain Lei seriously, \"When I came over just now, I only glanced at the huge object that was covered from the corner of my eye. It only took a second for me to be discovered. It was also the first time I was discovered when I was sizing up the surroundings from the corner of my eye. At that time, I felt that the soldiers guarding the area were not simple.\"","\"The main reason why you think this way is because you’re not simple yourself, right?\" Captain Lei, who had been smiling, revealed his neat and white teeth. He would look very amiable if his gaze wasn’t so sharp.","Facing the questioning, Ye Jian smiled calmly and said, \"To be able to guard the experimental center directly, I think everyone knows that you’re not simple, Captain Lei.\"","\"Then do you know who we are?\"","Ye Jian looked up. There was a glint in her black eyes. \"Special reconnaissance soldiers in the air force.\"","Without any hesitation, she answered in a firm tone. Captain Lei, who was holding the laser pointer, frowned secretly. He looked at Ye Jian with a dark look in his eyes.","Her guess was so accurate. Her tone was firm as if she already knew.","He was sure that before this, this female soldier from the special forces didn’t know that the soldiers guarding here were airborne soldiers.","They didn’t come in a car. They took a ride and landed directly. They had been operating here since a week ago. None of the specialists who came and went, including the researchers in charge of this experiment, could tell that they were special reconnaissance soldiers in the air force. No one noticed them!","As for this female soldier in front of him, she was able to tell in less than 15 minutes after she arrived at the company. Her observation skills were quite terrifying.","\"Why do you think that we’re special reconnaissance soldiers? What made you so sure? Did we expose ourselves in certain aspects?\" Captain Lei asked seriously. After asking, he could correct it!","Ye Jian shook her head. \"No, no. I just relied on my instincts.\" She paused for a moment and continued, \"I’m rarely caught directly. As a special forces soldier, I naturally thought that the other party’s identity was not simple when I was discovered on the spot.","\"When we shook hands just now, I realized that you and your comrades had thick gun calluses on your hands. Major Liu Peng even asked me casually, ’You must have trained a lot, right?’ The average airborne soldier has less gun training compared to parachute training.","\"Besides the thick gun calluses on your and your comrades’ hands, there are also thick calluses between your thumbs and index fingers. I think that’s because of the umbrella bags.","\"Combined with the fact that I was caught by your soldiers on the spot and I happen to know the history of the development of our country’s airborne soldiers, so I also know about the special reconnaissance soldiers. That’s why I’m so sure.\"","That meant that they weren’t exposed. It was just that she happened to know about it and because she was also a special forces soldier.","She was so meticulous that it was astonishing. At the same time, Captain Lei felt a chill down her spine.","Captain Lei retracted his smile and sighed. \"It looks like we have to restrain ourselves. We can’t say too much. If we say too much, I’m afraid you’ll even be able to guess where we came from.\""]},{"number":4972,"title":"Chapter 4972: Contact","paragraphs":["Captain Lei wasn’t exaggerating. The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit were best at obtaining the greatest secrets from small details. The more the other party spoke, the more they would dissect and analyze. After removing the impurities, what was left was the essence they wanted to know.","Although Ye Jian had not officially joined the Xueyu unit and had not undergone the systematic and comprehensive training of the Xueyu unit, she had always been in contact with elite special forces soldiers and often trained with them. Although there was no systematic training, Ye Jian’s comprehension ability allowed her to gain more information.","After experiencing the sharpness of this female soldier from the special forces, Captain Lei didn’t dare to say too much.","The special reconnaissance soldiers in the air force wouldn’t reveal themselves. Even between soldiers, they couldn’t let them know too much.","Captain Lei immediately changed the topic. \"Let’s get back to the main topic. It’s getting late. The earlier we finish our business, the earlier you can rest.\"","Although Ye Jian was very interested in the special reconnaissance soldiers, she didn’t want to get Captain Lei into trouble for revealing too much. Ye Jian, who had always been tactful, naturally had the foresight. Hearing that, she smiled and nodded. \"Okay, Captain Lei. Please speak.\"","The earlier they finished their business, the earlier she could rest. This meant that she still had things to do after this.","\"We lack a sharpshooter. The higher-ups recommended you to temporarily replace the shooting position tomorrow. It’s not land shooting but helicopter shooting. I heard that you completed helicopter shooting at sea before and your results were not bad, right?\"","Ye Jian joined the Storm Commando Brigade two years ago to complete the helicopter shooting on the sea. It was a subject that she had to pass during training under Demon King Li Jinnian.","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes slightly and nodded. \"Yes, it happened two years ago.\"","Besides Major General Yang and Captain Xia, Commander Xia also knew about this training. The higher-ups Captain Lei referred to... Was it Major General Yang?","Could it be that Major General Yang was in the experimental center too?","Ye Jian, who was calm and composed, had already thought about it a few times in her heart. Her expression was serious and cold as she waited for Captain Lei to continue.","\"Tomorrow’s experimental project is focused on aerial missiles. In addition to protecting the experimental center, we also have a heavy responsibility. The moment the experiment is completed, we need to deal with a small target immediately. This mission requires a sharpshooter to destroy the ground radar device immediately.","\"Tomorrow, you’ll be the sharpshooter. It’s also an important position for us to successfully complete the next mission.\"","Ye Jian thought that she would, at most, be asked to keep watch or patrol. She didn’t expect her to take on such a heavy responsibility. She was stunned for a moment.","\"Where’s the original sharpshooter?\" she couldn’t help but ask.","Captain Lei thought for a moment and even deliberated for a moment before replying, \"There are a total of three sharpshooters in my team. Two of them are at the scene and one of them is on a mission. He can’t rush back in time.","\"Originally, we only needed two sharpshooters. The air force headquarters added a mile at the last minute, so we’re still short of one sharpshooter. This also exposed a serious problem for our team. When we go back, we have to reflect on ourselves to eliminate the problem of last-minute missions and lack of manpower.\"","The lack of manpower at the last minute was a serious problem. From this, it could be seen that the comprehensive ability of the soldiers of the military unit was lacking, hence Captain Lei had to face a lack of manpower. This meant that there was a shortage of talent. Secondly, the comprehensive ability of the soldiers needed to be strengthened.","Of course, there was a third point. Captain Lei said that on purpose!"]},{"number":4973,"title":"Chapter 4973: Don’t Know Too Much","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was leaning toward the third possibility. Captain Lei was afraid that she would know too much, so he purposely said such words.","She silently praised Xia Jinyuan in her heart. The special forces of the Xueyu unit were comprehensive. They were proficient in everything. An assaulter could sometimes be a sniper. A sniper could be an assaulter. Z7’s position could be temporarily replaced by T6 and V8. Even if there was a heavy responsibility at the last minute, arrangements could be made. Each person could play several roles.","\"Captain Lei, the position you arranged is too important. I’m afraid I’m not qualified.\" Ye Jian didn’t dare to nod immediately. She had trained on the helicopter to shoot accurately on the sea. However, after that training, she hadn’t undergone such training again. She had some scruples.","Captain Lei smiled. \"That’s why we invited you over in advance. We want you to prepare for tomorrow’s mission.\"","Prepare in advance?","How should she prepare?","Ye Jian saw Captain Lei picking up the wireless intercom on his waist. He adjusted the channel and placed it at the corner of his mouth. \"01 to 00. Please answer if you hear me. Please answer if you hear me.\"","\"00, received. 00, received. We’re ready to take off at any time.\"","The calm voice of the soldier came from the intercom. Ye Jian’s eyes widened. She looked at Captain Lei in surprise. \"Are you planning to take off tonight and let me have a go?","\"Captain Lei, it’s true that I have helicopter training, but I have to tell you that I have never had night helicopter training, let alone night shooting.\"","She was very cautious and didn’t care about letting him know her shortcomings. Captain Lei just smiled, becoming even more interested. \"It’s fine that you’ve never trained for it. Isn’t tonight a good opportunity for you?\"","Captain Lei was a little worried that Ye Jian would insist on rejecting him because she wasn’t qualified. He threw out a very tempting bait. \"When the time comes, I’ll let you see us complete an airborne mission. If you want to learn a little more about airborne missions, we can teach you.\"","\"How about it? Do you agree? Do you want to try?\"","The bait was too tempting. It was so tempting that Ye Jian couldn’t bring herself to reject it.","Of course, she wanted to! She just didn’t think she was qualified!","Ye Jian nodded honestly. \"I really want to, but I’m more worried that I won’t be able to do it.\" She sighed again. \"Captain Lei, what you’re doing is against the rules. You know what I want to know the most, but you still threw out the bait to lure me in.","\"I knew that it was bait, but I still bit it.\"","\"Hahaha, it’s not bait. It’s an opportunity. You’re just seizing this opportunity. Let’s go and change our equipment!\"","Captain Lei, who was walking, laughed and raised his hand. His hand was in the air when he suddenly retracted it. Right on the heels of that, he slapped his forehead awkwardly. \"I’m sorry. It’s a habit. A habit.\"","He habitually wanted to put his arm around his comrade’s shoulders. When his hand reached into the air, he suddenly remembered that the soldier in front of him was a female. As a male soldier, if he rashly put his arm around a female soldier’s shoulder... Cough... Cough... It wouldn’t be good.","He would be beaten up by the female soldier for being a hooligan.","With the strength of a special forces soldier, even if she was a female soldier, oh no... The reason why a female soldier could become a special forces soldier was because she was stronger than a male soldier!","It probably would not be an ordinary beating.","Ye Jian didn’t feel awkward. When she was in the Xueyu unit, her comrades often hugged her shoulders like brothers. She didn’t feel awkward. It was a normal interaction."]},{"number":4974,"title":"Chapter 4974: Chat","paragraphs":["It was a normal interaction... Who knew that the team members who treated Ye Jian as their brother were given extra training by the narrow-minded Lieutenant Colonel Xia?","Walking out of the tent, Captain Lei raised his hand and made a grabbing gesture. \"Not bad. Although the temperature is a little low and there’s no wind, it’s suitable for night flight.\"","It was already dangerous to parachute in during the day, let alone at night.","There was no way to see the topography and ground targets clearly immediately. In order to ensure the safety of the airborne soldiers, there would be weather protection before they landed. They would seek advantages and avoid harm. They would prevent and reduce the danger of dangerous weather to the airborne soldiers.","For instance, when Captain Lei asked Ye Jian to watch them complete the airborne mission, Ye Jian was very worried that the weather would bring them danger.","Hence, after Captain Lei finished speaking, she said, \"It’s very dangerous to parachute in at night. The wind speed doesn’t seem strong now, but to complete the parachute, you need to have a forecast of the wind, clouds, visibility, air pressure, temperature, and so on. Just now, you asked me to watch you parachute in, but forget it. I’m already very satisfied to be able to come into close contact with the elites of the airborne soldiers.\"","\"No, no. I mean what I say. Since I’ve already said it, how can I go back on my word? Especially since you’re so interested in our airborne military unit. Comrade Ye Jian, since you’re so interested, I suspect that you have the intention of changing units.","\"Do you? If you do, you can consider it. I’ve seen your training results. You’re quite outstanding. Once you enter the military unit, I think you’ll definitely be able to become an outstanding airborne soldier within a year.\"","It was true that Ye Jian was outstanding, but his suggestion to her about changing military units was not a real offer. It was just something to help relax Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who had always had a good mentality, smiled. \"The army is good too. Captain Lei, you can consider it too. If you change your military unit, you’ll definitely become a soldier king!\"","She was very calm. She even teased him back.","The smile on Captain Lei’s face got deeper. He looked at the female soldier who was walking with him and started chatting casually, \"Are there many female soldiers in your team? Female special forces soldiers are very rare in our military unit. I’ve been a soldier for seven years, but this is the first time I’ve met a female special forces soldier.\"","There were indeed very few female special forces soldiers in the military. However, there were female special forces soldiers in every major military region. It was just that there were not many female special forces soldiers like Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t dare to say too much. The more that she said, the more he would know. She was worried too.","After all, the Xueyu unit was a military unit that didn’t even exist in the company system.","\"Yes, there are many female soldiers in the team. Your requirements are high, so there won’t be many female special forces soldiers in your team. You probably won’t consider recruiting female soldiers, right?\"","\"I didn’t think about it a few years ago. However, as times are changing, there are some missions that female soldiers are more suitable to complete than male soldiers. In the past two years, we’ve also considered recruiting female soldiers and are implementing them.","\"However, as you said, the requirements are high. We can’t recruit a lot of female soldiers because it’s too difficult.\" When they talked about the recruitment of female soldiers, Captain Lei’s expression turned a little serious.","This wasn’t just a problem that Captain Lei was facing. The entire military was facing a similar problem. As more and more female soldiers took over important positions, the scarcity of regular female soldiers became a problem. He believed that in the near future, the military would relax the quota of female soldiers. It wouldn’t be like now where there were only one or two slots in every place.","This was an inevitable development."]},{"number":4975,"title":"Chapter 4975: Hard To Deceive","paragraphs":["The two of them didn’t talk much about the topic of recruiting female soldiers anymore. They didn’t mention it again.","If they could think of this, the higher-ups could too. Hence, the most important thing now was to get down to business.","The helicopter was on standby. Captain Lei brought Ye Jian to the equipment room to get a small-sized set of equipment. \"It’s a small-sized piece of equipment. It’s suitable for you to wear. The gun is on the plane. You can check it when you get on the plane.\"","Ye Jian’s eyes flickered as she took the ventilation suit. It was in a size small. Even the equipment she was wearing... had been prepared in advance?","They predicted that the sharpshooter in the team would have something on at the last minute, so they made preparations in advance?","Ye Jian’s eyes flickered slightly. She smiled slightly. The sharpshooter had something on at the last minute and the higher-ups added a mile at the last minute. Ha... It was fake.","When Captain Lei saw that she had the intention to retreat, he immediately threw out the bait and said that he could teach her some airborne skills. He had clearly been waiting for her!","Captain Lei didn’t notice the smile on Ye Jian’s face. He passed the helmet to Ye Jian and asked jokingly, \"Do you know how to wear it? Do you need a demonstration?\"","Ye Jian was already familiar with the flying equipment set when she was in the Storm Commando Brigade. Naturally, she didn’t need a demonstration. Moreover, the set in her hand wasn’t the set worn by a pilot, so there was no need for a demonstration.","However...","She weighed the small-sized ventilation suit in her hand and raised it slightly. \"Captain Lei, you’re so smart. You predicted that the sharpshooter in your crew would have something on, so you even prepared equipment in my size in advance. You could be a fortune teller.\"","She knew it. Why would they invite her, an instructor who came to train female soldiers, at the last minute to help ensure safety of the experimental test? Why would she suddenly be transferred to the experimental center to take over an important position?","She had always felt that there was a problem with it, but she couldn’t figure out what it was. Now, she finally understood.","It was true that the area needed to be completely cleared to ensure the completion of the experiment, but it was false that she, an instructor, was asked to take over because of a shortage of manpower.","The reason why they asked her to come over was because of the aerial shooting mission.","Captain Lei was lying when he said that the sharpshooter had something on and couldn’t come. It was true that they were on a mission, and she was included in the mission. It was also a mission they needed to complete.","Why did it have to be her?","Why didn’t he tell her directly? Why did he have to let her guess?","What other arrangements did the military have for her?","Ye Jian was deep in thought. Even her eyes turned dark. The coldness in the depths of her eyes fluctuated. Her expression was so serious that Captain Lei smiled awkwardly.","\"No, no. We’re all used to being prepared and making preparations in advance to prevent any emergencies.\" The female special forces soldier chosen by the army was really not easy to fool!","He hadn’t seen how capable she was, but he could already feel the sweat on his back. He hadn’t said anything, not even a word of nonsense, but she actually saw through everything!","Ye Jian took the helmet and smiled. The look in her eyes was so sharp that Captain Lei felt a headache coming on. He wanted to tell her directly that he didn’t know anything.","Just like her, he didn’t know why they insisted on letting her come over and even arranged for night shooting.","Night shooting was a run of the mill for their team. There was nothing special about par for the course. However, if he brought a soldier from the army and let her see their training... He wasn’t her captain. Why did he have to let her see it?","The female soldier in front of him didn’t understand the situation, and as the captain who received the mission at the last minute, he didn’t understand either."]},{"number":4976,"title":"Chapter 4976: What Do You Mean?","paragraphs":["The only thing he knew was that the higher-ups had informed the team at the last minute that there would be a special forces female soldier from the army who he needed to observe for two days. It would be best if he could arrange a position for her during their mission.","They also told him that the female special forces soldier was a sniper and had undergone maritime and air sniping training. They asked him to arrange her position based on this. The most important thing was not to tell her directly that this was an arrangement from above, as it was a temporary arrangement.","The person who sent the message was none other than the division commander. Captain Lei received such a strange order and even discussed it with his deputy captains, Liu Peng and Ren Zeyu, for a long time. In the end, he arranged for the comrade at the main shooting position to be in another position. Then, he arranged for the female soldier to be at the main shooting position.","Faced with Ye Jian’s doubts, Captain Lei, who was having a headache, chose to evade her questions temporarily. \"If there’s anything you don’t understand, we’ll talk about it after we finish our business. Hurry up and change your equipment. The helicopter is on standby. It’s just waiting for you.\"","Ye Jian, who had already obtained the equipment, didn’t have the chance to refuse. She could only nod and change her equipment.","She was changing her equipment in the tent. Captain Lei, who had gone out, said to his comrades through the public channel that had not been turned off, \"The female soldier from the army is sharp. As a captain, my back is sweating because of her questions. Don’t say too much when you meet her, lest she guesses more.\"","A voice quickly came from the public channel. \"What did she guess?\"","\"She guessed that we weren’t on a temporary mission at all. She guessed that she wasn’t on a temporary loan, that she was part of the mission.\" Captain Lei sighed. \"I didn’t say anything. I just gave her a small-sized ventilation suit.\"","\"Captain, you mean that the reason why we were exposed was because of a small-sized ventilation suit?\" another person asked.","\"Yes, the equipment exposed us.\" If he had a cigarette, Captain Lei, who had a gloomy expression, wanted to light one for himself and take a few puffs. \"It was obviously prepared for her. She guessed it at a glance.\"","\"So be it. She won’t think that we’re scheming, right? Captain, why don’t you just tell her that we were forced into a corner? We’re only cooperating like this because we think that she might be capable. Why else would she be left to guess?\"","This soldier spoke a little rashly. It couldn’t be helped. All of them were being asked to cooperate with a special forces soldier from the army. So what if she was a female soldier? Could a female soldier waste resources?","She even ruined their previous plan. The position that belonged to their comrade was taken by her. Ha, she even suspected that they had ulterior motives? Well, they suspected that she didn’t have the ability to shoot in the air!","Although Captain Lei was unhappy about Ye Jian’s arrival and even intentionally ignored her for a while, the resentment in his heart faded after seeing the female soldier’s indifference.","Seeing that his comrades still had some objections, Captain Lei said in a low voice, \"We’re just taking care of her for two days. It’s not like we’ll be taking care of her for a long time. If you have any objections, suppress them in your hearts. Don’t say it in front of the female soldier. She doesn’t know anything either. We can’t vent our anger on her because of this, let alone make things difficult for her. Do you hear me?!\"","\"I won’t make things difficult for her. It’s just that this experiment is a rare opportunity for us. We’re a little unhappy that she’s taking the lead.\"","When Captain Lei heard footsteps coming out of the tent, he quickly turned his back and stared at the tent door. He lowered his voice and continued, \"Alright, we’ll obey the arrangements of the higher-ups. You have to collect her data carefully later. The higher-ups are still waiting for us to hand over her data.\""]},{"number":4977,"title":"Chapter 4977: Don’t Speak Nonsense","paragraphs":["\"Roger!\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Roger that! I’ll definitely collect her data seriously. It’ll absolutely be accurate!\"","\"Small Head, stop it. Big Head didn’t even say anything. What do you think you’re doing?\" Captain Lei raised his voice a little but quickly suppressed it. \"Don’t make Big Head, who’s supposed to accept the arrangements, feel uncomfortable! The female soldier is coming over. Don’t make a long face or it’ll be too obvious.\"","\"A female soldier from the special forces is not an ordinary woman. Kid, you need to shut up! Don’t even let out a fart, do you hear me?\"","After a few seconds of silence, a reluctant reply came. \"Yes!\"","The tent curtain was lifted. The female soldier, who had changed into her flight equipment, strode over with her helmet in one hand. Light poured out from a corner of the lifted curtain. It shone on the female soldier’s tall and straight figure. She looked exceptionally dashing. However... Cough, Captain Lei quickly retracted his gaze.","The curtain was quickly lowered. The valiant female soldier had already merged with the darkness.","Captain Lei, who had cut off the communication, raised his watch that had a night-light function. He smiled and went up to her. \"Not bad. You changed your equipment in two minutes. That’s very fast.\"","It wasn’t a complicated flight uniform. After all, they weren’t going to fly a fighter jet. Captain Lei just gave Ye Jian a ventilation uniform, so she changed quickly.","As for Captain Lei, he didn’t change his clothes at all. They were going to land at night and aim at their targets at night to complete their shooting. They weren’t flying a fighter jet to complete high-altitude combat. The air force training clothes were enough.","Ye Jian, who was walking closer, was still holding the desert camouflage coat she was wearing previously. \"It’s not complicated. Two minutes is enough.\" It was just that the clothes were a little close to her body. The curves of her body were all outlined, so she wasn’t used to it.","The ventilation suit was tailored for the body. It could introduce air with a suitable temperature and spread it all over the human body. When the temperature was high, it could allow the surface of the body to receive air convection and evaporate the sweat in time to maintain the thermal balance of the human body.","When worn in a low temperature environment, it could allow the body surface to receive hot air of suitable temperature, enhancing the ability to resist cold.","In a while, Ye Jian would need to complete her target shooting while the cabin was open. The temperature in the desert was low, and the cold wind was strong. It was most suitable to wear a ventilation suit.","Captain Lei took a look and quickly retracted his gaze. It was also because... the ventilation suit was too revealing. He didn’t dare to look directly at her.","He could tell that Ye Jian wasn’t used to wearing ventilation clothes. He pointed at the coat on her arm. \"The helicopter is in front. It’ll take a few minutes. You can wear the coat first.\"","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief and quickly put it on. She exhaled softly.","She had also worn a tight diving suit during the Storm Commando training, but at that time, she was focused on fighting with her cousin and didn’t think about this. However, the moment she changed into the close-fitting ventilation suit and zipped up the inside, she suddenly felt a squeeze on her chest... She felt awkward later.","Ye Jian put on her coat naturally and followed Captain Lei to the helicopter. Along the way, Captain Lei didn’t dare to say anything else. He kept picking topics that Ye Jian was interested in. Ye Jian seemed to be enjoying it. She didn’t know how far she had walked.","Later on, when Ye Jian mentioned this to Xia Jinyuan, Xia Jinyuan held Ye Jian’s face tightly and reminded her seriously, \"I’m really worried that if you meet another powerful unit in the future, you’ll be stupid enough to leave with them! Remember, you’re a special forces soldier from the Xueyu unit. You can’t be taken away by other military units!\""]},{"number":4978,"title":"Chapter 4978: Deceive","paragraphs":["Thinking back, Ye Jian felt that she had not been vigilant enough at that time. She didn’t even notice how far she had walked.","The position where the helicopter stopped was very well-hidden. If one didn’t look closer, one would think that it was a barren mountain in the desert. The rumbling of the propellers pulled Ye Jian back from Captain Lei’s exciting topic. Captain Lei also stopped the topic at the right time and brought Ye Jian to the helicopter that was ready to take off at any time.","This was a twin-engine, single-rotor reconnaissance, armed and attack helicopter. There were airborne soldiers carrying parachutes standing on both sides of the opened cabin door. When Ye Jian saw the two of them, respect instantly appeared in her serious eyes. Before Captain Lei could give any instructions, she jogged over and saluted the two airborne soldiers against the strong wind caused by the propellers.","The two soldiers were stunned for a moment. One of them muttered softly, \"Why are you so serious? No matter how serious you are, I won’t falsify the data.\"","The voice belonged to Small Head, who Captain Lei nodded at.","Small Head and Big Head were twins. The two brothers joined the military together and entered the airborne military unit together. Then, they became special reconnaissance soldiers together. Their relationship was quite good.","Ye Jian’s arrival occupied the master seat that originally belonged to Big Head. As his younger brother, Small Head was a little unhappy, so he couldn’t help but be a little angry.","Fortunately, Ye Jian couldn’t see their expressions in the middle of the night. She couldn’t hear their mutterings either. Captain Lei patted her shoulder and pointed at the cabin, indicating for Ye Jian to enter.","The noise was too loud. There was no way to communicate. When one opened one’s mouth, one would breathe in the cold wind mixed with sand and dust. If one was not careful, one would choke and cough.","The cabin door was pulled closed, and the helicopter took off successfully. Captain Lei introduced Ye Jian to his comrades on the helicopter. There were four people on board, including the pilot, so that made six people in total including Ye Jian and Captain Lei.","When they saw Ye Jian, suspicion flashed past their eyes.","Such a beautiful female soldier with delicate skin... They had seen her information before this. Was it fake?","How could she be so delicate after high-intensity training every day?","It had to be said that Ye Jian’s fair skin that couldn’t be tanned was extremely deceiving. Before seeing her strength, people would question her ability.","After seeing her display of skills, they would have lingering fear. Only then did they know that one couldn’t judge a book by its cover.","The pilot was responsible for the helicopter taking off and landing. Ye Jian was in charge of destroying the ground targets immediately. Small Head and another soldier were in charge of covering them immediately after landing. Captain Lei would be the last to complete the landing and was in charge of bringing up the rear.","If Ye Jian was included, she would be in charge of bringing up the rear.","The six special forces scouts were a combat team. They had a clear division of labor and could alternate in combat to complete the deep combat.","\"Do you see the red flashing target on the ground? When the helicopter descends to 500 meters, you need to complete one shot. At 400 meters, you need to complete one more. At 300 meters, complete the last shot. You have a total of three chances to destroy the targets. If you fail to complete the shooting three times, it’ll be a failure.\"","Ye Jian, who had already set up her sniper rifle, nodded and made an ’OK’ gesture.","She was confident that she could snipe her targets.","Seeing that Ye Jian’s reply was relaxed, Small Head couldn’t help but remind her, \"The failure on your side doesn’t mean that you’ll fail alone. It means that our entire mission will fail. If we go to a real battlefield, your failure might cause all our comrades to die without a burial place...\"","He didn’t mean to scare Ye Jian. But if one of the soldiers failed, all of them might die.","Airborne combat was a special combat. They usually learned how to fight in depth. They were surrounded by enemies.","Once exposed, they would face enemies on all four sides.","Ye Jian could tell that the other party was questioning her. There was a hint of opinion in his tone. She didn’t like to talk much, so she pursed her lips and silently acknowledged what he said."]},{"number":4979,"title":"Chapter 4979: Discrimination","paragraphs":["Small Head only knew about Ye Jian from the information given to Captain Lei by the military. It wasn’t detailed. It only told them that Ye Jian had undergone similar training and there was no need to worry too much. They could bring her around boldly. As for Ye Jian’s other information, the higher-ups naturally couldn’t tell them what missions she had carried out.","Hence, it was normal for Small Head to question whether Ye Jian could complete the task successfully.","However, Ye Jian could hear another meaning from his questioning. It was something that had accumulated for thousands of years. It couldn’t be changed in an instant. From a man’s point of view, he was questioning a woman’s ability.","It could be called discrimination.","Ye Jian was a female soldier. Every time she met an unfamiliar person, they would question her ability. Only when the results were out would the people who doubted her accept the reality of things.","Sometimes, when faced with such discrimination from men, Ye Jian, as a female soldier, would experience tumultuous emotions and become rebellious.","The more they discriminated against her, the more she had to complete the job beautifully. She had to make those who discriminated against her ashamed.","In her previous life, she was suppressed by Ye Ying. She didn’t borrow anyone’s strength and relied on her weak strength to fight with Ye Zhifan, who had a high status. In the end, she escaped Ye Ying’s persecution again and again. She relied on her unwillingness to admit defeat to overcome difficulties again and again.","However, she didn’t expect such an early defeat in her previous life. She was unwilling, so she called Ye Ying before she died. Even if she was about to die, she wanted to leave a shadow in Ye Ying’s heart.","In her previous life, she was so lowly that she was rebellious. In this life, she had many things. She was already full of confidence, so it was impossible for others to underestimate her.","Sometimes, people lived for their pride.","At this moment, facing Small Head’s doubts, Ye Jian knew that it was useless to say anything else. She used her silence to make Small Head have no reason to continue.","She would shut Small Head up and let him know that female soldiers could be better than male soldiers too!","Captain Lei had already secretly glared at Small Head. Small Head pursed his lips and turned his head slightly.","A female soldier...","Ha, he would wait.","The atmosphere in the helicopter was a little tense. No one said anything.","Ye Jian could tell that Small Head was discriminating against her as a female soldier. However, Captain Lei and the other male soldiers couldn’t tell. They thought that Small Head was just defending his brother.","Captain Lei didn’t say anything, so it was even more impossible for the others to criticize Small Head. He was their comrade. Of course, they would side with him.","The most important position that belonged to their comrade was taken by an army soldier. Small Head had a problem with this, and so did they.","The heavy tension was broken as the pilot got closer and closer to the target. Through the intercom, the pilot told everyone that they were 800 meters away from the target.","Captain Lei took a deep breath and gestured to Small Head, who was sitting by the cabin door, to open the cabin door. The warning light beside the cabin door turned from green to yellow and flickered continuously. The closed cabin door slowly opened, and the cold air from the sky poured into the cabin. It blew away the seriousness and brought with it the coldness that instantly made the muscles in their faces hurt.","Ye Jian, who was familiar with holding a sniper rifle, quickly took off her thick camouflage uniform when Captain Lei signaled to Small Head to open the cabin door. When the cabin door opened, she had already set up her sniper rifle."]},{"number":4980,"title":"Chapter 4980: Her Strength","paragraphs":["The sniper rifles were the Type 97 that Ye Jian was familiar with. Although they used other countries’ sniper rifles every time they went overseas for missions to ensure that their identities wouldn’t be exposed, Ye Jian often used the Type 97 during training.","To a sniper, even if the sniper rifles in their hands were of the same model, the souls of every gun were different. The most important thing when getting a sniper rifle that they had never used before was to familiarize themselves with it. Only by familiarizing themselves with the gun could they become one with the gun.","Captain Lei, who had been staring at the cabin door until it was completely open, turned his head. He planned to signal to Ye Jian, who was sitting inside, that she could approach the cabin door now. He was also worried that Ye Jian would be terrified so high up in the sky. He was still thinking about how to comfort Ye Jian so that she could relax and complete her target shooting.","Unexpectedly, when he turned his head, no... He hadn’t even turned completely. He only moved slightly when he saw that Ye Jian had already sat by the cabin door. Her right shoe was even out of the edge of the cabin door...","The soldier sitting with Ye Jian was an airborne soldier. He looked at Ye Jian and secretly gave his captain a look. Captain Lei received his comrade’s gaze, and his eyes flickered. He sighed in his heart.","Small Head... had wrongly offended someone.","Ye Jian sat at the edge of the cabin door. When she lowered her head, she could see the pitch-black ground.","Ye Jian, who used her arm as a fixed point, had a calm expression on her face. It was as if she wasn’t in the sky but on the ground. She wasn’t afraid at all. Most of the long gun barrel was exposed outside the cabin. As the pilot gave the command and the helicopter continued to land, Ye Jian, who was looking down from the sky, saw a flashing red target.","The effective range of the Type 97 sniper rifles was 600 meters. The pilot reported that the helicopter had descended to 750 meters. Ye Jian, who was in a aiming position, suddenly raised her head and asked Captain Lei through the earpiece, \"The first shot is 500 meters. Can I shoot in advance?\"","Shoot in advance?","Captain Lei was a little surprised. \"Sure, but...\"","Type 97 snipers had an effective shooting range of 600 meters. It was already difficult to shoot at 500 meters. Yet, she still wanted to shoot in advance? Captain Lei didn’t have the chance to say the second half of the sentence. When the pilot indicated that the altitude was 600 meters through the earpieces, Ye Jian, who confirmed that she could shoot in advance, fired her first shot.","She didn’t say much. She just spoke with her ability.","It was not easy to shoot at a descent of 600 meters. It could even be said that it was impossible to complete. Moreover, the wind speed was stronger now, and the pilot had not adjusted the fuselage so that Ye Jian could shoot accurately according to the wind.","In other words, the pilot was still waiting for the sniper to tell him to adjust his direction. Ye Jian, who didn’t talk much, had already completed her first shot.","The sound of the propellers covered the gunshot. In addition, all the soldiers on the helicopter were wearing earpieces. When Ye Jian completed her first shot, they didn’t notice it at all.","It was not until the bullet hit the first target that the smoke device was triggered. The thick smoke exploded like dark clouds and covered the red flashing target. All the soldiers who were waiting for Ye Jian to shoot realized that... this female soldier from the special forces had completed her first shot!","At 600 meters in the air, she hit the target!","\"Captain! Look at the ground!\" Small Head, who had been staring at the ground, shouted in surprise. Before he could finish his sentence, Captain Lei immediately turned his head to look at the ground. He, who was sitting opposite Ye Jian, didn’t see Ye Jian shoot her first shot. He only saw... thick smoke rolling up from the sky."]},{"number":4981,"title":"Chapter 4981: Unrivaled","paragraphs":["She fired!","When did she shoot?","Why didn’t he notice anything?","Captain Lei’s eyes widened in shock.","He tried his best to clear his mind and recall when Ye Jian fired the gun.","Oh right!","After she asked if she could shoot in advance, she must’ve fired the shot immediately after receiving a reply.","She didn’t readjust her posture or prepare to aim. She didn’t even need an estimate of the wind, direction, temperature, and humidity that affected a sniper’s preparation!","He was even sitting opposite her. He didn’t even notice that she had fired!","Did he go blind for a moment?","Otherwise, why didn’t he notice anything?","Captain Lei, who was looking at Ye Jian in shock, opened his mouth. He felt that his so-called reminder was all nonsense. This special forces soldier didn’t need it at all!","As for what Small Head said before, it was even more humiliating!","As the captain, his face... was burning with pain.","\"First target, completed!\" Ye Jian’s cold voice floated into the ears of all the soldiers. These words were like eight slaps on Small Head’s face. The second most humiliated person was Captain Lei.","The pilot of the helicopter swallowed his saliva and whispered, \"Amazing!\"","Wasn’t she amazing?","He was still waiting for the instructions from the sniper to check the fuselage so that the sniper could complete the shooting. In the end, there was no need. The female soldier settled it herself.","This marksmanship was heaven-defying!","Could the navy, army, and air force be able to find another soldier like her?","There was probably no second one. There was only one!","Ye Jian, who had a good start, focused her gaze on the center of the mark. It was a fluorescence point used for aiming at night. She said calmly, \"This is just the start. The two more difficult shots have not been completed.\"","Then, she reported the wind speed and direction. When the helicopter descended, she asked the pilot to adjust the fuselage. As the fuselage deviated, Ye Jian saw a flashing red target in the thick smoke.","At this moment, Ye Jian had already outlined the image in her mind. She could see the position of the second target in the faint starlight and determined her best shot through the wind speed, direction, temperature, and humidity...","Her breathing calmed down slightly. The pilot reported the altitude of descent to be 500 meters. Ye Jian completed her second shot.","Captain Lei and his comrades had the same expression on their faces. They were so shocked that they shouted in their hearts, \"How is this possible? How is this possible? How is this possible?!\"","How did she do it?!","How did she do it?!","How did she make her judgment?!","How did she... Countless questions ran through their hearts.","\"Second target, completed.\"","Ye Jian’s clear voice came from the earpieces again. Small Head lowered his head slightly and secretly raised his hand to slap his ear.","Did he?","Did he?","Did he see how powerful the female soldier was?","Did it hurt?","It hurt!","No wonder the female soldier didn’t answer him just now. Ha, it wasn’t that she didn’t know how to answer. it was that she didn’t care about answering him at all.","Captain Lei sucked in his slightly stiff cheeks. After confirming that he could speak normally, he said, \"Look for the third target. Everyone, get ready.\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Roger!\"","Three voices sounded. The soldiers who needed to descend at night were ready to drop at any time. It was pitch-black below, and they couldn’t see any danger with their naked eyes. They only knew that they had to complete the airborne mission and complete the ’deep combat’."]},{"number":4982,"title":"Chapter 4982: Height","paragraphs":["The female soldier had made them regret what they said in the past, so they knew that they had to perform well. They had to let the female soldier see their capabilities.","It was an early performance. It was also a competition between the soldiers from different military types.","It wasn’t a secret competition. It was a direct competition!","Small Head gritted his teeth and pulled the strap of the parachute tightly. The cold and determined look in his eyes was concealed. He couldn’t let the female soldier underestimate him!","Ye Jian didn’t underestimate any of the soldiers in the helicopter. After knowing that they were special reconnaissance soldiers in the air force, Ye Jian only had respect for them.","They underestimated Ye Jian first. After seeing the capabilities of a female soldier, however, they knew that they had underestimated her.","After the second target was fired, another thick fog rose. This time, it didn’t roll on the ground. It flew straight into the sky.","\"The thick fog is to simulate the thick fog produced after tomorrow’s experiment. It concerns the cooperation between the pilot and his comrades. For now, the pilot will avoid it while you continue to keep an eye on the ground and look for the third target.\"","After Captain Lei finished speaking, Ye Jian, who had been holding her gun, finally moved for a moment. She raised her left hand and shook her arm to increase the blood circulation in her arm. She had to maintain the agility of her arm so that she could better control the sniper rifles in her hand.","The thick fog that rushed up made the pilot adjust the direction of the fuselage. He let the helicopter pull up from the thick fog first. He didn’t descend from the sky again until the thick fog had faded.","Thick fog created a blind spot and also provided cover for the pilot, so the pilot had to descend again before the fog completely dissipated. If he completed the descent once the fog dissipated, it would be considered a mission failure.","Ye Jian looked for her third target while the pilot was in charge of descending. The other four airborne soldiers were also in charge of observing the ground. The six of them cooperated. No one could leave each other in the lurch.","The plane descended to 400 meters. Ye Jian found the third target in the thick fog at a weak point and immediately told the pilot the location. As the pilot cooperated, Ye Jian aimed at the third target again.","After the third bullet was fired and before the sniper rifle was put away, Ye Jian told the four people through her earpieces, \"Third target, completed!\"","The flashing red dot disappeared completely. Ye Jian completed her mission and handed things over to the four soldiers.","The helicopter rose again until it was able to complete the airborne height. Captain Lei shouted, \"Jump!\" Ye Jian’s heart tightened. Small Head, the airborne soldier, rushed out of the open cabin door first.","The figure that rushed out became a black dot in Ye Jian’s eyes. Ye Jian felt that her heart was in her throat.","Small Head was the first to jump. Right on the heels of that, the other two soldiers jumped out one by one. Captain Lei was the last to jump.","Ye Jian saw figures rushing out in front of her one after another and jumping down. Their fearless spirit made her admire them deeply.","Although they were soldiers all the same, their spirits were the same.","As soldiers of the motherland, none of them would retreat when faced with difficulties and the choice of life and death or when they needed to rush to the front and sacrifice their bodies in exchange for safety of the country. No one would escape because they were soldiers!","They would fight to protect for their entire lives!","Soon, the news that Captain Lei had landed safely and successfully arrived at the infiltration location came from the ground. It meant that tonight’s exercise was coming to an end."]},{"number":4983,"title":"Chapter 4983: Yearning","paragraphs":["At 10:00 pm, the helicopter arrived on the ground. The bright light shone in front and illuminated the four figures who were quickly putting away their parachute bags. Ye Jian, who came down from the cabin door, stared at the four figures for a long time. She only retracted her gaze when the pilot in charge of flying the helicopter walked to her side.","The parachuting altitude of China’s paratroopers was generally between 400 meters and 800 meters. The lower the altitude of the parachute, the shorter the time they stayed in the air, which was more advantageous to the combat situation, but the risk factor was also correspondingly higher.","Just now, Captain Lei and the other three completed their parachute jump at a height of 280 meters. To be able to jump below 300 meters and above 1,000 meters was definitely not the training of ordinary paratroopers. Ye Jian was even sure that 280 meters was definitely not their lowest low altitude parachute jump. Perhaps they could complete it even if it was 100 meters!","However, to a rookie like her who had never parachuted before, completing a 280-meter jump was quite impressive!","\"The exercise is over. Aren’t you leaving?\" the pilot standing beside Ye Jian smiled and asked.","This was a very young pilot. He was also a special reconnaissance soldier in Captain Lei’s team. He could operate several different models, from helicopters to military helicopters.","It would take years for the country to groom a pilot who could operate several types of aircraft. If an accident were to happen, the comrades in the team would protect the pilot and retreat first.","Ye Jian, who was standing still, smiled and said, \"I’m shocked by your brilliance. I still need to catch my breath.\" She looked at the figures who had completed their formation with their parachutes on their backs. Her eyes were filled with admiration as she said, \"It’s so risky to be a parachutist. Every time you parachute, you jump with your life. You can’t be afraid of death.\"","Her admiration and emotions made the pilot beside her a little embarrassed. \"It’s nothing. Everyone is the same. It’s quite dangerous for you army soldiers as well.","\"Like you, the danger you face is many times greater than that of ordinary soldiers.\"","The missions carried out by the Xueyu unit were indeed very dangerous. Perhaps it was because Ye Jian was in awe of the airborne soldiers, but she still felt that it was more dangerous for them.","For example, if the parachute landed on a tree branch, one wouldn’t be able to land. Once the enemy was alerted, they would be used as targets. Or one could accidentally fall off a cliff, into deep waters, a swamp, or where the enemy was gathered... There were many uncertain factors.","Although every mission of the Xueyu unit had uncertain danger factors, they could at least reduce the danger through arrangements. It wasn’t like the airborne soldiers who were filled with endless unknown factors.","The pilot felt that the special forces female soldier beside him was very humble. She was so humble that he felt ashamed. He secretly glanced at the female soldier beside him from the corner of his eye. Seeing that her gaze was still filled with respect when she looked at the air force soldiers, the pilot suddenly remembered his comrades’ attitude toward Ye Jian and felt a little upset.","Their attitude toward the female soldier was cold and indifferent, but the female soldier’s attitude toward them was humble and respectful. The pilot pursed his lips and said sincerely, \"I’m sorry, Ye Jian. I apologize for our narrow-mindedness before this. Please forgive our ignorance.\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian turned her head and smiled at the pilot. \"I was indeed a little unhappy at that time. However, it wasn’t because you guys were questioning me and were unhappy with me. It was because...\"","The slight pause made the pilot’s heart sink a few times. He stammered, \"W-What is it?\""]},{"number":4984,"title":"Chapter 4984: Nowhere To Find Peace","paragraphs":["The pilot’s nervousness made Ye Jian smile. Sighing, she replied, \"It’s because I’m angry that you discriminate against female soldiers. Did you look down on me because I’m a female soldier?\"","The direct questioning made the pilot want to find a hole to hide in. His face turned red and hot. It was awkward. \"Yes... There was a little bit of that.\"","He was so nervous that it felt like a cat had got his tongue. He couldn’t say a word.","The pilot’s honesty made Ye Jian smile until her eyes curved like crescent moons. \"There are many female soldiers who are quite powerful. It’s just that you haven’t met them. At that time, I was angry because you discriminated against female soldiers. I wanted to retaliate.\"","The pilot, whose forehead was covered in sweat, swallowed his saliva. \"You got back at us. You got back at us when you fired the first shot.","\"We didn’t expect you to shoot suddenly. You even fired before we reached the mentioned descent. It was fast and accurate. We didn’t know when you fired.","\"I’m not the only one who didn’t know when you fired your gun. Captain Lei and my comrades were all dumbfounded as well. Ye Jian, are you the best sniper in your team?\"","This concerned the reputation of the Xueyu unit. Even if the other party didn’t know about the existence of the Xueyu unit, Ye Jian had to nod and say yes. She continued, \"My comrades are not bad. Everyone has their own specialties. We cooperate well with each other and complete every mission outstandingly.\"","All of them were as powerful as the female soldier in front of him? The pilot’s eyes were filled with yearning. \"You’re so amazing. I wonder if I’ll have the chance to see you in action?\"","\"I think so. In the past, I looked forward to meeting you airborne soldiers. I always wanted to see how powerful you are. Now, the opportunity has come. I wasn’t even given time to prepare.","\"If you had been given time to prepare, the few of us would’ve been even more embarrassed. I’m really sorry about tonight. Please don’t take it to heart. We won’t make similar mistakes in the future.\"","\"Your brilliant performance has already extinguished the anger in my heart. It’s over now. I think that when you see female soldiers in the future, you won’t look down on them anymore.\"","The pilot’s face was so red that it was hot. He waved his hand repeatedly. \"I’m sorry, I’m sorry. With this lesson, we won’t dare to look down on female soldiers next time.\"","What really angered Ye Jian was the fact that they were discriminating against her. However, she had already used her strongest ability to retaliate. There was no need to say anything else. She believed that the male soldiers who discriminated against her weren’t feeling good at this moment. When they saw her later, they would probably be so awkward that they wouldn’t even be able to look at her.","On the other hand, Captain Lei said to his comrades, especially Small Head, in a cold voice, \"When you see Ye Jian later, be polite to her. She’s also following orders!\"","\"I didn’t criticize you in front of Ye Jian just now because I didn’t want to make things difficult for you in front of someone from the army. Don’t bully her. Do you really think she’s easy to bully? Did you see her sniping skills? Do you think Big Head is as good as her? If not, shut up and stop targeting her! Do you understand?\"","In order to prevent Small Head from targeting Ye Jian for the next day, Captain Lei took this opportunity to warn Small Head to prevent him from talking nonsense again.","The other two soldiers were the same. They were all warned by Captain Lei.","Captain Lei also reflected on himself. If he had straightened his attitude first, the soldiers below him wouldn’t have acted the way they did. He had to reflect on and criticize himself first."]},{"number":4985,"title":"Chapter 4985: Overwhelmed","paragraphs":["The truth was just as Ye Jian thought. When Small Head saw Ye Jian, he was so awkward that he didn’t know where to look. After apologizing for what he did, he closed his eyes and said with a fearless expression, \"Come on, I won’t retaliate even if you want to kill or torture me!\"","’It’s just a beating and a scolding. I’ll close my eyes and grit my teeth.’","Ye Jian saw the lines on his forehead. \"Soldiers are strict and dignified. We abide by public order and respect social morals... Have you forgotten?","\"Or do you just dislike me and want to get back at me for embarrassing you earlier? You want me to beat you up or scold you? Sorry, I always abide by the rules. I know everything by heart.\"","Could it be that he suffered brain damage when he jumped just now?","Small Head panicked when he heard that. \"II... Why are you like this? I... You...\"","The more anxious he was, the more he couldn’t say anything. Captain Lei, whose mouth was twitching, couldn’t take it anymore. He kicked Small Head’s butt. Small Head, who was in a hurry to explain, staggered and fell toward Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who was agile, quickly dodged and avoided him. The two soldiers behind Captain Lei had already chosen to look up at the sky at the same time...","They were really... too embarrassed to look at him!","Their captain kicked in the wrong direction, and it was already awkward enough, but in the end, Small Head even fell toward her when he wanted to apologize to her.","It was so awkward that they wanted to explode on the spot. Their reputation was ruined. They couldn’t even flatter her now.","Seeing that he had made a mistake again in a moment of desperation, Captain Lei hurriedly apologized. \"I’m sorry, I’m sorry. I get so furious when I see him like that.","\"Small Head doesn’t have any other intentions. He’s sincerely apologizing to you. It’s just that he doesn’t know how to speak properly. We’ll always remember the rules in our hearts. How can we break the law knowingly? We don’t have any intention of targeting you.\"","It was getting more and more complicated. Damn it! He was so overwhelmed right now!","There was even a problem with the apology!","Of course, Ye Jian knew that Small Head didn’t have any other intentions, and it was even more impossible for him to deliberately lead her to make a mistake. But she was a female soldier, and she was narrow-minded. Previously, she was bullied by Small Head. Now, she was just asking for some interest!","Ye Jian, who had always been magnanimous, had lines that couldn’t be crossed either. They looked down on female soldiers and discriminated against female soldiers, so she had to teach them a lesson!","Waving her hand, Ye Jian said calmly, \"I accept your apology. It’s getting late. If there’s nothing else, you should return to the camp. Don’t delay tomorrow’s business.\"","Seeing that Ye Jian wasn’t pursuing the matter anymore, Captain Lei heaved a sigh of relief. \"It’s alright, it’s alright. Let’s go back to the camp.\" After he finished speaking, he glared at Small Head and planned to settle the score after they went back.","There was a problem even with his apology. He really needed to be taught a lesson!","Ye Jian smiled secretly, showing that she was in a good mood.","They looked down on female soldiers and discriminated against them. That couldn’t be tolerated! When it was time to attack, she would attack. She couldn’t let herself suffer grievances.","Yes, that was what Captain Xia taught her!","When he returned to the Vanguard Battalion, he didn’t see his girlfriend. Xia Jinyuan, who was leading the soldiers for training, sneezed a few times. After the training ended, Lieutenant Colonel Xia quickly made himself a cup of concentrated tea to prevent himself from catching a cold.","On the way back to the camp, Captain Lei reflected and criticized himself. He put on an extremely proper attitude. When he was talking to Ye Jian, Ye Jian could feel that Captain Lei’s attitude and tone toward her had changed drastically."]},{"number":4986,"title":"Chapter 4986: Big Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["He was no longer as casual as before. Instead, he was more cautious. This cautiousness came from Captain Lei thinking about why the higher-ups arranged for Ye Jian to come to his team.","Could it be that the higher-ups wanted to transfer Ye Jian to his team?","This thought flashed past his mind. In the middle of the night, Captain Lei’s back was covered in sweat. That was impossible! That couldn’t be! Would the army bear to let her go? Would the leaders of Ye Jian’s military unit agree?","They would probably fight to the death and not let her go!","But if that wasn’t the case, why did the higher-ups ask Ye Jian to come over? What were the plans of the air force commander? What did the army commander want to do?","Although their team wasn’t a top-secret special forces unit, they didn’t show their faces easily. They had always been hidden. If the higher-ups didn’t plan to transfer Ye Jian to their team, why did they arrange this?","Not only did he end up embarrassing himself, but his heart was also in a mess. He couldn’t figure out what the higher-ups wanted to do.","After thinking about it, Captain Lei still felt that his initial guess was very likely... The higher-ups wanted to transfer Ye Jian to the air force team.","If that was the case... Captain Lei glanced at the female soldier walking with him from the corner of his eyes. With her heaven-defying marksmanship, he would welcome her!","Some time ago, during a meeting in the military district, the commander even suggested that the team recruit a batch of female soldiers. Huh?","Captain Lei seemed to have thought of something. His eyes lit up. That was right!","The division commander had made a suggestion at the meeting some time ago. He then arranged for a female soldier from the army to come to the team to practice. The division commander had personally instructed him to observe the female soldier for two days, but he couldn’t tell the female soldier that this was an arrangement from the higher-ups. Wasn’t the motive obvious?","It was obvious that they arranged for the female soldier to come to his team!","To ’snatch’ such a powerful female soldier from the army, the division commander and the headquarters must have fought with the commander of the army!","After the experiment ended, he had to call the commander to ask if anyone was injured and if it was victorious.","Ye Jian didn’t know that Captain Lei was thinking about so many things. Seeing that they were about to reach the tent, Ye Jian thought of a question. \"Captain Lei, do I need to stand guard tonight?\"","Ye Jian could only ask tactfully where she should sleep tonight.","Captain Lei smiled and looked at Ye Jian differently. \"I didn’t arrange for you to stand guard tonight. The tent with the sand table is your resting place tonight. There’s a sleeping bag there. You can go over directly. Wake up on time and gather at 5:00 am.\"","Ye Jian, who knew where she was sleeping now, could feel the subtle change in Captain Lei’s gaze when he looked at her. She wanted to guess the reason, but Captain Lei said, \"Did you want to become an airborne soldier in the past?\"","There was no such thing!","Ye Jian smiled. \"I’ve never thought of it.\"","Never thought of it? Captain Lei frowned. \"But I see you’re quite interested in airborne soldiers.\"","\"My interest doesn’t mean I want to be one.\"","Ye Jian’s reply made Captain Lei’s heart tighten. No wonder the commander said that he couldn’t tell the female soldier that it was an arrangement from the higher-ups!","Seeing that Captain Lei was still standing, Ye Jian felt even stranger.","She already felt that today’s and tomorrow’s arrangements were strange. Now that Captain Lei was asking such questions, Ye Jian’s doubts got heavier. When she thought of something, alarm bells rang in her heart.","She said seriously, \"I’m interested in the airborne soldiers because I think they’re very powerful. However, I still like the army. I like the feeling of being on earth. Also, I’m afraid of heights!\"","She... was afraid of heights!","Captain Lei, who had left, didn’t believe it at all. At the same time, he understood his commander’s good intentions. In order to snatch the female soldier, he must have worked hard!"]},{"number":4987,"title":"Chapter 4987: Is There Trouble?","paragraphs":["Captain Lei had completely misunderstood and thought that he had seen the truth. Ye Jian, on the other hand, was filled with doubts. She returned to the tent and entered her sleeping bag. She listened to the sand whirling in the desert. Although her eyes were closed, her mind didn’t stop for a moment. After thinking for a long time, she couldn’t guess why the higher-ups made such an arrangement.","She came to the air force military unit as an army soldier and even got a few elite airborne soldiers to accompany her for an exercise. Although it was called an exercise, it looked like a test for her.","Why did they suddenly think of getting airborne soldiers to test her?","Wasn’t it strange for an army soldier to be tested by a few airborne soldiers?","As she thought about it, Ye Jian remembered what Captain Lei said before sending her back to the tent. She was so shocked that she sat up in shock with her sleeping bag in her arms. Captain Lei asked her if she wanted to become an airborne soldier in the past. She only learned about airborne soldiers when she was in her second year of university. After learning about them, she realized how powerful they were.","She didn’t yearn to become one of them!","She only had admiration for them!","In that case, why did Captain Lei ask that?","Could it be... Could it be that... Captain Lei thought that she would change units?","A transfer!","Now, Ye Jian couldn’t fall asleep at all. She subconsciously wanted to look for her man, Xia Jinyuan, to see if she could figure it out.","The desert was surrounded by barren mountains and sand. After entering the experimental center, Ye Jian, who was isolated from the world, could only think of Xia Jinyuan.","Captain Lei misunderstood that the air force was snatching people from the army. Ye Jian also misunderstood that the higher-ups had discovered her relationship with Xia Jinyuan and wanted to pull them apart.","If one was in the air force while the other was in the army, they would belong to different military units. Then, their relationship could be out in the open.","However, that was not what the two of them wanted!","They would be separated and would not be in the same military unit. They would rather have their relationship disappear forever.","It wasn’t a big problem if their relationship was discovered. The problem was... who wanted to separate her from Captain Xia?","Although Ye Jian wasn’t sensitive to politics, Xia Jinyuan had told her about it from time to time and had analyzed the problems they might face if their relationship was discovered. Even though she wasn’t sensitive to politics, she was so shocked by her speculations that she didn’t feel sleepy at all.","Ye Jian suffered until 1:00 am. Thinking about tomorrow’s matters, she forced herself to stop thinking about it. Clearing her mind, she urged herself to sleep.","Captain Lei reported all the data about Ye Jian’s training to the division commander. His rank wasn’t high. Although he was a lieutenant colonel, he couldn’t contact the division commander just because he wanted to. If it weren’t for Ye Jian, Captain Lei wouldn’t have been able to talk to the division commander immediately.","A certain division commander of the air force received Ye Jian’s data and looked at it carefully. In the end, he saw Captain Lei’s long comment. The division commander’s gaze moved slightly. He rubbed the paper with his fingers as if he was thinking about something.","This was a temporary conference room. It was a military tent set up with light steel frames. There were all kinds of special instruments inside. The screens of more than ten computers were lit up. Images and data kept flashing past the screens. More than ten data analyzers were completely awake just so that tomorrow’s experiment could be completed successfully.","There was a large screen in the middle of the conference room. The screen was pitch-black at the moment. Tomorrow, the screen would show the entire body of the missile. It would show the missile launch.","\"There’s a discrepancy in the data here. The imported value should be...\" In front of dozens of computers, an elegant major general with golden epaulets and glasses leaned forward slightly and pointed out a piece of wrong data. \"Even a slight deviation will cause the experiment to fail.\""]},{"number":4988,"title":"Chapter 4988: Snatching Someone","paragraphs":["The data analyzer in the base quickly regenerated the password and checked again. When he saw that there was really a discrepancy, he quickly changed the value.","The major general, who was standing at the side, nodded. He patted the data analysis technician’s shoulder and turned to walk to the next computer.","\"Engineer Fu hasn’t slept for three days and three nights. He walked past you and saw a problem with one glance. How impressive!\" Another data analyzer whispered while waiting for the data to be imported. His tone was filled with respect for Engineer Fu.","\"Otherwise, why would they say that Engineer Fu has sharp eyes? When all the big data is passed in front of Engineer Fu, even the smallest numbers can’t escape Engineer Fu’s eyes.\" After changing the numbers, the technical soldier heaved a sigh of relief. Although his question was extremely small, there was still a problem. A small mistake was enough to make an experiment fail.","If that happened, he would become a sinner of the entire army. Countless engineers in the base would’ve wasted their days and nights fighting.","To ensure that every data and numerical value was correct, he looked through them again without any mistakes.","A numerical error would affect the success or failure of the entire experiment. No one dared to be careless.","The things happening at the command center didn’t reach the ears of the chiefs sitting at the conference table. Everything was being prepared for tomorrow’s experiment.","A certain division commander from the air force raised his head from his subordinate’s report and turned to a major general who was writing something on the conference table. He whispered, \"Old Yang, we’re old classmates. I don’t normally ask you for anything. Now, I have a small request. You won’t reject me, right?\"","Major General Yang raised his head and replied with a smile, \"No matter if it’s big or small, I’ll reject them all.\" His gaze landed on the paper that was hidden but not completely. He tapped the tip of the pen. \"Old Kong, how can I not know what you’re thinking?","\"Little Ye is a talent of our army. We groomed her for many years and now, she’s a talent. If you want to snatch her, do you think I’ll let you? Little Ye’s data is out, right? Let me take a look.\"","He really didn’t want to show it to him!","Commander Kong really didn’t want to give it to him. He hid it well. \"Little Ye’s data? No, there’s no such thing. Go ahead and do your work. I’ll go out and get some wind before calling it a day.\"","He didn’t expect the army to send such a talent to train in his airborne military unit. They had already sent her over. Should he send her back? Did they think his airborne unit was a hotel?","Commander Kong, who loved talents and wanted to snatch anyone who was a talent, made up his mind not to let Ye Jian go. He planned to find Commander Xia and have a chat with him. The army military unit was filled with talents. Although the air force was filled with talents as well, there weren’t many female soldiers!","He had to fight for Ye Jian.","If he really couldn’t fight for her, alas, he would have to bear with the pain and let her go.","After he finished speaking, Commander Kong got up. He thought about many things. Major General Yang, who was sitting still, was shocked by his former junior high classmate’s shameless behavior. Major General Yang stood up too.","It wasn’t convenient to talk in the tent, so they would go outside.","Commander Kong, who wanted to act alone, saw Major General Yang following him and hurriedly pushed him back inside. \"Go, go, go. Why did you come out? Are you thinking of monitoring me? I’m just enjoying the breeze. Why are you here to join in the fun? Go in, go in. Wait for me to come back before coming out.\"","\"Old Kong, everyone says that you’re a scoundrel air force commander. In the past, I defended you on account of our history. Now, it looks like they’re not wrong.\""]},{"number":4989,"title":"Chapter 4989: Sly Old Fox","paragraphs":["Major General Yang, who was pushed back in, wasn’t angry. This wasn’t the first time he encountered a party that wanted to snatch someone from him. Two years ago, the navy wanted to do the same.","But what happened after that? Look, Ye Jian was still in the army. If the other party had succeeded, she would’ve been in the navy.","Commander Kong knew when to yield and when to stand tall. He didn’t care about his old classmate’s mockery at all. In order to keep Ye Jina, he was willing to go all out. \"Scoundrel? You’re always saying things that I don’t understand. Hurry up and go in. Don’t waste my time.\"","He pushed Major General Yang into the tent again and hurriedly went out to look for Commander Xia.","Although this experiment was focused on air defense and was mainly about the deployment of the air force military unit, the army also had an aviation regiment. Naturally, the army attached great importance to it.","Therefore, other than the chief of the navy, the chief of the air force and the army were all present.","Commander Xia was in the tent earlier, but he was invited to return to rest as he was still recovering from a cold. In the end, although he wasn’t in the tent, he didn’t get to rest.","The air force commander walked over with familiarity. Commander Xia was drinking his medicine under the guard’s watch. Before he finished his medicine, Commander Kong walked in.","This was the experimental command center. It was about three kilometers away from the experimental center. It was even farther away from the explosion point. The people closest to the explosion point were Captain Lei and the rest.","It was already in the middle of the night. Commander Kong didn’t beat about the bush and directly explained his purpose for coming. Commander Xia handed the white pills in his hand to the guard and sighed. \"The air force asked to borrow people from me, and I complied. You must’ve been impressed by the soldier. If not, you wouldn’t have come over tonight.","\"I won’t say anything else. You wanted to borrow people, and I lent them. Now that you’ve borrowed them, you still want to keep them? Old Kong, Old Kong, don’t you think your infamy has spread enough?\"","Commander Xia was more eloquent than Major General Yang. He had just started speaking, but Commander Kong could already feel that he wasn’t easy to deal with.","\"Commander Xia...\" Commander Kong wanted to complain. He wanted to use his emotions and reason. Unexpectedly, Commander Xia didn’t cooperate with him. When Commander Xia raised his head, he waved his hand to stop Commander Kong.","\"You can go to the air force headquarters and complain to them. That’s your base. As the commander-in-chief of the army, why do I have to listen to you, an air force division commander, complain. As the saying goes, dirty laundry shouldn’t be aired in public. If you complain to me about your air force in front of me, I’m afraid that the next time I meet the chief of your headquarters, he’ll glare at me until my skin is riddled with holes.\"","Commander Kong touched his forehead and sighed in his heart.","It was said that Commander Xia of the army was a sly old fox. He looked easy to talk to, but it was extremely difficult to gain any advantage from him. He had seen it for himself today.","The words ’dirty laundry shouldn’t be aired in public’ made him speechless.","\"Since you want to borrow her for two days, you can have her for two days. I’ll let my soldier experience and learn from you. Don’t think about anything else. It’s useless.","\"She’s a talent. She needs to stay in my military unit. No matter how good she is, she’s not your soldier. Rest early and don’t dream too much. You’re not young anymore. Don’t dream too much so that you won’t hurt yourself.\"","Commander Kong, who came in high spirits, left in defeat. Commander Xia sent him back to the tent politely. Commander Xia could finally avoid the guard’s nagging and return to the tent openly. He also found his future in-law, Chief Engineer Fu, to ask if everything was going smoothly."]},{"number":4990,"title":"Chapter 4990: Meet","paragraphs":["Mr. Fu, who hadn’t slept for three days and three nights, took off his glasses and dripped eye drops into his sore eyes. Because they were in-laws, Mr. Fu was much more casual. He closed his eyes and smiled tiredly. \"It’s going very smoothly. Everyone is in position. We’re just waiting for the experiment to start tomorrow.\"","Commander Xia was elated. \"That’s good, that’s good. Once the experiment is successful, the air force’s strength will definitely rise to another level.\"","\"Yes, it’ll greatly improve our combat ability in the air. We can expand the precision and large-scale lockdown on the ground. If we really have to fight one day, we have a chance of winning.\"","In an air fight, it was a life-and-death fight between fighter planes and weapons. Just one shot could destroy the opponent’s plane and kill people.","Mr. Fu opened his eyes. His eyes were red as he looked at the conference table. He thought of something, and the tiredness on his face faded a little. \"I heard that my girl is here too. Is she free? I want to see my girl.\"","Why was his girl so outstanding? She even provoked the commander of the air force to snatch her.","When Mr. Fu asked this question, the corners of his lips were raised high.","Commander Xia was happy too. The girl Engineer Fu mentioned was also the girl of the Xia family. However, there was a lack of time. The father and daughter might not be able to see each other.","\"She’s temporarily on loan to the air force. Her schedule is arranged by the air force. I can’t make the decision yet. She’s not far from us. She’s guarding the experimental center. Why don’t we... go over and take a look now?\"","This was a very tempting suggestion. As the chief engineer, Mr. Fu was a very busy man. When he knew that his daughter was at the experimental center, he immediately finished explaining everything. He jumped into the patrol car and brought Commander Xia to see his daughter-in-law.","Mr. Fu could enter and leave the experimental center as he pleased, and Commander Xia could too. The sentry let them in and immediately arranged for soldiers to lead the two leaders to look for the person they were looking for. Hence, Ye Jian, who finally fell asleep, suddenly heard Mr. Fu’s voice and almost thought that she had heard wrong.","When Mr. Fu called her ’girl’ again, Ye Jian swiftly got up. She pulled open her sleeping bag and crawled out. In the blink of an eye, she rushed out of the tent. \"Dad!\"","She shouted happily. When Mr. Fu, who was exhausted, heard his daughter’s voice, his heart felt sweet. He even became energetic. He felt that it wouldn’t be a problem for him to endure for another three days and three nights.","Commander Xia coughed softly and reminded Ye Jian that as her future father-in-law, she couldn’t favor one over the other.","Ye Jian had already rushed out of the tent and pounced on Mr. Fu. Suddenly, she heard another familiar voice. She braked and greeted him respectfully, \"Hello, Commander-in-Chief.\"","Commander Xia didn’t feel good about how she greeted Mr. Fu intimately and him formally. She didn’t need to be respectful with him.","Commander Xia, who wanted to have a daughter and be a kind father, felt sad. The next moment, he saw Ye Jian holding Mr. Fu’s arm and acting cute. Commander Xia couldn’t help but feel frustrated.","It was all Little Six’s fault. He didn’t marry her sooner. If he had married her sooner, he would have become a kind father!","When Ye Jian saw Mr. Fu, she was so surprised that she didn’t feel sleepy at all. She held Mr. Fu’s arm and said, \"Happy New Year.\"","It had been 15 days, but at least she still wished him.","Mr. Fu smiled until his eyes narrowed. He still had to rush back, and he didn’t want to affect Ye Jian’s rest. They chatted for less than half an hour before he left.","Ye Jian was still a little reluctant.","Commander Xia, who managed to occasionally say a few words, was afraid that Mr. Fu would soften his heart and decide to stay. He sighed at Ye Jian and said, \"Your father hasn’t slept for three days and three nights. When he knew that you were here, he rushed over. Don’t chat until too late. Let your father rest early.\"","Ye Jian didn’t dare to have him stay any longer. She quickly asked Mr. Fu to go back and rest. Mr. Fu didn’t want to disturb his daughter either. He smiled and agreed to go back immediately to rest.","Commander Xia still had something on. He asked Mr. Fu to return to the car first. He would go over once he was done with his matter."]},{"number":4991,"title":"Chapter 4991: Slandering Her Boyfriend","paragraphs":["Commander Xia had something to say to Ye Jian alone. Before Mr. Fu left, he hugged Ye Jian lightly and said something. Commander Xia saw his future daughter-in-law nodding vigorously. The relationship between the father and daughter was so good that Commander Xia was envious.","Why didn’t he have a daughter?","Ye Jian was so good and considerate. She could even act coquettishly to her father. If a young brat were to bully her outside, as a father, he would roll up his sleeves and teach the young brat a lesson. Just thinking about it made him happy!","Unfortunately, he only had one son. He didn’t act coquettishly, and there was no way he would be bullied outside. He had no place to express his fatherly love.","It wasn’t easy for him to have a daughter-in-law. It wasn’t easy for him to remind his daughter-in-law to look for him if she was ever bullied. In the end... his daughter-in-law’s real father appeared. As her future father-in-law, he had to stand aside obediently. He couldn’t show his jealousy.","Commander Xia looked at Mr. Fu’s back view as he left. Then, he saw Ye Jian’s reluctant gaze and reddened eyes. The sight stung his heart.","In the future, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan should give birth to a daughter. Having a granddaughter was good. A granddaughter would be obedient. The Xia family lacked granddaughters the most!","Mr. Fu looked back three times as he walked away. He even waved at Ye Jian. As for Ye Jian, she was even worried that Mr. Fu wouldn’t see her, so she tiptoed and waved back. Before she could put down her arm, she suddenly heard Commander Xia sigh beside her. \"Whenever I leave the house, that brat, Little Six, would never stand in place to send me off. He’ll wave his hand because he wants me to disappear from his sight as soon as possible.\"","He sighed, feeling a little sad. Ye Jian felt sad for Commander Xia and hurriedly said, \"Commander, that’s just how Captain Xia is. He’s not the type to say nice things, but he does express it.","\"I often heard Captain Xia mentioning the things that happened when he was young. He said that the happiest time when he was young was when you came back from the military unit.\"","His words were actually the opposite. When Lieutenant Colonel Xia was young, his unhappiest days were when... Regimental Commander Xia came back from the military unit. That was because as long as Regimental Commander Xia came back, he would be beaten up.","Commander Xia didn’t just hit him lightly. He hit him fiercely with his belt.","As a result, when the current Lieutenant Colonel Xia mentioned the past, he would feel a burning pain on his back. He lamented that the trauma of his childhood occupied the entire heart. As a result, nothing could beat the trauma of his childhood.","Commander Xia didn’t believe Ye Jian. \"Let’s not talk about him. If we talk about Little Six, I probably won’t be able to sleep tonight. Don’t speak up for him. I know what he’s capable of. Little Ye, you have to remember what I said before. Don’t put up with it if he bullies you. You have nothing to fear. You just have to tell me, do you understand?\"","Commander Xia was like other father-in-laws. They would only teach their sons a lesson and not blame their daughters-in-law.","Facing such a good future father-in-law, Ye Jian was under a lot of pressure. Was Captain Xia a bastard who would bully his wife in her future father-in-law’s eyes?","As his girlfriend, Ye Jian sympathized with her boyfriend.","It wasn’t easy for Captain Xia either. He always had a father who liked to discredit him. It was all thanks to him that he managed to keep his girlfriend. If it were someone else, they might have left immediately after Commander Xia opened his mouth!","Ye Jian replied respectfully, \"Don’t worry. I can still put up a fight. If Captain Xia really bullies me, I’ll train with him. If I lose, I’ll look for you to support me. If I win, I’ll look for you to praise me.\"","She had already figured out the ways to make Commander Xia happy. After interacting with him for a few years, Ye Jian had already gained some experience.","That was to stand on Commander Xia’s side and defame Xia Jinyuan together!"]},{"number":4992,"title":"Chapter 4992: Remember To Take Medicine","paragraphs":["A few seconds ago, Commander Xia was still feeling lost because he didn’t have a sweet and caring little girl in the family. Now, his face was radiant as if he had taken honey. \"Yes, yes, yes. That’s right. Especially when you go to his team in the future, he’ll have a lot of chances to bully you. Don’t just accept it. Think of a way to rope in your comrades. If he dares to bully you, let his comrades find something for him to do. This is called a roundabout combat. You have to learn how to protect yourself.","Ye Jian stopped sympathizing with Xia Jinyuan. Instead, she started sympathizing with herself.","Ye Jian didn’t forget to get to the main point. Her eyes flickered as she asked, \"Commander, I’ll still stick to the original plan, right? There are no changes, right?\"","\"Nothing has changed. Take care of yourself for the next two months. Whether they can form a female special forces unit depends on themselves,\" Commander Xia reassured Ye Jian. \"The air force also wants to form a female special forces unit, but they have many worries and haven’t implemented anything yet. They’re only borrowing you for the time being. You’ll return to the Vanguard Battalion in a few days.\"","Ye Jian was completely relieved. She knew that she had thought too much.","Her relationship wasn’t discovered, and she wasn’t being transferred to a different military unit. She had just been worried for nothing.","But why did the air force want to borrow people from the army?","Ye Jian wanted to ask, but she swallowed her words. There had to be a reason why the air force came to borrow her. Since the higher-ups had been hiding it from her, she wouldn’t get an answer even if she asked. She couldn’t be impetuous and impatient.","Commander Xia smiled. \"The air force has their own considerations for borrowing people from the army. We just need to cooperate.\"","\"It’s getting late. Go back to the tent and rest. Your father and I should leave too. Don’t send us off. The car is in front. Go back and rest.\"","Ye Jian nodded and returned to the tent obediently.","If she didn’t go back obediently, it would delay her two fathers’ sleep time. It was better to be obedient.","Commander Xia got into the car and said to Mr. Fu, \"In-law, I really envy you for having such an obedient daughter like Little Ye. I told her not to send you off and to go back to the tent to rest, and she really went back obediently. If it were Little Six, he would have fought with me again.","\"In the future, when the couple has children, the granddaughter’s surname will be Xia and the grandson’s surname will be Fu. What do you think?\"","Mr. Fu was a little puzzled when he saw Commander Xia despising sons. \"How many years will it take? Let’s talk about it in the future.\"","There were too many unpredictable variables in the future. They should wait until things got to that point.","\"I’m really not joking. If you don’t believe me, how about this? I’ll let Little Six marry into the Fu family!\" Commander Xia, who despised his son so much that he simply wanted to marry him off, said something astonishing again. Mr. Fu turned his head and asked the guard accompanying him, \"Do you have cold medicine?\"","He was asking the guard accompanying Commander Xia.","The guard, who had been listening to the entire conversation between the two leaders, had a good mental fortitude. His expression didn’t change at all. \"When Commander Kong came over, the commander happened to be taking his medicine. He’s still short of two pills.\"","\"Yes, keep an eye on him when you go back later. Since the military doctor has prescribed medicine, he has to eat what he needs to eat,\" Mr. Fu instructed the guard seriously. \"You can’t deal with it casually. If he catches a cold for too long, his body will be affected.\"","The guard nodded, indicating that he would definitely remember."]},{"number":4993,"title":"Chapter 4993: Tempting","paragraphs":["As for what Mr. Fu meant, the guard said that he really didn’t understand. He only understood that the chief was very concerned about the commander’s health and specially instructed him to take good care of the commander. Mr. Fu wanted the commander to remember to take his medicine on time. If he didn’t, his cold wouldn’t get better. It might even get worse.","Commander Xia felt that his future in-law didn’t trust him yet, which was why he didn’t take his words seriously.","Forget it. At that time, he would naturally know that he was not joking.","How could Mr. Fu take it seriously?","There was no way!","A man from the Xia family marrying into the Fu family? He didn’t dare to think about this. Old Master Xia may not wield a gun anymore, but he could get the kitchen knife to chop Commander Xia up!","Commander Xia thought that he could find some comfort in front of Mr. Fu. Unexpectedly, even Mr. Fu didn’t believe him. Commander Xia, who couldn’t gain his in-law’s understanding, met Major General Yang early in the morning. Before everything started, Commander Xia whispered to his old subordinate, \"Do you believe me when I say that I’ll marry Little Six into his bride’s family?\"","Major General Yang’s first reaction was to look at the guard who was following closely beside the commander. \"Did the commander take his medicine on time? How was the commander’s health last night?\"","Yesterday afternoon, Commander Xia was still having a high fever. The military doctor instructed him to take his medicine on time. If his fever didn’t subside, he had to get an IV drip.","The guard, who had a medicine box with him, replied, \"He took his medicine according to the military doctor’s instructions.\"","They all thought that the commander was still having a fever and needed to take medicine.","Commander Xia frowned and reprimanded, \"What nonsense are you talking about? Am I sick because of what I said?\"","He really did seem sick after saying those things.","Major General Yang smiled. \"This place is different from the capital city. It’s hard to recover in time once you fall sick. I’m just worried that it’ll take longer for you to recover.\"","Major General Yang pretended that he didn’t hear anything about marrying Little Six into his bride’s family.","Commander Xia snorted heavily. \"I really do have that thought. Don’t think that I’m just saying it casually because I’m sick. If he finds out, he’ll definitely be overjoyed to marry into Little Ye’s family. He’ll probably want to wrap himself and deliver himself to them immediately.\"","Actually, that was Xia Jinyuan’s style.","A father knew his son best. Commander Xia knew what Xia Jinyuan would do.","Major General Yang was still worried about the father and son in the past. He was afraid that there would be a conflict between the father and son. Ever since the last conversation, however, Major General Yang knew that he had been worrying for nothing in the past. Hence, he could answer the commander calmly now, \"You can try. The possibility is more than 90%. The other 10% is because of the old madam and old master’s interference.\"","Old Madam and Old Master Xia... Thinking about them, Commander Xia gave up on the idea.","Even if he and Little Six agreed, the old madam and old master wouldn’t. In the end, the old madam and old master would even reprimand and beat them up.","Commander Xia temporarily put this thought aside and planned to find an opportunity to mention it in the future.","Xia Jinyuan woke up early in the morning for training. When he found out later, he was tempted. However, if he mentioned it himself, he would inevitably be beaten up by the old madam and old master. Hence, he asked Commander Xia to mention it.","Commander Xia sneered. If he dared to mention it, Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t have needed to make this request of him in the first place.","Hence, the father and son, who had ulterior motives but didn’t have the guts to act on them, gave up. They didn’t dare to mention the matter of Xia Jinyuan marrying into Ye Jan’s family anymore. They had no choice."]},{"number":4994,"title":"Chapter 4994: Not Fall","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who took off with the airborne military unit, didn’t know that Xia Jinyuan almost married into the Fu family. She sat on the military helicopter and held the sniper rifle she practiced with last night. She looked down at the desert with the airborne soldiers.","The weather today was quite good. The sun had yet to show its rays, and the sky was as clear as a mirror. The cold wind that blew over was still dry and cold. In the distance, there were snow mountains that towered into the clouds. It was the mountain on the other side of the desert. It was vast, spectacular, and majestic.","The landscape was like a painting. Even after looking at it for a long time, one would not feel tired.","Occasionally, the pilot’s notification came from the earpieces, telling the comrades how high they were, how strong the wind was, and the latitude.","They were patrolling in the air now. Once they found anything suspicious on the ground, they would immediately report to the ground and deal with it in time.","Wild camels were the most common in the desert. When the airborne soldiers discovered the traces of wild camels, they had to report it to the ground in time. Once they discovered the tracking devices installed by the camels for research and protection, they would immediately interfere.","This was Ye Jian’s first time participating in such a confidential experiment. She focused on the ground through her scope and followed the airborne soldiers until the afternoon.","In the middle, they passed by the area that Ye Jian was in charge of clearing yesterday. The military helicopter didn’t fly too far. She could even see the camouflage patterns on the tents.","The countdown to the start of the experiment started. Everyone was ready. They were just waiting for the master of engineering, Yu Sheng, to give the order.","\"Ten, nine, eight, seven...\"","Mr. Fu’s calm and serious voice sounded from the earpieces. Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly and slowly pressed her finger on the trigger.","She wasn’t nervous. She just needed to be calm and on standby. She needed to complete her mission so that the special reconnaissance soldiers behind her could reach the ground immediately.","This was a dangerous drill for the airborne soldiers. The bombs were new types of aerial artillery shells that could instantly take human lives. The airborne soldiers would complete their landing amid the sound of explosions.","After landing, Ye Jian had to complete her ground sniping target as soon as possible to clear a path for the airborne soldiers.","\"Get ready.\" Captain Lei’s cold voice was heard. At this moment, Captain Lei didn’t dare to say anything to make Ye Jian relax. If he said such words at such a critical moment, it would only increase the psychological pressure.","He might as well not say anything.","Also, based on Ye Jian’s performance last night, Captain Lei felt that there was no need for him to say anything.","\"Three, two, one... Fire!\"","After Mr. Fu finished speaking, a huge object suddenly shot up into the sky with a long tail of fire. Countless technical soldiers in the control center operated the keyboards and various instruments in their hands. Data analysis, including oxygen, pressure, air pressure, and a series of other data were displayed in time.","Everyone stared at the big screen and the huge object in the sky that was in a parabola. They held their breaths and didn’t even blink.","Ye Jian, who was sitting high in the sky, saw a fire dragon that seemed to be able to destroy the world suddenly soar into the sky. It flashed across the sky with a stinging light and headed straight for the target.","\"Follow up!\"","Before the flames disappeared, Captain Lei gave his order again. The three military helicopters chased after the flames like brave soldiers.","\"Airborne troops, get ready. Advance and follow up!\"","\"Roger, copy!\"","The armed helicopters rumbled closely and followed in a progressive manner, always maintaining a safe distance.","The drill needed to be carried out. Similarly, safety needed to be ensured!"]},{"number":4995,"title":"Chapter 4995: Unparalleled","paragraphs":["Boom!","A huge explosion sounded. The ground shook as if the world was about to collapse. At the same time, Ye Jian saw grayish-white smoke rising from the mountain range in front of her. It swept along the ground with a destructive force and instantly swallowed a few low hills.","The power of the airwaves was huge. Even though the three military helicopters were flying at the safest distance, the airwaves still shook the fuselage. At that moment, Ye Jian even had the illusion that the fuselage would disintegrate.","The violent trembling of the fuselage made Ye Jian quickly retract her finger that was gently holding the trigger. She stared straight ahead with her bright eyes until her vision suddenly turned blurry.","The helicopter was swallowed by the thick fog that was soaring in the sky. The ground guidance device and radar device indicated the direction, ensuring that the helicopters could navigate smoothly in the thick fog.","At this moment, applause from the control center surged like a tide. On the huge screen, it showed that the missile had hit its target accurately. The accuracy was at the highest level. There was no deviation, no error!","Success!","The experiment was a success!","Mr. Fu didn’t sleep for three days and three nights. He only slept for a while at 3:00 am this morning. He looked at the thick fog rising from the mountain range. At that moment, Mr. Fu’s heart was unexpectedly calm.","He hadn’t wasted the country’s resources, hadn’t let down the country’s expectations, and hadn’t wasted the hard work of all the soldiers in the base. The research and development that lasted for five years finally succeeded!","Modern warfare was no longer just ordinary guns and cannonballs. As humans continued to fight, the military power of various countries also advanced at a speed that ordinary people didn’t know about. New types of guidance weapons appeared batch by batch. No one dared to fall behind, and no one dared to stay in place. Times were changing, and wars were changing too. If they fell behind, they would be beaten. This was an unchanging truth!","How could China fall behind when other countries developed new weapons?","Originally, they were far behind. Now that they were in the 21st century, if they continued to fall behind, history would repeat itself!","Soldiers guarded the country. On the other hand, researchers and scientists developed new weapons to build high walls for the country. Outside the high walls, there might be flames of war. Inside the high walls, all they could hope for was peace and prosperity!","The success of the experiment was felt by countless soldiers in the base who had never fought before. The soldiers who had not seen their families for many years were filled with tears. Some soldiers even hugged each other tightly and gritted their teeth to celebrate their victory.","Commander Xia walked in front of Mr. Fu and saluted this scientist who had spent most of his life in the base on behalf of the country and the people.","Weapons were a combination of attack and defense. As new military reforms were developed, war was no longer as simple as a battle between flesh and blood. The informationized army won the informationized war and had long become the main goal of the development of military power in various countries around the world.","China had already lagged behind the Western countries for many years. Now was the time to catch up. The development of informational weapons and equipment using information technology was also the main goal of China’s military power.","As for Mr. Fu and countless scientists like him, shouldered the mission of promoting information warfare for this generation or decades. They didn’t eat or sleep as they sacrificed themselves. They didn’t care about their families and only cared about the country. They worked hard for national defense as their lifelong goal and worked hard for the rise of the great country until the end of their lives.","Commander Xia’s salute was to countless scientists like Mr. Fu who sacrificed themselves for their country. They remained unknown as they worked diligently without being moved by the prosperity of the outside world. They carried the country’s back and promoted national progress. They remained unknown until they were old and gray...","This was a show of respect to these national warriors!"]},{"number":4996,"title":"Chapter 4996: Cruel","paragraphs":["The experiment was a success. Everyone in the control center, from the lieutenant general to the sergeants, was overjoyed. However, no matter how happy they were, they didn’t let their joy show. They kept it in their hearts.","Outside, the soldiers at the sentry post were overjoyed as well, but their facial expressions were similarly cold and inviolable. They held their guns tighter and steadily. Their current position was the place they swore to protect. They would do their best to carry the responsibility of their military uniforms and guns.","As soldiers, they had different responsibilities and goals. They were all fighting for the prosperity of their country.","In the air, there was also a group of warriors who were not afraid of sacrifice. The experiment was successful, and their test had just arrived.","The military helicopter that rushed into the thick fog rose into the sky at a 15-degree angle. The pilot was familiar with operating the aircraft. His fingers were fiddling with various switches and buttons. At the same time, he kept reporting the current flying data.","\"Up 300 feet at 15 degrees, route changed. Turning left.\"","\"Pilot 2, received. 300 feet up, route changed. Turning left!\"","\"Pilot 3, received. Incoming flight.\"","\"All teams, get ready. Look for ground targets! Helicopter 1, take the lead. Sniper One, get ready.\"","\"Sniper 1, received.\" This was Ye Jian’s voice. She was the sniper.","\"Execute the big G-value maneuver.\" The pilot operated the compass, and the horizontal rolling needle moved to the right. The entire military helicopter made a complete right-angle turn and completed the dive.","Ye Jian, the sniper, found her target on the ground. The thick fog was too thick, and the wind was too strong. She needed to continue descending until she was 300 meters away from the ground.","A small corner under the huge screen of the main control center instantly occupied the entire screen as the technicians operated it. The three military helicopters entered the eyes of the chiefs of the main control center.","The thick fog continued to roll. Although the new missile had successfully launched, the threat didn’t dissipate immediately. Commander Kong changed from sitting to standing and stared at the three military helicopters. His palms were slightly hot and cold.","He was a little nervous now.","He had already seen the power of the new weapon. It was not an exaggeration to say that its destructive power was like a landslide. However, in order to be able to rush into the battlefield under enemy fire in the future and gain the initiative in combat, his soldiers and warriors rushed into the remaining enemy fire. Whether they will live or die... was unknown.","The real exercise was not to go through the motions. The exercise was cruel, and the death rate was even higher. Three military helicopters flew in, but one might not be able to return safely.","Behind the peace of the country, there would always be people who would shed blood that ordinary people didn’t know about. There would always be people protecting the safety of the country without any regrets.","Mr. Fu stared at the screen intently. He knew about the air force drill. Moreover, he was the one who suggested it. He believed that the warriors who went in would return safely.","However, Mr. Fu didn’t know that his daughter was among the soldiers he was worried about. He didn’t know, but even if he did, he didn’t have the right to interfere or stop them.","Even if he knew, Mr. Fu would obey the arrangements of the higher-ups and not put any pressure on his daughter, Ye Jian.","Among all the soldiers present, only Commander Xia and Major General Yang knew.","No one spoke. Although they were still happy, the soldiers suppressed their joy for the time being. It wouldn’t be too late to celebrate when the warriors returned safely."]},{"number":4997,"title":"Chapter 4997: Tense","paragraphs":["Commander Xia looked at the image with a cold gaze. He knew which military helicopter Ye Jian was sitting in and what responsibility Ye Jian had. An army soldier followed the air force to the sky and even had to pull open the cabin door and shoot accurately on the ground. Who knew how difficult it was? Who knew how dangerous it was?","No one knew how difficult it was, but they knew how dangerous it was.","Whether she was dead or alive was unknown.","As the plane descended to an altitude approaching 300 meters, the tightly closed cabin door opened, and a pitch-black gun barrel extended out. At the same time, a leg with bent knees extended out, with the sole of the foot half hanging in the air and the back of the foot firmly on the edge of the cabin door.","An air force lieutenant beside Commander Kong said in a low voice, \"The sniper has found the target.\"","\"It’s a female soldier from the army’s special forces,\" Commander Kong added. His hands, which were naturally placed on the sides of his body, turned into fists and pressed against the foldable conference table made of light steel. At this moment, Commander Kong’s expression was exceptionally serious.","Would they succeed? Would they be able to parachute in safely?","Ye Jian couldn’t guarantee that she would be able to land safely. She could only ensure that she hit her target and give the soldiers a way out.","She took aim. Her slender fingers, which were wearing combat gloves, pulled the trigger. In the cold wind, the bullets left a small trail of fire. With sharp lethality, they tore through the air toward the ground target.","The air was compressed, and the bullets slashed out a path from the thick fog. Even though the thick fog had not dissipated, the targets on the ground were faintly visible. The bullets seemed to have eyes as they hit their targets.","A rapid beeping sound came from a computer in the main control center. The young soldier guarding the computer reported the current situation, \"The sniper has successfully hit the ground target. All radar jamming devices are activated.\"","All the radar jamming devices were turned on. Green meridians appeared on the back of Commander Kong’s hands that were pressed against the table. His gaze turned colder.","With a long beep, the radar jamming device was activated. The three helicopters lost their radar as if they had lost their eyes. They relied on the pilot’s experience to complete this exercise.","The plane trembled because of the airwaves. Commander Xia clenched his fists tightly. His expression was even colder than Commander Kong’s. There was a female soldier from the special forces groomed by the army for eight years. Nothing could happen to her!","Major General Yang’s throat was tense. He kept staring at the helicopter. When he saw the helicopter trembling, Major General Yang swallowed his saliva. When he saw the helicopter stabilizing, he heaved a sigh of relief.","This exercise made Major General Yang more worried than any other exercise. How could he not worry when a soldier from the army had gone to the air force?","The soldiers from the army was going through life and death with a group of airborne soldiers from the air force. If there was really any danger, Ye Jian’s ability to escape in the air would definitely not be better than the airborne soldiers.","On the other hand, this exercise was a good opportunity for Ye Jian. She had a strong sense of acceptance and an outstanding personal ability. Due to her outstanding results during the navy training, Commander Dong didn’t want to let her go.","Now, Commander Kong had also taken a fancy to Ye Jian’s personal ability and wanted to keep her. Could she... become the number one female soldier in all areas—sea, land, and air?","All his worries had to be suppressed at this moment. Major General Yang couldn’t help but close his eyes after Ye Jian completed her first shot. Very good!","Ye Jian, a female soldier who has never disappointed anyone, did a good job!","At some point in time, Mr. Fu had walked to Commander Xia’s side. He stared at the military helicopter that was flying again on the screen. His voice was a little serious and cold as he asked in a low voice, \"The person who made the shot just now was my daughter, right?\""]},{"number":4998,"title":"Chapter 4998: Good Dad And Bad Dad","paragraphs":["He asked the question affirmatively.","The problem was... Commander Xia, who was extremely puzzled, turned his head. \"Why are you so sure?\"","Mr. Fu’s gaze was fixed on the screen. His side profile was tense, and there was kind fatherly love between his eyebrows. \"Of course, I recognize my daughter.\"","\"It’s indeed Little Ye. You can recognize her just from her knees. When you’re doing scientific research, you’re good at discovering details, right?\"","Commander Xia didn’t hide anything from Mr. Fu. Last night, he brought Mr. Fu to see Little Ye. However, he didn’t tell Mr. Fu what he needed Little Ye to do.","\"Why did she go to the air force military unit as an army soldier?\" Mr. Fu frowned. His gaze was sharp as a blade as he looked at Commander Xia. \"Did something happen?\"","The father’s and daughter’s reaction was the same as if they had discussed it before.","Commander Xia smiled and said, \"There’s no problem. It’s an opportunity for Little Ye. Her future is bright. She can obtain opportunities that many soldiers can’t even get until they retire. To her, it’s training.","\"If you don’t cut a gem, it won’t be good. Little Ye is a piece of beautiful gem. She needs to be carefully carved to emit her true beauty. Don’t think too much. With me around, Little Ye won’t have any problems.","\"Also, Little Ye has an extremely steady personality. She won’t let anything happen to her. Don’t you think so?\"","Seeing that his future in-law’s face was covered in dark clouds, Commander Xia had to quickly coax him.","Mr. Fu was naturally happy that his daughter was complimented.","The capable had more work, and the talented had more responsibility. Mr. Fu was both happy and heartbroken.","\"Sometimes, I really hope that her qualifications are bad and that she’s not so outstanding. Sometimes, I hope that she can walk a good path that she likes. I’m aware of how contradictory I’m being.\" Mr. Fu shook his head and sighed helplessly, but there was a deep sense of pride in his eyes.","That was his daughter. She was outstanding and dared to compete with men. She surpassed countless people her age and left many people in the dust.","He should be happy that his child had attained such achievements.","Raising a daughter was different from raising a son. The parents of a daughter only hoped that their daughters’ lives would be smooth-sailing. Rather than being rich, they just wanted their daughters to be happy.","As for sons, they had to be indomitable husbands who could shoulder burdens and protect their families. Commander Xia had never raised a daughter before, but he had a kind father’s heart that wanted to raise a daughter. When he heard that, he actually resonated with Mr. Fu. \"That’s right. A daughter has to be pampered and doted on. We can’t let the young brats outside snatch her away easily.\"","Mr. Fu, who was filled with emotions, choked. Shouldn’t he be the one with the most right to speak? Why was the commander-in-chief, who had a son, so emotional?","\"Was Little Six adopted?\" If not, why would Commander Xia treat his son like this?","Only Mr. Fu dared to ask this question. Even Major General Yang didn’t dare to say such a thing.","Commander Xia sneered. \"If I adopted him, I would’ve thrown him out long ago. Would I have let him cling to a good girl like Little Ye?\"","Mr. Fu didn’t know if it was because he hadn’t had enough sleep recently, but his head hurt. He rubbed his temples and didn’t talk about Little Six anymore. Instead, he continued talking about his daughter, Ye Jian.","He could tell that the interactions between the Xia father and son was not something ordinary people could understand. They were a unique case, and no one could imitate them. No one could surpass them."]},{"number":4999,"title":"Chapter 4999: Outstanding","paragraphs":["\"Is the military planning to have my daughter train with the air force again? How long will the training take? It will take two to three years to become a division commander. After two to three years, she’ll only be 24 or 25 years old. She’s still young, so we can give it a try.\"","If he could keep his daughter for a few more years, he would keep her for a few more years. He asked his daughter to go to Little Six’s military unit early on. He was very assured that Little Six would take good care of his daughter. However, he felt that Ye Jian would be entering a tiger’s den. He couldn’t bear to let her go.","Although Commander Xia had nothing nice to say about his son, he always knew his limits.","His eyes narrowed slightly. \"It depends on the situation. Little Six’s team has a similar training plan. There’s no need for her to go to the air force for training.\"","His future daughter-in-law was too outstanding. It was not appropriate for the couple to be far apart. It was better to be closer.","The whips of Old Madam Xia and Old Master Xia were not for show. If the young brat complained to the two of them again, Commander Xia would still be whipped by his mother and father despite being in his 60s.","When Mr. Fu heard this, he sneered. The father and son were indeed father and son. No matter how much they liked pulling tricks on each other, they wouldn’t cross the line.","On the screen, the three helicopters, which had no radar navigation and were even affected by electromagnetic interference, started to descend again. This time, the speed of descent was much faster than the first time. It was like a heavy object landing vertically. One could feel the light drift of them losing their center of gravity through the screen.","Ye Jian’s body was light as the military helicopter plummeted. She seemed to have lost her center of gravity, and she was about to float out of the cabin door.","However, the sniper rifle in her hand was very stable.","\"Found the second target.\" Ye Jian, who was observing the ground, discovered the second target. Due to the interference of the radar, the pilot couldn’t confirm how far away they were from the ground. Whether she could hit the target with one shot depended on her own ability.","A sniper had their own way of measuring the distance of their target. Through Ye Jian’s observation of the second target, combined with the pilot’s experience, the helicopter that passed through the thick fog started to descend. The soldiers watching through the big screen held their breaths.","\"How confident are you?\" Captain Lei, who was on the same helicopter as Ye Jian, asked Ye Jian in a deep voice. \"Can you hit it with one shot?\"","She measured, calculated, and aimed until she was done. Ye Jian, whose eyes were close to the scope, responded calmly, \"I’m 100% sure. I always like to hit the target with one shot. If I had to make a second shot, it’d be equivalent to handing half of my life to the enemy. I’m a person who cherishes my life.\"","Ye Jian was extremely confident. There was even a hint of arrogance in her facial expressions. This arrogance came from her confidence.","She was confident. Even if she was a little proud, people would feel that she had the right to be. They wouldn’t think that she was just bragging.","Captain Lei laughed until his chest trembled. The second target was completed. He gave Ye Jian a thumbs-up. The other three soldiers in the helicopter looked at each other and gave this female soldier a thumbs-up too.","\"Machine One has completed the second target shooting...\"","\"Machine One has completed the third target shooting...\"","\"Prepare for airborne... jump!\"","When Ye Jian hit the third target, the three airborne soldiers on the helicopter jumped into the air one after another. The moment they jumped out, they opened their parachutes. Three big parachutes in the thick smoke opened successfully. Next, Ye Jian retreated.","Those going to the ground and those in the air lost contact. The pilot brought Ye Jian out of the thick fog and out of the screen. Ye Jian was no longer the focus. The airborne soldiers who were completing the airborne mission in the thick fog became the focus."]},{"number":5000,"title":"Chapter 5000: Injured","paragraphs":["Although Ye Jian had already left the big screen, her excellent sniping won the applause of the entire audience. She was so outstanding. All soldiers should be like her.","Commander Xia and Major General Yang panted heavily at the same time. They slowly released their clenched fists. It was finally over. She had returned safely.","Mr. Fu didn’t look at the big screen anymore and left quietly.","The research and development staff of the base were still busy outside. When they saw Engineer Fu coming out, they greeted him happily. One of the engineers who participated in the design came up and hugged Mr. Fu hard. \"Let’s go and look at the waste collection. There are a few sets of data that still need to be analyzed. Do you want to come with us?\"","\"Okay, let’s go together.\" Mr. Fu nodded. The waste collection point was a little far away. They needed to take a bus. Mr. Fu, who had originally planned to come out and find out where his daughter would land, turned around and went back to work. He had already put his daughter’s condition aside.","This was the case for researchers. Families were never the biggest priority.","At this moment, the military helicopter that Ye Jian was on was flying to the temporary landing point. Ye Jian, who had retracted her sniper rifle, had just retracted her bent knee when suddenly, she felt a sharp pain in her calf that made all the muscles in her body tremble.","Looking down, Ye Jian’s eyes darkened.","She had a wound on her leg that was caused by a sharp object. The blood that flowed out had frozen into ice when the cold wind blew. Purple-red flesh curled up on the wound, and white bone could be vaguely seen...","Her calf had been cut so deep that her bone could be seen.","The fragment wasn’t big. It was probably only the size of half a fingernail. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have left such a small and deep wound.","Ye Jian knew that they were about to land, so she didn’t alert the pilot. It wasn’t until the military helicopter landed that Ye Jian, who had been holding it in, told the pilot that she was injured and needed the military surgeon’s help.","The pilot was shocked. An aerial injury was not a small injury!","The pilot jumped from the pilot’s seat and rushed to the cabin door. When he saw Ye Jian’s wound, his pupils constricted. \"Don’t move, don’t move! Wait for the military surgeon to come!\"","As a safety measure, there was an ambulance at the temporary landing point and a military surgeon accompanying them.","The radar interference was not all-encompassing. Once the helicopter flew out of the radar range, it could contact the outside world. The pilot immediately contacted the outside world. Soon, the wheels of the ambulance kicked up waves of dust and rushed over.","\"Quick, quick, her right calf is injured. The wound is about one centimeter deep, but the bone can be seen!\" The military surgeon came over, and the pilot told him about Ye Jian’s injury again. The military surgeon, who was holding the first aid kit, bent over and stepped into the cabin.","Ye Jian was injured. The calf bone, along with the skin and flesh, was torn off. A piece of bone the size of a little fingernail was also cut off. The wound was not big, but it looked scary.","Commander Xia’s expression darkened when he knew that Ye Jian was injured. He knew that the situation wasn’t serious. Although a small chunk of her bone had chipped off, it wasn’t fatal and she wouldn’t be crippled. She just needed to rest for about 20 days. Hearing that, his expression improved slightly.","Major General Yang immediately said to the commander-in-chief, \"Let’s not do this kind of thing next time. It’s not Ye Jian’s specialty. The risk is too high.\"","\"We need to increase Ye Jian’s aerial training. Her comrades can even board a company fighter jet. She must do it too!\" Commander Xia gave an order coldly. It was also the first order related to Ye Jian since she joined the service.","As for Mr. Fu, Commander Xia heaved a sigh of relief when he found out that Mr. Fu had driven to collect scraps and probably wouldn’t be back for the entire day.","His daughter was injured right under his eyes. How could Mr. Fu bear with it?","It was lucky that Ye Jian’s wound was treated quickly. Captain Lei and his men learned of Ye Jian’s injury at around seven in the evening. They had just returned from the exercise, so it was already very late."]}]);
